<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Rangi</book>
  <para style="h">Lʉ́ka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lʉ́ka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Masáare Maaja ja ˆvyeene yaandɨkwa nɨ Lʉ́ka</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant: Richard Cox</para>
  <para style="mt1">Masáare Maaja ya Yéesu Kirisitʉ</para>
  <para style="mt2">ja ˆvyeene yaandɨkwa nɨ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lʉ́ka</para>
  <para style="imt">Mʉlongooryo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɨtáabu ɨkɨ chaandɨkwa nɨ Lʉ́ka. Ʉhʉ Lʉ́ka ˆvyeene vyoónekanaa, nɨ Mugiríki ajáa. Kei, nɨ dakitáari ajáa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Vakolosáai 4:14</ref></char>) na nɨ mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na ʉmanyi wo kaasakanʉla masáare ya kalɨ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char>). Lʉ́ka aandɨka kɨtáabu ɨkɨ na kɨtáabu cha Mɨrɨmo ya Vatumwi. Vitáabu ivi vivɨrɨ, Lʉ́ka ajáa amwaandɨkɨra kɨjeengi chaachwe ˆaséwaa Toofíili. Lʉ́ka atʉmamáa mʉrɨmo wo variyʉla Masáare Maaja hamwɨ na Paúli (<char style="xt"><ref loc="XXG 4:11">2 Timotéeo 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Filemóoni 24</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">ˆVyeene vyoónekanaa, Lʉ́ka aandɨka kɨtáabu ɨkɨ kati ya myaaka ya 57-64 keende Kirisitʉ ˆavyaalwa. ˆCheene chabweeyya aandɨke kɨtáabu ɨkɨ, nɨ kʉvoonekya vaantʉ kɨkomi cha Masáare Maaja ya Yéesu kwa vaantʉ voosi, noo kʉsea, kwa Vayahúudi na kwa vaantʉ sɨ ˆvarɨ Vayahúudi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:4">1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24-26">4:24-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:11-19">17:11-19</ref></char>). Ɨkɨ noo ˆchooreka aandɨka ufumo wa lʉkolo lwa Yéesu fʉʉrʉ kwa Adáamu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">3:23-38</ref></char>). Kei, oonekya ˆvyeene Yéesu ajáa heehi na vaantʉ ˆvachwɨ́ɨwaa matɨ, baa ja Vasamaría (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:23-37">10:23-37</ref></char>) na vasaankanʼyi kóodi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">5:27-32</ref></char>). Avanyemyáa vakɨva, na alumiriryáa vasúngaati vandoovaambirirya vakɨva (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:33">12:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:13">14:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:22">18:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:8">19:8</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lʉ́ka aandɨka masáare ˆyarɨ foo ˆmeene yoonekya Masáare Maaja ya Yéesu Kirisitʉ, nɨ sa vaantʉ voosi. Na ivi vyoónekanaa sa ˆvyeene aandɨka masáare ˆyarɨ foo ˆmeene yasiina kwa vaandiki vɨɨngɨ va Masáare Maaja, noo kʉsea, Matáayo, Maáriki na Yooháani. Masáare aya nɨ, mʉʉntʉ muki mʉhéngeeti ˆamʉhaka Yéesu makuta (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 7:36-50">7:36-50</ref></char>), lusímo lwa Mʉsamaría mʉʉja (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:30-37">10:30-37</ref></char>), lusímo lwa taáta ˆajáa na mbavariri kwa mwaana waachwe ˆarɨmɨra (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 15:11-32">15:11-32</ref></char>), lusímo lwa musúngaati na Lasáaro mʉkɨva (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 16:19-31">16:19-31</ref></char>) na masáare ya Sakáayo mʉsaankanʼyi kóodi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:1-10">19:1-10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">ˆVyeene Kɨtáabu ɨkɨ Chagavwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Mʉlongooryo, kʉvyaalwa kwa Yéesu na usinga waachwe <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-2:52">1:1–2:52</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mʉrɨmo wa Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yéesu yoobatisiwa na yooyerwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21–4:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mʉrɨmo wa Yéesu ɨsɨ ya Galiláaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14–9:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mʉrɨmo wa Yéesu mpɨɨndɨ ˆatamanyáa na Yerusaléemu <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51–19:27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mʉrɨmo wa Yéesu múujii wa Yerusaléemu <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-21:38">19:28–21:38</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Inkwya ya Yéesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 22:1-23:56">22:1–23:56</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kʉfʉfʉka kwa Yéesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24:1-53</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Lʉ́ka Yoomwaandɨkɨra Toofíili Masáare ya Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Kwaako Toofíili kɨjeengi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vaandɨka masáare aya ˆyakiimana aha mɨɨtʉ. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Avo vaandɨka aya, ja ˆvyeene tavaɨrwa mbuwo nɨ vara ˆvoona na miiso yaavo keende aho ncholo, na vara ˆvajáa vatʉmami va <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Naanɨ, ˆnkayasimbʉle neeja aya masáare keende ncholo, noona nɨkwaandɨkɨre neejaneeja weewe Toofíili kɨjeengi ˆnɨkʉnyémyaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Jeyyo taanga ʉrɨ kɨkomi cha masáare yoosi ˆʉvariyʉrɨrwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ʉláali na Mʉtwe wa Kʉvyaalwa kwa Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ja <char style="w" lemma="Heróode">Heróode Mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ</char> mʉtemi wa <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char>, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte <char style="w" lemma="Veeneɨsɨ">mweeneɨsɨ</char> wa Ijʉva ʉmwɨ ˆasewáa Sakaría. Ʉhʉ Sakaría nɨ wa mpuka ya veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva va Abíya ajáa. Muki waachwe noo Elisabéeti asewáa. Na yeeye woosi nɨ wa ufumo wa lʉkolo lwa Harúuni ajáa. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Vala Sakaría na Elisabéeti nɨ vawoloki vajáa mbere ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Voovo vatuubáa miiro yoosi ya Ijʉva na ndairiri jaachwe baa mangʼuulo tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Maa kaa, voovo vajáa vasiina vaana tʉkʉ, Elisabéeti nɨ muumba ajáa na voosi vajáa vavɨ́ɨre magarugeeda.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Haaha sikʉ ɨmwɨ, Sakaría atʉmamáa mʉrɨmo wa veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva mbere ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Mpɨɨndɨ ijo nɨ nkalo ya mpuka yaachwe kʉtʉmama <char style="w" lemma="Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva">Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</char> ɨjáa. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Sakaría ajáa asáawɨɨrwe ko vaɨrwa mbare ɨɨngɨre na Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva noo kookuusya ngʼóóno ˆjinyʉ́kɨraa, ja viintʉ tʉʉva ja veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva ˆjijáa jasea. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ Sakaría ˆakuusyáa ngʼóóno ˆjinyʉ́kɨraa ʉko, mpuka ya vaantʉ ɨjáa yiijíingire kʉra waámii yoomʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Aho, <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ miija">murimʉ mʉʉja</char> wa Ijʉva ʉkamʉfʉmɨra Sakaría, ʉkɨɨma ivaru ra kʉlʉme ra masabáahʉ yo kuusirirya ngʼóóno ˆjinyʉ́kɨraa. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Sakaría ˆakamoone ʉra murimʉ mʉʉja, mʉtɨma waachwe ʉkafɨrɨra na akoofa maatʉkʉ vii. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Maa kaa, murimʉ mʉʉja ʉkamʉsea, “Sakaría, koofa tʉkʉ! Mʉlʉʉngʉ atéɨɨre kʉloomba kwaako. Muki waako Elisabéeti kʉvyaarɨra arɨ mwaana mʉlʉme. Irina raachwe ʉmʉkemere Yooháani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Weewe kʉvyeenda ʉrɨ, na kʉva ʉrɨ na cheerʉ. Baa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vaa varɨ siriri sikʉ yo vyaalwa kwaachwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Sa yeeye kʉva arɨ mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ mbere ya Ijʉva, sɨ akanywíire <char style="w">diváai</char> au kɨɨntʉ chochoosi ˆkɨréevyaa vii kaa tʉkʉ. Yeeye kʉmʉhokera arɨ <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char> keende indii ya íyo waavo. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Vahɨndʉla arɨ <char style="w">Viisiraéeli</char> ˆvarɨ foo na kwa Ijʉva Mʉlʉʉngʉ waavo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Ʉwo, longoola arɨ mbere ya Ijʉva, kwa ngururu na mʉtɨma wa <char style="w">Elía</char>. Vahɨndʉla arɨ vala baaba na kwa vaana vaavo. Jeyyo, vahɨndʉla arɨ vara ˆvasiina matu na kʉrɨ tooti ya ʉwoloki na kuviimya arɨ neeja kʉmʉhokera Ijʉva.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Aho, Sakaría akuuyurya ʉwo murimʉ mʉʉja, “Nɨɨnɨ nadálahɨɨre, baa mʉdala waanɨ woosi adálahɨɨre. Joolɨ ndɨrɨ taanga isáare ɨrɨ nɨ ra kɨmáárɨ?” <verse eid="LUK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Aho, maa murimʉ mʉʉja ʉkamuwyɨɨra woosea, “Nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ Gaburiéeli, nɨɨ́maa mbere ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, na yeeye aantúmire nɨkʉwyɨɨre aya masáare maaja. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Haaha sa viintʉ sɨ urúmire aya ˆnakuwyɨ́ɨrɨɨre, dunga ʉrɨ mʉlomo fʉʉrʉ sikʉ ɨra mwaana ˆarɨ vyaalwa. Kɨkomi masáare yaanɨ kiimikiririwa yarɨ mpɨɨndɨ ˆjiri fika!”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, vaantʉ vamʉwoojeráa Sakaría kʉra waámii kʉnʉ vahwáalɨɨre, sa ajáa achérevire kufuma Kaayii Njija. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>ˆAkafume, akava sɨ yoodaha kʉlʉʉsɨka novo tʉkʉ. Aho vakataanga ɨɨ́ne njori mʉra Kaayii Njija, sa nɨ avalaɨráa na mɨkono vii, sɨ yoodaha lʉʉsɨka tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Mpɨɨndɨ jaachwe jo tʉmama Kaayii Njija ˆjikasire, maa akahɨndʉka na kaayii. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Sikʉ ingaɨ vii ˆjikalooke, Elisabéeti muki waachwe akava mawʉlʉ maruto, akiivisa kaayii kwaachwe kwa myeeri ɨsaano kʉnʉ yoosea, <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>“Ijʉva noo ˆmweene aantʉ́mamɨɨre ɨkɨ, yeeye aanaanga sikʉ jira sa aanséyyiirye soni yo dɨɨra kʉva na vaana mbere ja vaantʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ʉláali na Mʉtwe wa Kʉvyaalwa kwa Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>ˆɄkafike mweeri wa sasatʉ keende Elisabéeti ˆakave muruto, Mʉlʉʉngʉ akatʉma murimʉ mʉʉja Gaburiéeli ʉtamanye fʉʉrʉ ituri ra Nasaréeti ˆrɨrɨ ɨsɨ ya <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Ʉko, ʉkatamanya fʉʉrʉ kwa muhíínja ʉmwɨ ˆajáa mʉnjalʉ. Ʉhʉ ajáa atʉmɨrwa nɨ mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆasewáa Yooséefu wa lʉkolo lwa mʉtemi <char style="w">Daúdi</char>. Na irina ra ʉwo muhíínja noo Maríia asewáa. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Murimʉ mʉʉja ˆʉkafike kwa Maríia, maa ʉkamʉsea, “Lʉmbɨ niijo weewe ˆʉheewa nduwo, Ijʉva nɨ na weewe arɨ!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Maríia ˆakateere jeyyo, akahwaalala maatʉkʉ vii, akiiyurya yoosea, “Ɨhɨ lʉmbɨ nɨ ya che?” <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Aho, maa murimʉ mʉʉja ʉkamʉsea, “Maríia, koofa tʉkʉ! Wapátire wʉʉja miiswii ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Teera! Kʉva ʉrɨ muruto, na kʉva ʉrɨ na mwaana mʉlʉme. Irina raachwe mʉkemera ʉrɨ <char style="w">Yéesu</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Yeeye kʉva arɨ mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ, na kaanɨrɨrwa eende Mwaana wa ˆArɨ Mweerimweeri. Ijʉva Mʉlʉʉngʉ kʉmʉheera arɨ ichuumbi ra kɨtemi ra baaba waavo Daúdi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Kwɨɨmɨrɨra arɨ kaaya ya Yaakúupu kwa sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero, na <char style="w" lemma="Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ">Ʉtemi</char> waachwe kʉva ʉrɨ usiina ʉhero.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Maríia akuuyurya ʉra murimʉ mʉʉja, “Ɨrɨ isáare joolɨ rɨrɨ dahɨka, na nɨɨnɨ nkaarɨ sɨ nɨnaseesererwa nɨ mʉʉntʉ mʉlʉme?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Aho, murimʉ mʉʉja ʉkamʉsea, “Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja kʉʉjɨra arɨ, na ngururu ja ˆArɨ Mweerimweeri kʉkʉnɨkɨrɨra jiri. Sa mwaana ˆarɨ vyaalwa, kʉva arɨ mʉʉja na kaanɨrɨrwa eende <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Laanga, baa mʉndʉʉ waako Elisabéeti atɨɨte uruto wa mwaana mʉlʉme mpɨɨndɨ iji ja ʉdala waachwe. Ʉra ˆvamwaanɨrɨráa muumba, ʉhʉ nɨ mweeri wa sasatʉ wa uruto waachwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Sa kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ kisiina sɨ ˆkɨdáhɨkaa tʉkʉ!” <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Aho, Maríia akasea, “Laanga, nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ mʉtʉmami wa Ijʉva, vive kwaanɨ ja ˆvyeene ulúusire.” Aho, maa re ʉra murimʉ mʉʉja ʉkalooka.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maríia Yoodoma noo Muluumbya Elisabéeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Sikʉ ingaɨ vii ˆjikalooke, Maríia akakwaata njɨra, akafweenga na múuji ʉmwɨ ˆʉrɨ ɨsɨ ya viduunda vya Yʉ́ʉda. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Ʉko akɨɨngɨra kaayii kwa Sakaría, akamuluumbya Elisabéeti<figure style="fig" alt="Mary greets Elizabeth" file="CN01609b.tif" size="col" copy="© 1996 David C. Cook" ref="1:40">Maríia yoomuluumbya Elisabéeti</figure>. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elisabéeti ˆakateere lʉmbɨ ya Maríia, mwaana ˆarɨ indii yaachwe akabwɨɨta. Aho, ngururu ja Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja jikamʉʉjɨra Elisabéeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Akalʉʉsa na ngururu yoosea, “Weewe watalariwa kʉlookya vaantʉ vaki voosi, na mʉvyaalwa wa ɨnda yaako atalariwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ ani mpaka íyo wa Mweenevyoosi waanɨ ʉʉje noo kʉʉnaanga? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Laanga, ˆnkateere vii lʉmbɨ yaako, mwaana indii yaanɨ, afɨ́rɨɨre na cheerʉ. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Ʉtalariwa weewe, sa uruma Ijʉva tʉmama arɨ yara ˆakuwyɨɨra.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɨɨ́mbo lo Mʉdʉʉmba Ijʉva lwa Maríia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Aho, maa Maríia akasea,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 1:46"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mʉtɨma waanɨ wamʉbwéeyyiryaa Ijʉva nkongojima,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>kei mʉtɨma waanɨ wavyeéndire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:47">kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ Mʉlamuriri waanɨ,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>sa akwɨɨ́ne kʉsova ngururu kwa mʉtʉmami waachwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Kɨkomi, kwaandɨra haaha, nkolo joosi ja weerʉ kʉʉnyanɨrɨra veende natalariwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>sa Mʉlʉʉngʉ Mweenengururu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">aantʉ́mamɨɨre masáare makʉʉlʉ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">Irina raachwe nɨ riija.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Kʉlaanga na riiso ra wʉʉja kwaachwe kwatámanyaa na kwa vaantʉ ˆvamʉnyémyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">kufuma mbyaala ɨmwɨ fʉʉrʉ yɨɨngɨ.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Yeeye atʉ́mamire masáare makʉʉlʉ kwa mʉkono waachwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">avapásirepasire vara ˆviívaa kɨpeembe mitimii yaavo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Avakíimiirye vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ fuma machuumbii yaavo ya kɨtemi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">na vara ˆvarɨ ɨsɨ aviínwɨɨre.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Vara ˆvarɨ na njala aviikutya viintʉ ˆvyabooha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">maa kaa, vasúngaati avakibirya na mɨkono mɨtʉhʉ.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Amwaámbiriirye Isiraéeli mʉtʉmami waachwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">kʉkʉmbʉkɨra kʉlaha kwaachwe kʉvalaanga arɨ na riiso ra wʉʉja,<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>ja ˆvyeene avalaha vala baaba wiitʉ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">
    <char style="w">Aburaháamu</char> na mbyaala yaachwe kwa sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Ʉko Maríia akiikala na Elisabéeti ja myeeri ɨtatʉ jei, maa de akahɨndʉka na kaayii kwaachwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉvyaalwa kwa Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Mpɨɨndɨ jo kiichʉngʉla Elisabéeti ˆjikafike, akiichʉngʉla mwaana mʉlʉme. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Vakaaya na vandʉʉ vaachwe ˆvakateere ˆvyeene Ijʉva amʉláangire na riiso ra wʉʉja mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, vakava voovyeenda hamwɨ ne.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Sikʉ ya naanɨ keende mwaana ˆavyaalwa ˆɨkafike, vakʉʉja noo mʉtwaala mwaana na <char style="w" lemma="Kɨbawo">kɨbawii</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:59 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="GEN 17:12-14">Ncholo 17:12-14</ref>.</char></note> Vakasaaka vamʉkemere ʉra mwaana Sakaría irina ra taáta waavo. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Maa kaa, íyo waavo akasiita yoosea, “Tʉkʉ! Irina ˆarɨ kaanɨrɨrwa nɨ Yooháani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Novo vakamʉsea, “Amwɨ lʉkolwii lwaanyu kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ nɨ irina ja ɨro tʉkʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Aho, maa kei vakamuurya taáta waavo ko moonekya na mɨkono sa vataange nɨ irina che ˆarɨ mʉkemera. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Sa jeyyo, Sakaría akaloomba kabambari ko kaandɨkɨra, maa akaandɨka jei, “Irina raachwe noo Yooháani.” Aho, maa vaantʉ voosi vakahwaalala. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Hahara, lurimi lwaachwe lʉkachʉngʉlʉka, akaanda lʉʉsɨka yoomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="LUK 1:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Vakaaya voosi va Sakaría vakakwaatwa nɨ woowa. Masáare aya yakeenera ɨsɨ yoosi ya viduunda vya Yudéea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Vaantʉ voosi ˆvateera aya masáare, vakahwaalala na vakatuuba kwiiririkana mitimii yaavo kʉnʉ vookiisea, “Ʉhʉ musinga nɨ arɨ joolɨ arɨ kʉva?” Viiririkanáa jeyyo, sa vajáa vataanga mʉkono wa Ijʉva nɨ ne ʉjáa.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɨɨ́mbo lwa Sakaría</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Aho, Sakaría taáta waala ʉra musinga akapata ngururu ja Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja, akaanda lʉʉsa <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">ʉláali na mʉtwe</char> yoosea,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Adʉʉmbwe Ijʉva Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa Isiraéeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">sa uújire vaambirirya no <char style="w" lemma="Ununuuli">vanunuula</char> vaantʉ vaachwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Atʉhɨ́ɨre Mʉlamuriri ˆarɨ na ngururu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">kufuma ichina ra Daúdi mʉtʉmami waachwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>ja ˆvyeene Mʉlʉʉngʉ alʉʉsa ko tweera valáali na mʉtwe vaachwe keende aho kalɨ,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>kʉtʉlamurirya iise fuma mɨkonwii ya vavɨ viitʉ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">na kufuma mɨkonwii ya voosi ˆvatʉsʉʉla.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Abwéeyyiirye jei koonekya riiso ra wʉʉja kwa vala baaba wiitʉ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">ko kʉmbʉkɨra <char style="w">mʉháko</char> waachwe mʉʉja.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Mʉhákwii ʉwo, amʉlaha Aburaháamu baaba wiitʉ,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>kʉtʉlamurirya arɨ fuma mɨkonwii ya vavɨ viitʉ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">haaha tʉmʉtʉmamɨre yeeye baa woowa tʉkʉ,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>kwa wʉʉja na ʉwoloki mbere yaachwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">sikʉ joosi ja nkaasʉ jiitʉ.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Naawe mwaana waanɨ, kaanɨrɨrwa weende mʉláali na mʉtwe wa ˆArɨ Mweerimweeri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">sa mʉlongorera ʉrɨ Ijʉva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ʉmʉwólorire njɨra yaachwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>na vawyɨɨra ʉrɨ vaantʉ vaachwe mɨryʉʉngʉ ya kʉlamuririwa kwaavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">ko sewa ʉvɨ waavo wasírire.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Kwa njɨra ya kʉlaanga kwaachwe na riiso ra wʉʉja kʉkʉʉlʉ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">kɨweerʉ chaachwe kʉtʉʉjɨra kɨrɨ fuma mweeri,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>sa kɨvamʉrɨkɨre voosi vara ˆviíkalaa kilwiiryii cha murimírimii wa inkwya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">na kɨlongoole majeo yiitʉ na njirii ya mwiikalo mʉʉja.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Yooháani akʉla, akatuuba kʉva na ngururu ja Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja. Akɨɨta kiikala ɨsɨ ya ibaláángʉ, mpaka sikʉ ˆaanda mʉrɨmo mbere ja vaantʉ va Isiraéeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kʉvyaalwa kwa Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matáayo 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Sikʉ ijo, <char style="w">Kaisáari</char> Agúusto mʉtawáala wa weerʉ ya Róoma, ajáa alairirya vaantʉ voosi va ɨsɨ ja ʉtemi waachwe vavalwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Kʉvalwa ʉkʉ noo kʉjáa kwa ncholo mpɨɨndɨ Kireníio ˆajáa gávana wa ɨsɨ ya Síria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Sa jeyyo, vaantʉ voosi vajáa vadoma noo valwa, kɨra mʉʉntʉ múujii kʉʉntʉ lʉkolo lwaachwe ˆlwafuma.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Na sa viintʉ Yooséefu ajáa nɨ wa ichina ra <char style="w">Daúdi</char>, ne akaambʉka fuma múujii wa Nasaréeti, ˆʉrɨ ɨsɨ ya <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>, fʉʉrʉ múuji ˆʉséwaa Betelehéemu, ˆʉrɨ ɨsɨ ya <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Ne ajáa atamanya na ʉko noo valwa hamwɨ na Maríia muhíínja ˆajáa amʉtʉmɨra. Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, Maríia nɨ mawʉlʉ maruto ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ˆvajáa ʉko Betelehéemu, sikʉ ja Maríia jo kiichʉngʉla jikava jafíkire. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Maríia akiichʉngʉla mwaana wa ndaambere wa kɨɨntʉ kɨlʉme. Akamʉkʉnɨkɨrɨra na ɨngo ja kisinga, maa akamʉlaarya mʉlaambwii wo riishirya ngʼoombe, sa vajáa vasóvire nkalo nyuumbii ya vayeni.<figure style="fig" alt="baby Jesus" file="CN01617b.tif" size="col" copy="David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978" ref="2:7">Yéesu mwaana</figure><verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Varíisi na Mirimʉ Miija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Haaha, heehi na aho kʉʉntʉ ˆvajáa uchikʉ ʉwo, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte varíisi ˆvalaangiriryáa makukikuki ya muundi na mburi ʉko mawundii mpɨɨndɨ ja uchikʉ. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Koonka, <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ miija">murimʉ mʉʉja</char> wa Ijʉva ʉkavafʉmɨra, kɨweerʉ cha nkongojima ya Ijʉva kɨkavarɨɨngɨrɨra mavaru yoosi. Aho, vakoofa mpaka vakoololokera. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Maa kaa, murimʉ mʉʉja ʉkavasea, “Koofi tʉkʉ! Laangi, navarétɨɨre masáare maaja ˆyarɨ kʉva cheerʉ kɨkʉʉlʉ kwa vaantʉ voosi. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Sa isikʉ aha múujii wa mʉtemi Daúdi, avyɨ́ɨrwe Mʉlamuriri, noo <char style="w">Masía</char> na Mweenevyoosi. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Na ɨhɨ noo isháara ˆɨrɨ bweeyya mʉmʉtaange: La, kʉmʉshaana mʉrɨ mwaana awɨ́ɨkɨɨrwe ɨngo ja kisinga, aláariiwe mʉlaambwii wo riishirya ngʼoombe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Koonka, mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya mirimʉ miija ya kurumwii ɨkasaangɨra na ʉra murimʉ mʉʉja, ɨkaanda mʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ yoosea,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Nkongojima kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ ˆArɨ Mweerimweeri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">na kʉrɨ weerʉ kʉve na mwiikalo mʉʉja kwa vaantʉ ˆaveenda!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Mirimʉ miija ˆɨkahɨndʉke na kurumwii, maa vara varíisi vakiiwyɨɨra voovo kwa voovo, “Arumi, hendi na Betelehéemu tʉkoone ɨkɨ ˆchafʉ́mɨɨre Ijʉva ˆatʉláɨɨre.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Jeyyo, vakatamanya chaangʉ na Betelehéemu. Kʉra vakamʉshaana Maríia na Yooséefu na mwaana aláariiwe mʉlaambwii. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>ˆVakamoone mwaana, maa vakalʉʉsa masáare ˆmeene vajáa vawyɨ́ɨrɨɨrwe nɨ murimʉ mʉʉja ya ʉwo mwaana kwa vaantʉ. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Na voosi ˆvajáa vateera ayo, vakahwaalala kwa ayo masáare ˆvajáa vawyɨ́ɨrɨɨrwe nɨ avo varíisi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Maa kaa, Maríia akayakwaatya na andookiiririkana ayo masáare yoosi mutimii waachwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Vara varíisi vakahɨndʉka kʉnʉ voomʉbweeyyirya Mʉlʉʉngʉ nkongojima, sa ayo masáare yoosi ˆvajáa vatéɨɨre na ˆvajáa vɨɨ́ne fuma kwa mirimʉ miija.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Sikʉ inaanɨ ˆjikafike, vakamuwyiirya <char style="w" lemma="Kɨbawo">kɨbawii</char> mwaana na vakamʉheera irina <char style="w">Yéesu</char>. Ɨrɨ irina noo rɨra ˆajáa aheewa nɨ murimʉ mʉʉja de íyo waavo ave muruto.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yootwaalwa na Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Sikʉ jo kiijirʉla vala Yooséefu na Maríia ja ˆvyeene <char style="w">Miiro</char> ya Mʉ́sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LEV 12:2-8">Valáawi 12:2-8</ref>.</char></note> yalairirya, jikafika. Vakamʉtwaala mwaana na Yerusaléemu sa vamʉvɨɨke <char style="w">mʉháko</char> kwa Ijʉva, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>ja ˆvyeene vyaandɨka Miirwii ya Ijʉva, “Kɨra mwaana wa kɨɨntʉ kɨlʉme wa ndaambere vɨɨkwa arɨ mʉháko kwa <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char>.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 13:2">Ufumo 13:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 13:15">15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Kei, vajáa vadoma noo toola <char style="w">mpóryo</char> ja ˆvyeene Miiro ya Ijʉva yalʉʉsa, “Mʉtoole haramu ivɨrɨ au makɨ́ɨnda yavɨrɨ ya nkúnde.”<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ʉláali na Mʉtwe wa Simeóoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Haaha, aho Yerusaléemu kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆasewáa Simeóoni. Ʉhʉ, nɨ mʉwoloki ajáa na amutuubáa Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Yeeye, amʉloombáa Mʉlʉʉngʉ kɨra siikʉ, na kei iilaangyáa Masía kʉʉja arɨ na tuurya arɨ mʉtɨma <char style="w" lemma="Viisiraéeli">Isiraéeli</char>. Simeóoni alongoolwáa nɨ <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja ajáa amʉtʉʉnʉkʉrɨra sɨ arɨ kukwya tʉkʉ, mpaka amoone Masía wa Ijʉva. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Kʉnʉ yoolongoolwa nɨ Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja, Simeóoni ajáa atamanya na waámii wa <char style="w">Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva</char>. Ʉko Yooséefu na Maríia vajáa vamʉtwáarire mwaana waavo Yéesu na Kaayii Njija ja ˆvyeene Miiro yalʉʉsa. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Aho, Simeóoni akamʉhokera mwaana mɨkonwii yaachwe, maa akamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ yoosea,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Haaha ee Ijʉva Mweeneevyo weemweene, rekera mʉtʉ́mwa waako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">asuukye na wʉʉja, ja ˆvyeene ʉlʉʉsa.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Sa miiso yaanɨ yɨɨ́ne ʉlamuriri waako.<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Ʉlamuriri wʉʉvɨɨka mbere ya vaantʉ voosi.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Ʉhʉ kʉva arɨ kɨweerʉ ˆkɨrɨ koonekya Mʉlʉʉngʉ kwa vaantʉ sɨ ˆvarɨ <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">kei yeeye nɨ nkongojima kwa vaantʉ vaako Viisiraéeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Masáare ˆyajáa yalúusirwe nɨ Simeóoni kʉrɨ musinga, yakavahwaalarya vala taáta na íyo waavo. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Aho, Simeóoni akavatalarya, maa akamʉsea Maríia, “Laanga, mwaana ʉhʉ bweeyya arɨ vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo va Isiraéeli vawye na ˆvarɨ foo viinʉke. Yeeye kʉva arɨ isháara ˆɨrɨ siitwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Jeyyo, miiririkano ya vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo yiivariyʉle. Naawe mweeneevyo, nyaasʉka tʉʉnga ɨrɨ mʉtɨma waako.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ʉláali na Mʉtwe wa Áana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Haaha, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> wa kɨɨntʉ kiki ˆasewáa Áana, mwaana wa Fanʉéeli wa lʉkolo lwa Ashéeri. Yeeye ajáa avɨ́ɨre ibaasʉka. Áana ajáa aloolwa na ajáa iikala na mʉlʉme waachwe kwa myaaka mufungatɨ, maa mʉlʉme waachwe akawulala. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Keende aho, akava mʉlala na ajáa afíkiirye myaaka makumi yanaanɨ na ɨne (84). Kwa mpɨɨndɨ joosi kʉʉntʉ ˆavijáa, nɨ Kaayii Njija uchikʉ na muusi yoomwiinamɨra Mʉlʉʉngʉ, no mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, kʉnʉ iirékiirye kurya. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ jiijo kati Simeóoni ˆalʉʉsɨkáa na Yooséefu na Maríia, Áana akʉʉja, akaanda mʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ na akaanda lʉʉsa masáare ya ʉwo mwaana kwa vaantʉ voosi vara ˆvawoojeráa <char style="w" lemma="Ununuuli">kununuulwa</char> kwa Yerusaléemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yooséefu na Maríia Voohɨndʉka na Nasaréeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Yooséefu na Maríia ˆvakamarikirye masáare yoosi ˆyasaakwa nɨ Miiro ya Ijʉva, maa vakahɨndʉka na ɨsɨ ya Galiláaya fʉʉrʉ meevo múujii wa Nasaréeti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Musinga ne akakʉla, akava na ngururu, akakɨɨngɨka tooti na nduwo ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ nɨ na yeeye ɨjáa.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kɨra mwaaka, Yooséefu na Maríia vadomáa na Yerusaléemu na <char style="w" lemma="Ngovi ya Paásika">ngovii ya Paásika</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yéesu ˆakafikye myaaka ikimi na ɨvɨrɨ, vakaambʉkanʼya ne na ngovii ja ˆvyeene viijʉvɨra. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Ngovi ya Paásika ˆɨkasire, maa Yooséefu na Maríia vakakwaata njɨra voohɨndʉka na kaayii, Yéesu akachaala Yerusaléemu baa voovo taanga tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Maa kaa, sa viintʉ voovo viiseáa Yéesu amwaarɨ aho ikukikukii, vakayeenda lʉyeendo lwa sikʉ ɨmwɨ. Aho, vakaanda kʉmʉsaakɨra kwa vandʉʉ vaavo na kwa vijeengi vyaavo.<verse eid="LUK 2:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>ˆVakamʉsove, vakalamʉla vahɨndʉke na Yerusaléemu kʉnʉ voomʉsaakɨra. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Sikʉ itatʉ ˆjikalooke, vakamʉshaana Kaayii Njija, kʉnʉ iíkyɨɨre katɨ na katɨ ya <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> yoovateerera na yoovuurya viintʉ ˆvalʉʉsáa. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Vaantʉ voosi ˆvateeráa ˆvyeene Yéesu uuyiryáa na mʉryʉʉngʉ ˆajáa nowo, vakahwaalala.<verse eid="LUK 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Yooséefu na Maríia ˆvakamoone, maa vakahwaalala. Íyo waavo akamʉsea, “Mwanawaanɨ, sa che kʉtʉbweeyyirya jei? Laanga, nɨɨnɨ na taáta waanyu tatʉ́rɨkɨɨre maatʉkʉ vii tookʉsaakɨra.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yeeye akavasea, “Sa che mwakʉnsaakɨra? Sɨ mootaanga nasaakwa mbeere nyuumbii ya Taáta tʉkʉ wʉʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Maa kaa, sɨ vataanga ˆcheene avawyɨɨráa tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Aho, akahɨndʉkanʼya novo na Nasaréeti na akava matu sikʉ joosi. Maa kaa, íyo waavo akayakwaatya ayo yoosi mutimii waachwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yéesu akatuuba kʉla na akava na tooti, kʉnʉ yoomweerya mʉtɨma Mʉlʉʉngʉ na vaantʉ.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji Yoomwiimirya Njɨra Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matáayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maáriki 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yooháani 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Haaha, ʉjáa wafíkire mwaaka wa ikimi na ɨsaano (15) wa ʉtemi wa <char style="w">Kaisáari</char> Tiberío. Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, Poontío <char style="w">Piláato</char> noo ajáa gávana wa ɨsɨ ya <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Heróode">Heróode Antípaasi</char> noo ɨɨmɨrɨráa ɨsɨ ya <char style="w">Galiláaya</char> na Filíipi mwaanaavo na Heróode noo ɨɨmɨrɨráa ɨsɨ ya Ituréa na ɨsɨ ya Tirakoníiti na Lisanía noo ɨɨmɨrɨráa ɨsɨ ya Abiléene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Kei mpɨɨndɨ ijo, Anáasi na Kayáafa noo vajáa <char style="w" lemma="Veeneɨsɨ">veeneɨsɨ vakʉʉlʉ</char>. Isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ rɨkamʉʉjɨra Yooháani mwaana wa Sakaría ʉko ɨsɨ ya ibaláángwii. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yooháani adomáa na nkaande joosi ja lʉʉjɨ lwa Yorodáani, yoovariyʉla <char style="w" lemma="Batisa">ʉbatíiso</char> wa vaantʉ <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">kʉvalandʉka</char> fuma uvii waavo, sa Mʉlʉʉngʉ asee, ʉvɨ waavo wasírire. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Ja ˆvyeene Ijʉva alʉʉsa kɨtáabwii cha Isáaya <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> waachwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Mʉʉntʉ yookaanɨrɨra vikʉlʉkʉʉlʉ ɨsɨ ya ibaláángwii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Imyi neeja njɨra sa <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char>.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Wololi njɨra ˆngʼeene arɨ tweera.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Kɨra nkuruwo fʉkɨrwa ɨrɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">kɨra lʉʉlʉ na kiduunda yaaniririwa viri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Njɨra ˆjawoda wololwa jiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">na jira ˆjabonkoka yaaniririwa jiri.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Na vaantʉ voosi koona varɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:6">ʉlamuriri wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.’”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isáaya 40:3-5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Haaha vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vʉʉjáa na kʉrɨ Yooháani sa avabatise. Yooháani avawyɨɨráa yoosea, “Eri, nyuunyu mbyaala ya nyororooda! Nɨ ani ˆavalúmire kutu mʉtɨɨje nkalari ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ ˆyookʉʉja? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Tʉmami mɨrɨmo ˆɨrɨ koonekya kɨkomi mwaválandukire fuma uvii waanyu. Reki kwiiririkana mitimii yaanyu, ‘<char style="w">Aburaháamu</char> nɨ taáta wiitʉ!’ Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, Mʉlʉʉngʉ ifaanaa avalandʉle mawye aya yave vaana va Aburaháamu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Baa haaha, chaarya chavíikirwe miririi ya kɨra mʉtɨ. Kɨra mʉtɨ sɨ ˆʉtʉ́ʉngaa ndɨɨwa ˆjabooha, temwa ʉrɨ na fweitɨrwa ʉrɨ iviivii ra mooto.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Aho, ɨra mpuka ya vaantʉ ɨkamuurya, “Haaha nɨ che tʉrɨ bweeyya?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Yooháani akavasea, “ˆArɨ na nkáancho ivɨrɨ, amʉheere ɨmwɨ ʉra ˆasiina, na ʉra ˆarɨ na chóorya abweeyye viivyo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>
    <char style="w">Vasaankanʼyi kóodi</char> novo vakʉʉja sa vabatisiwe, maa vakamuurya Yooháani, “Mukiindya na suusu tasaakwa tʉbweeyye joolɨ?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Ne akavasea, “Karɨ mʉsʉ́mʉlaa kʉlookya vira ˆvyeene <char style="w">Miiro</char> yaruma tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Valwi nkoondo novo vakamuurya voosea, “Ha suusu nɨ che tʉrɨ bweeyya?” Yooháani akavasea, “Karɨ muvúulaa mʉʉntʉ viintʉ vyaachwe tʉkʉ, na karɨ mʉkóovereryaa sa mʉpate mpía ja mʉhonyo tʉkʉ, maa kaa, ikinkimi na mɨsáala yaanyu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Vaantʉ vara ˆvaawoojera kʉʉja kwa <char style="w">Masía</char> mpɨɨndɨ ijo, voosi viiseáa mitimii yaavo ifaanaa ɨkava Yooháani noo Masía. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Aho, maa Yooháani akavasea vaantʉ voosi, “Nɨɨnɨ vabatisa niise na maaji. Maa kaa, amwaarɨ yookʉʉja nyuma yaanɨ ˆarɨ na ngururu kʉlookya nɨɨnɨ, nɨɨnɨ sɨ ndɨrɨ daha baa tʉmama mʉrɨmo wa mʉtʉ́mwa, wo reherya nkova ja mirunkumo yaachwe tʉkʉ. Yeeye vabatisa arɨ na <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char> na mooto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Saama yaachwe yo keerera akwáatire mɨkonwii yaachwe. Iímire neeja kʉfyaahɨra lʉʉha lwaachwe, ajiinge ngáano kyoomii maa kaa, mukúúnku achɨmɨke mootwii sɨ ˆurímaa.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Kwa masáare ayo na yɨɨngɨ ˆyarɨ foo, Yooháani avalʉmáa kutu vaantʉ, mpɨɨndɨ ˆavavariyʉrɨráa <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char>.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Maa kaa, Yooháani ˆakamʉdalavye mʉtemi Heróode Antípaasi sa viintʉ ˆajáa amʉsʉmʉla Herodía muki wa mwaanaavo, na sa mavɨ yɨɨngɨ ˆatʉmamáa, <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Heróode akoongererya ʉvɨ wɨɨngɨ ko muchuunga mʉnyololwii Yooháani.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoobatisiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matáayo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maáriki 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ mpɨɨndɨ Yooháani ˆajáa akaarɨ yeekerwa, vaantʉ voosi ˆvakahʉmʉle batisiwa, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ne akabatisiwa. Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆaloombáa, kurumu kʉkaatʉka dwee. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ akakiima mweeri yaachwe arɨ ja nkúnde. Aho, sawúti ɨkafuma kurumwii, yoosea, “Weewe ʉrɨ Mwaana waanɨ. Nakweenda, neeriwa mʉtɨma mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ nɨ weewe.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lʉkolo lwa Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matáayo 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yéesu ajáa afíkiirye myaaka makumi yatatʉ (30) de akaanda mʉrɨmo waachwe. Na vaantʉ viiririkanáa yeeye nɨ mwaana wa Yooséefu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yooséefu nɨ mwaana wa Éeli ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Éeli nɨ mwaana wa Matáati ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Matáati nɨ mwaana wa Láawi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Láawi nɨ mwaana wa Méliki ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Méliki nɨ mwaana wa Yanái ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Yanái nɨ mwaana wa Yooséefu ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yooséefu nɨ mwaana wa Matatía ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Matatía nɨ mwaana wa Amóosi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amóosi nɨ mwaana wa Nahúumu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Nahúumu nɨ mwaana wa Ésili ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Ésili nɨ mwaana wa Nagáai ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Nagáai nɨ mwaana wa Máati ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Máati nɨ mwaana wa Matatía ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Matatía nɨ mwaana wa Semeíini ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Semeíini nɨ mwaana wa Yoséeki ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Yoséeki nɨ mwaana wa Yóoda ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yóoda nɨ mwaana wa Yoanáani ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Yoanáani nɨ mwaana wa Réesa ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Réesa nɨ mwaana wa Serubabéeli ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Serubabéeli nɨ mwaana wa Searitiéeli ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Searitiéeli nɨ mwaana wa Néeri ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Néeri nɨ mwaana wa Méliki ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Méliki nɨ mwaana wa Áadi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Áadi nɨ mwaana wa Kosáamu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosáamu nɨ mwaana wa Elimadáamu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Elimadáamu nɨ mwaana wa Éeri ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Éeri nɨ mwaana wa Yooshʉ́a ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Yooshʉ́a nɨ mwaana wa Elieséeri ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Elieséeri nɨ mwaana wa Yoríimu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Yoríimu nɨ mwaana wa Matáati ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Matáati nɨ mwaana wa Láawi ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Láawi nɨ mwaana wa Simeóoni ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simeóoni nɨ mwaana wa Yʉ́ʉda ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yʉ́ʉda nɨ mwaana wa Yooséefu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yooséefu nɨ mwaana wa Yonáamu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yonáamu nɨ mwaana wa Eliakíimu ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliakíimu nɨ mwaana wa Meléa ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Meléa nɨ mwaana wa Méena ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Méena nɨ mwaana wa Matáasa ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Matáasa nɨ mwaana wa Nasáani ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Nasáani nɨ mwaana wa <char style="w">Daúdi</char> ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Daúdi nɨ mwaana wa Yéese ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Yéese nɨ mwaana wa Obéedi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Obéedi nɨ mwaana wa Boáasi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Boáasi nɨ mwaana wa Salimóoni ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Salimóoni nɨ mwaana wa Nashóoni ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nashóoni nɨ mwaana wa Aminadáabu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aminadáabu nɨ mwaana wa Adimíini ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Adimíini nɨ mwaana wa Aráamu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aráamu nɨ mwaana wa Hesiróoni ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Hesiróoni nɨ mwaana wa Peréesi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Peréesi nɨ mwaana wa Yʉ́ʉda ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yʉ́ʉda nɨ mwaana wa Yaakúupu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yaakúupu nɨ mwaana wa Isaka ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Isaka nɨ mwaana wa Aburaháamu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Aburaháamu nɨ mwaana wa Téera ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Téera nɨ mwaana wa Nahóori ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nahóori nɨ mwaana wa Serúugi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Serúugi nɨ mwaana wa Réeu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Réeu nɨ mwaana wa Peléegi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Peléegi nɨ mwaana wa Ebéeri ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Ebéeri nɨ mwaana wa Sáala ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Sáala nɨ mwaana wa Kenáani ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kenáani nɨ mwaana wa Arɨfakisáadi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Arɨfakisáadi nɨ mwaana wa Shéemu ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Shéemu nɨ mwaana wa Nʉ́hʉ ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Nʉ́hʉ nɨ mwaana wa Lámeki ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lámeki nɨ mwaana wa Mesuséela ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mesuséela nɨ mwaana wa Enóoki ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Enóoki nɨ mwaana wa Jeráadi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Jeráadi nɨ mwaana wa Mahalaléeli ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalaléeli nɨ mwaana wa Kenáani ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kenáani nɨ mwaana wa Enóoshi ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enóoshi nɨ mwaana wa Séeti ajáa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Séeti nɨ mwaana wa Adáamu ajáa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">na Adáamu nɨ mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooyerwa nɨ Irimʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matáayo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maáriki 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> kʉnʉ ahókɨɨre <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char>, akahɨndʉka fuma luujii lwa Yorodáani. Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja akamʉtwaala fʉʉrʉ ɨsɨ ya ibaláángwii. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Ʉko Ikʉ́ʉ́lʉ ra <char style="w">Mirimʉ Mɨvɨ</char> rɨkamʉyera Yéesu kwa sikʉ makumi yanɨ (40). Na kwa sikʉ joosi ijo sɨ arijáa kɨɨntʉ chochoosi tʉkʉ, aho akiiteera njala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Aho, Ikʉ́ʉ́lʉ ra Mirimʉ Mɨvɨ rɨkamʉsea, “Koonɨ ʉrɨ <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>, lairirya iwye ɨrɨ rɨve mʉkáate.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yéesu akuuyirya, yoosea, “Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho yalʉʉsa jei, ‘Mʉʉntʉ sɨ arɨ kʉva nkaasʉ kwa vyóorya vii tʉkʉ.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 8:3</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Ikʉ́ʉ́lʉ ra Mirimʉ Mɨvɨ rɨkamʉtwaala Yéesu na haantʉ ˆhiinʉka harɨ ncholwii. Ʉko, rɨkamʉlaɨra kwa mpɨɨndɨ nduudi ntemi ja weerʉ yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Ikʉ́ʉ́lʉ ra Mirimʉ Mɨvɨ rɨkamʉsea, “Kʉheera ndɨrɨ nkongojima ya ntemi jaavo joosi na wiimiriri waavo, sa nkongojima na wiimiriri wa ntemi iji joosi naheewa nɨɨnɨ na ifaanaa nkamʉheera yoyoosi ˆnoosaaka. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Haaha koonɨ wuunyinamɨɨre, ivi vyoosi kʉva viri vyaako.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yéesu akuuyirya, yoosea, “Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho yalʉʉsa jei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">‘Mwiinamɨre <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ waako vii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">na ʉmʉtʉmamɨre yeemweene vii.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 6:13</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Rɨkamʉtwaala Yéesu fʉʉrʉ múujii wa Yerusaléemu, ncholwiinchoolwii ya mʉnáara wa <char style="w">Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva</char>, maa rɨkamʉsea, “Koonɨ weewe ʉrɨ Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, ifweite na ɨsɨ fuma aha. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Sa Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho yalʉʉsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Mʉlʉʉngʉ tʉma arɨ <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ miija">mirimʉ yaachwe miija</char> ɨkʉlamurirye,<verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>yooyo kʉkwaatɨrɨra ɨrɨ mɨkonwii yaavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">sa karɨ ijeo raako jɨ riikunguvale iwyii tʉkʉ.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Sabúuri 91:11-12</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yéesu akuuyirya, yoosea, “Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho yalʉʉsa jei, ‘Karɨ ʉmʉyéraa <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ waako tʉkʉ.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 6:16</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Ikʉ́ʉ́lʉ ra Mirimʉ Mɨvɨ ˆrɨkahʉmʉle kʉmʉyera Yéesu kwa njɨra joosi ijo, maa rɨkamʉreka kwa mpɨɨndɨ.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookaanda Mʉrɨmo Waachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matáayo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:52-58">13:52-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maáriki 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Aho, Yéesu akahɨndʉka na ɨsɨ ya <char style="w">Galiláaya</char> ahókɨɨre lʉvɨro lwa Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja. Noyo masáare yaachwe yakeenera ɨsɨ joosi ˆjarɨɨngɨrɨra. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Ne akiindyáa vaantʉ <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">sinagóogii</char> jaavo na kɨra mʉʉntʉ amʉdʉʉmbáa.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, Yéesu akadoma na múujii wa Nasaréeti kʉʉntʉ ˆakʉrɨra. Na sikʉ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char> akɨɨngɨra na sinagóogii ja ˆvyeene iijʉvɨra. Akɨɨma sa asome Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Akaheewa kɨtáabu cha Isáaya <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char>. <figure style="fig" alt="scroll" file="hk00150c.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1954, 1967, 1972, 1995" ref="4:17, 20">Kɨtáabu cha ndɨrɨ</figure> Akakɨfotolola na akashaana haantʉ ˆhaandɨkwa,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>“Mʉtɨma wa <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> nɨ mweeri yaanɨ ʉrɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">sa aampaka makuta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">nvariyʉle <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> kwa vakɨva.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Aantʉma nɨvawyɨɨre vaantʉ ˆvarɨ mʉnyololwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">kʉchʉngʉrɨrwa kwaavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">vahoku koona kwaavo kei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">kʉvalamurirya vaantʉ ˆvakénderɨrwaa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>kei, noo vavariyʉrɨra vaantʉ mwaaka wa <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> yookʉʉja noo vatalarya vaantʉ vaachwe.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isáaya 61:1-2</ref>; maa de <ref loc="ISA 58:6">Isáaya 58:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Yéesu ˆakamarikirye soma, akakɨfota kɨra kɨtáabu, akamʉheera mʉtʉmami wa sinagóogi, maa akiikala. Vaantʉ voosi ˆvajáa aho, vakamutuurirya miiso. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Aho, akaanda lʉʉsɨka novo akavasea, “Isikʉ, aya Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho ˆmʉtéɨɨre, yakíimɨɨne.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Vaantʉ voosi ˆvajáa aho, vakamʉdʉʉmba kʉnʉ vahwáalɨɨre sa masáare ya nduwo ˆmeene alʉʉsáa. Viiyuryáa voosea, “Ʉhʉ sɨ arɨ mwaana wa Yooséefu tʉkʉ wʉʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Ne akavasea, “Namányire kuungwyɨɨra mʉrɨ mpɨ́rɨ ɨhɨ, ‘Mwaanga ihorye mweeneevyo!’ Kei kʉʉnsea mʉrɨ, ‘Masáare ˆtateera watʉmama kʉra iturii ra Kaperenáumu, yatʉmame aha iturii kʉʉntʉ ˆwakʉrɨra.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Kei akavasea, “Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, kusiina mʉláali na mʉtwe wa Ijʉva ˆarúmwaa kaayii kwaachwe tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Kɨmaarɨ kaa noovawyɨɨra, mpɨɨndɨ ja <char style="w">Elía</char> mʉláali na mʉtwe, mbula ɨjáa yɨɨma kwa myaaka ɨtatʉ na myeeri mʉsasatʉ, ɨsɨ yoosi ɨkava na njala ya imalo. Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, ɨsɨ ya <char style="w" lemma="Viisiraéeli">Isiraéeli</char> ɨjáa yatɨɨte valala ˆvamema maatʉkʉ vii. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Maa kaa, Elía sɨ atʉmwa baa kwa ʉmwɨ wa valala avo tʉkʉ. Yeeye atʉmwa kwa mʉlala ʉmwɨ wa múujii wa Seréputa ˆʉrɨ ɨsɨ ya <char style="w" lemma="Tíiro na Sidóoni">Sidóoni</char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="1KI 17:1-24">1 Vatemi 17:1-24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Kei, mpɨɨndɨ ja Elíisha mʉláali na mʉtwe ɨsɨ ya Isiraéeli ɨjáa yatɨɨte vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo ˆvarɨ na <char style="w">ʉlóónda</char>. Baa jeyyo, kusiina baa ʉmwɨ waavo ajirʉlwa tʉkʉ, maa kaa, Naamáani vii fuma ɨsɨ ya Síria.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Vatemi 5:1-14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Vaantʉ voosi ˆvajáa aho sinagóogii ˆvakateere jeyyo, vakakorera nɨ nkalari. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Hahara, vakiinʉka, vakamufumya Yéesu na weerwii ya ituri raavo, vakamʉtwaala fʉʉrʉ nemwiinemwii ya lʉʉlʉ ˆlweene ituri raavo rɨjáa rajeengwa sa vamʉkʉndʉrɨre. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Maa kaa, yeeye akalooka na katɨkatɨ yaavo, akiilookera.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookibirya Murimʉ Mʉvɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maáriki 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Aho, Yéesu akagirita na múujii wa Kaperenáumu ˆʉrɨ ɨsɨ ya Galiláaya. Ʉko, sikʉ ya Sabáato avakiindyáa. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Vaantʉ vakahwaalala ʉvariyuli waachwe, sa ʉjáa watɨɨte wiimiriri.<verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Aho sinagóogii, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ mɨvɨ">murimʉ mʉvɨ</char>. Ʉwo mʉʉntʉ akatʉlatʉʉla isóso yoosea, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Haaka! Weewe Yéesu wa Nasaréeti, che woosaaka kʉrɨ suusu? Wuújire tʉmala wʉʉ? Nakʉmányire ʉrɨ ani weewe! Weewe ʉrɨ Mʉʉja wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yéesu akʉʉdalavya ʉra murimʉ mʉvɨ yoosea, “Kirinya sawu! Fuma kʉrɨ ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ!” Ʉra murimʉ mʉvɨ ʉkamʉvayya ʉra mʉʉntʉ mbere yaavo baa mʉtamikya tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Vaantʉ voosi vakahwaalariwa maatʉkʉ vii, maa vakaanda kiiyurya voovo kwa voovo voosea, “Aya nɨ masáare che? Kwa wiimiriri na ngururu yoolairirya mirimʉ mɨvɨ ifume noyo yoofuma!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Jeyyo, masáare ya Yéesu yakeenera kɨra haantʉ ɨsɨ ɨra.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoohorya Valwɨ́ɨrɨ ˆVarɨ Foo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matáayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:32-34">Maáriki 1:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yéesu akafuma aho sinagóogii, maa akadoma fʉʉrʉ kaayii kwa Simóoni. ˆVakafike, vakamʉshaana mʉkwɨ wa Simóoni ajáa nchiirii aváirwe nɨ ndwáala, maa vakamʉloomba Yéesu amʉhorye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yéesu akamʉseeserera, maa akɨɨdalavya ɨra ndwáala. Hahara akahola ɨra ndwáala yaachwe, maa akaanda vatʉmamɨra.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Mpɨɨndɨ mwaasʉ ˆwakʉtʉmɨráa, vaantʉ voosi ˆvajáa na valwɨ́ɨrɨ ˆvajáa na ndwáala ˆjiísimiresimire, vakavareeta na kwa Yéesu. Akavɨɨka mɨkono yaachwe mweeri yaavo voosi na voosi vakahola. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Mirimʉ mɨvɨ yafumáa kwa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo, noyo yatʉláa isóso yoosea, “Weewe ʉrɨ Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ!” Maa kaa, Yéesu ɨɨdalavyáa ɨreke lʉʉsa isáare roroosi sa ɨjáa yamányire yeeye noo <char style="w">Masía</char>.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovariyʉla Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho Míijii Yɨɨngɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maáriki 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Lomʉtóondo yaachwe ˆkʉkeere, Yéesu akatamanya na haantʉ ˆharɨ kijiraawa. Mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ ˆvakataange asiina, maa vakaanda mʉsaakɨra. ˆVakamoone vakaanda kʉmʉkɨtɨra sa achaale ʉko meevo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akavasea, “Nasaakwa nvariyʉle Masáare Maaja ya <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> míijii yɨɨngɨ sa ɨkɨ noo ˆcheene natʉmwa jɨ ntʉmame.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Jeyyo, Yéesu akatuuba variyʉla Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho masinagóogii ya <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char>.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovaanɨrɨra Vapooji va Ncholo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matáayo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maáriki 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ajáa ɨɨma mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva ra Genesaréeti, kʉnʉ yoovariyʉla isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vakamʉrɨɨngɨrɨra mpaka vakaanda kʉmʉfenyenkererya. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Aho, akoona mashʉ́wa ivɨrɨ ˆjiri mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva. Ijo mashʉ́wa, vavúuvi vaachwe vajáa vakíimire noo kooyya njwaavu jaavo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yéesu akɨɨngɨra mashúwii ɨmwɨ. Ɨyo mashʉ́wa nɨ ya <char style="w" lemma="Peéteri">Simóoni</char> ɨjáa. Yéesu akamʉloomba Simóoni ɨɨkʉndʉle kiduudi na luujii. Aho, Yéesu akiikala mashúwii, maa de ɨndookiindya mpuka ya vaantʉ.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>ˆAkahʉmʉle kukiindya, maa akamʉsea Simóoni, “Hende, twaala mashʉ́wa na maajii malɨɨhɨ, aho, maa de mukiimye njwaavu jaanyu mʉkwaate soompa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simóoni akamʉsea, “Aka Aaɨ, tatʉ́mamire chɨrɨrɨ baa turya kɨɨntʉ tʉkʉ. Maa kaa, kwa isáare raako kiimya ndɨrɨ njwaavu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Simóoni na viivaachwe ˆvakakiimye njwaavu, vakakwaata soompa ˆjamema maatʉkʉ vii mpaka njwaavu jikaanda dʉmʉka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Sa jeyyo, vakavaanɨrɨra viivaavo ˆvajáa na mashʉ́wa yɨɨngɨ, vʉʉje jɨ vavaambɨre. Vakʉʉja, vakamemya soompa mashʉ́wa joosi ivɨrɨ mpaka jikasengerera nyɨmɨra.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simóoni Peéteri ˆakoone masáare ayo, akachwaama mbere ya Yéesu maa akasea, “Aaɨ Mʉkʉ́lʉ, looka kwaanɨ, nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ mʉvɨ.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Simóoni na viivaachwe vajáa vahwáalariiwe maatʉkʉ nɨ soompa ˆngʼeene vajáa vakwáatire. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Vɨɨngɨ ˆvajáa vahwaalala nɨ vala Yaakúupu na Yooháani vaana va Sebedáayo. Ava vatʉmamanʼyáa na Simóoni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Aho, Yéesu akamʉsea Simóoni, “Simóoni, koofa tʉkʉ, kwaandɨra haaha kʉva ʉrɨ muvúuvi wa vaantʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>ˆVakajitwaale mashʉ́wa na mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva, vakareka kɨra kɨɨntʉ, vakamutuuba Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ ˆArɨ na Ʉlóónda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matáayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maáriki 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, Yéesu ajáa atamanya na múujii ʉmwɨ. Ʉko, mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆahaambwa nɨ <char style="w">ʉlóónda</char> mʉvɨrɨ woosi akʉʉja na kʉrɨ Yéesu, akachwaama mbere yaachwe akiinamya kisho chaachwe fʉʉrʉ ɨsɨ. Akiiloombererya yoosea, “Aaɨ, koonɨ woosaaka, ifaanaa ʉkaanjirʉla ndwáala yaanɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yéesu akiinurirya mʉkono waachwe, akamʉsaasya, kʉnʉ yoosea, “Noosaaka, ujirʉlwe!” Hahara, ʉlóónda ʉkafuma muvirii waachwe, akahola. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Aho, Yéesu akamʉlairirya yoosea, “Karɨ umuwyɨ́ɨraa mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi isáare ɨrɨ tʉkʉ, maa kaa, tamanya ukiiyónekye kwa <char style="w" lemma="Veeneɨsɨ">mweeneɨsɨ</char> wa Ijʉva, ʉtoole na <char style="w">mpóryo</char> yo jirʉlwa, ja ˆvyeene <char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> alairirya, sa vataange kɨmaarɨ ʉhórire.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Valáawi 14:1-32</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Baa jeyyo, masáare ya Yéesu yakaariwa kɨra haantʉ. Mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ja vaantʉ jiijiingáa kʉmʉteerera na vahoriwáa ndwáala jaavo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu avarekáa na adomáa na kijiraawii noo mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ ˆAakwya Iyandiyandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matáayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maáriki 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, Yéesu avavariyʉrɨráa vaantʉ Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho. Vamwɨ va vaantʉ vamʉteereráa, nɨ <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> vajáa. Avo Mafarisáayo na vakiindya vajáa vafuma kɨra ituri ra <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char> na múujii wa Yerusaléemu. Lʉvɨro lwa Ijʉva nɨ na Yéesu lʉjáa sa ahorye vaantʉ.<verse eid="LUK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Vaantʉ vamwɨ vakʉʉja viínwɨɨre mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ ʉmwɨ na ndɨrɨ yaachwe. Ʉhʉ mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ ajáa aakwya iyandiyandi. Vakasaaka vamwiingirye na nyuumbii kʉʉntʉ ˆajáa Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Maa kaa, vakasiindwa kumwiingirya sa vaantʉ vajáa vamémire mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ. Aho, vakaambʉka nɨ ikekeerii, vakabontola ikekeera hara kʉʉntʉ Yéesu ˆajáa, vakamukiimirya ʉra mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ na ndɨrɨ yaachwe, maa vakamʉvɨɨka heehi na Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yéesu ˆakoone kuruma kwaavo, akamʉsea ʉra mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ, “Aaɨ, ʉvɨ waako wasírire.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Aho, vakiindya va Miiro na Mafarisáayo vakaanda kiiyurya voosea, “Nɨ ani ʉhʉ yoolʉʉsa masáare yo <char style="w" lemma="Hɨɨntɨka">mʉhɨɨntɨkɨra</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ? Kusiina wɨɨngɨ ˆadáhaa sea ʉvɨ wasírire tʉkʉ, nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ yeemweene vii.”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yéesu akataanga kwiiririkana kwaavo. Aho akavasea, “Nɨ sa che mookiiririkana ayo mitimii yaanyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Eri, nɨ kɨrɨkwɨ noo chaangʉ kʉlookya myeewe, kʉmʉsea ʉhʉ mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ, ‘Ʉvɨ waako wasírire,’ bakʉ kʉmʉsea, ‘Inʉka, ʉlooke’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Haaha noosaaka mʉtaange, <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> atɨɨte wiimiriri wo sea vaantʉ aha weerwii, ‘Ʉvɨ waavo wasírire.’” Aho, akamʉsea ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆaakwya iyandiyandi, “Nookʉsea, inʉka, toola ndɨrɨ yaako, ʉdome na kaayii kwaako.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Hahara, ʉra mʉʉntʉ akɨɨma mbere ya vaantʉ voosi, akatoola ndɨrɨ yaachwe, maa akadoma na kaayii kwaachwe kʉnʉ yoomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Vaantʉ voosi vakahwaalala maatʉkʉ vii na vakakwaatwa nɨ woowa kʉnʉ voomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ vakasea, “Isikʉ tɨɨ́ne masáare ˆyahwáalaryaa!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Ʉʉja jo Kaanɨrɨra Vavɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matáayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maáriki 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Ayo ˆyakalooke, Yéesu akafuma na weerwii ya múuji. Ʉko akamoona <char style="w" lemma="Vasaankanʼyi kóodi">mʉsaankanʼyi kóodi</char> ʉmwɨ ˆasewáa Láawi iíkyɨɨre kɨvaandii cho rɨhɨra kóodi, yoosaankanʼya kóodi. Aho, akamʉsea, “Ntuuba!”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus calls Levi" file=" CN01691B.TIF" size="col" loc="5:27" copy="© 1996 David C. Cook" ref="5:27-28">Yéesu yoomwaanɨrɨra Láawi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Ne Láawi akiinʉka, akareka kɨra kɨɨntʉ, maa akamutuuba Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Na Láawi akamʉbweeyyirya Yéesu ngovi nkʉʉlʉ aho kaayii kwaachwe. Mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vasaankanʼyi kóodi na vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ vakiikala kurya ne chákurya. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Maa kaa, Mafarisáayo na vakiindya va Miiro vakavangʼʉʉrɨra vapooji vaachwe voosea, “Sa che moorya no nywa hamwɨ na masaankanʼyi kóodi na maduwalo?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yéesu ˆakayateere ayo masáare, maa akavasea, “Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ nkaasʉ sɨ vasáakaa mwaanga tʉkʉ, maa kaa, valwɨ́ɨrɨ noo vasáakaa mwaanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Sɨ nʉʉja joo kaanɨrɨra vaantʉ ˆviiyónaa nɨ vawoloki tʉkʉ, nʉʉja joo kaanɨrɨra vavɨ sa <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">vamʉvalandʉkɨre</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookuuriwa Kwiirekya Kurya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matáayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maáriki 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Aho, vakamuurya Yéesu voosea, “Vapooji va Yooháani na va Mafarisáayo viirékyaa kurya so mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Maa kaa, amwɨ vapooji vaako nɨ varíjaa no nywa vii kɨra siikʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Eri, ifaanaa mʉkavabweeyya vaantʉ ˆvaláarikirwe na ngovi ya ilóola na mweenengovi ntɨ ˆarɨ novo viirekye kurya wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Maa kaa, mpɨɨndɨ luu kʉʉja jiri, mweenengovi luu sʉmʉlwa arɨ, aho noo vakiirekiirye kurya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavavaɨra lusímo ʉlʉ, “Kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆakéraa kɨráka fuma ɨngo ifya sa achʉmɨre isaámʉ tʉkʉ. Koonɨ abwéeyyiirye jeyyo, kʉva arɨ amwɨ́ɨre ɨngo ifya na ɨkyo kɨráka kifya sɨ kɨrɨ kiifwaanɨrɨra na ɨro isaámʉ tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Kei, kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆavɨ́kɨraa <char style="w">diváai</char> ifya viríibii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">viríibii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Viríiba nɨ saama ˆjavɨ́kɨraa diváai. Jaténgeneshiwaa na ndɨrɨ.</char></note> vya kalɨ tʉkʉ. Koonɨ abwéeyyiirye jeyyo, ɨyo diváai pʉsʉla ɨrɨ ivyo viríiba, diváai kɨɨtɨka ɨrɨ na viríiba saambʉka viri. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Diváai ifya nɨ viríibii vifya ɨvɨ́kɨrwaa. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Baa kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆasáakaa kʉnywa diváai ifya koonɨ anywíire ɨra ya kalɨ tʉkʉ, sa aséaa, ‘Ɨra ya kalɨ noo yabooha kʉlookya.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu nɨ Mweeneevyo wa Sabáato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matáayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maáriki 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Sikʉ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char> ɨmwɨ, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> na vapooji vaachwe vajáa vakwaatɨra na mawundii ya ngáano. Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvalookáa, vapooji vaachwe vakava voohʉʉnga maangala ya ngáano, vakayafiisa de vandoorya. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Vamwɨ va <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> vakasea, “Eri, sa che moowuna <char style="w">Miiro</char> sikʉ ya Sabáato?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">moowuna Miiro sikʉ ya Sabáato: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Miiro ya Vayahúudi kuwuna maangala yavɨrɨ yatatʉ iwundii kwa mʉʉntʉ sɨ vijáa vyakaaniwa tʉkʉ. Laanga </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 23:25</ref>.</char> Mafarisáayo sɨ vamuuryáa Yéesu sa che vapooji vaachwe vookiiva tʉkʉ, kɨɨntʉ ˆvamʉseáa nɨ sa che vapooji vaachwe vootʉmama mʉrɨmo wo chwa sikʉ ya Sabáato. Na Miiro ya Mʉ́sa yasea kusiina mʉʉntʉ kʉtʉmama sikʉ ya Sabáato tʉkʉ. Laanga <char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">Ufumo 20:8-11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavasea, “Sɨ mʉnasoma ˆcheene atʉmama mʉtemi <char style="w">Daúdi</char> mpɨɨndɨ ˆajáa aávirwe nɨ njala na vaantʉ vaachwe tʉkʉ wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Daúdi ɨɨngɨra na nyuumbii ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, akatoola ɨra mɨkáate ˆɨvɨ́ɨkwaa mbere ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, akarya. Mɨkáate ɨyo, <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> vii noo vajáa varekerwa vɨndoorya. Vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ Miiro ɨjáa yakaanʼya kurya. Ne akavaheera vaantʉ vaachwe, vakarya.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Samwéeli 21:1-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Aho, Yéesu akavasea, “<char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> nɨ Mweeneevyo wa Sabáato.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ Sikʉ ya Sabáato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matáayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maáriki 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Sikʉ ya Sabáato yɨɨngɨ, Yéesu ajáa ɨɨngɨra na <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">sinagóogii</char>, maa akaanda kiindya. Aho, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na mʉkono wa kʉlʉme ˆwaakwya iyandiyandi. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/><char style="w">Vakiindya va Miiro</char> na Mafarisáayo vakava voomʉlaanga neeja sa voone koonɨ arɨ mʉhorya sikʉ ya Sabáato. Vabweeyyáa jeyyo sa vapate nkalo yo mʉtwaala na balásii.<verse eid="LUK 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu ajáa atáangire miiririkano yaavo, aho akamʉsea ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na mʉkono ˆwaakwya iyandiyandi, “Seesa, ɨma aha mbere ya vaantʉ.” Ʉra mʉʉntʉ akiinʉka, maa akɨɨma mbere ya vaantʉ voosi.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavasea, “Nɨ kuvuurya niise, nɨ rɨrɨkwɨ noo Miiro ˆyaruma kʉtʉmama sikʉ ya Sabáato? Kʉtʉmama kɨɨntʉ kiija bakʉ kɨvɨ? Kʉlamurirya nkaasʉ au kʉmala?”<verse eid="LUK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Aho, akavalaanga vaantʉ voosi, maa akamʉsea ʉra mʉʉntʉ, “Wolola mʉkono waako!” Ʉra mʉʉntʉ akabweeyya jeyyo, hahara mʉkono waachwe ʉkava nkaasʉ kei! <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Maa kaa, vara vakiindya va Miiro na Mafarisáayo vakakalala maatʉkʉ vii, vakaanda kiiheera mɨryʉʉngʉ voovo kwa voovo ˆcheene varɨ mʉbweeyya Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovasaawʉla Vapooji Ikimi na Vavɨrɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matáayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maáriki 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, Yéesu ajáa aambʉka na luulwii noo mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Ʉko akamʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ chɨrɨrɨ. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>ˆKʉkeere, maa akavaanɨrɨra vapooji vaachwe. Aho, akavasaawʉla ikimi na vavɨrɨ, avo akavakemera <char style="w">vatumwi</char>. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Ava noo vatumwi ˆasaawʉla, Simóoni, yeeye amʉkemera <char style="w">Peéteri</char>, na Anderéa mwaanaavo, Yaakúupu na Yooháani, Filíipi na Batolomáayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Matáayo na Tomáasi, Yaakúupu sha Alʉfáayo na Simóoni ˆmweene aanɨrɨrwáa Selóote,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Selóote: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Noo kʉsea, mʉlwɨɨrɨ wa ɨsɨ.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yʉ́ʉda sha Yaakúupu, na Yʉ́ʉda Isikarióoti ˆamʉvarindʉka Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookiindya no Horya Valwɨ́ɨrɨ ˆVarɨ Foo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matáayo 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yéesu akakiima fuma luulwii hamwɨ na vatumwi vaachwe. Na ˆakafike haantʉ ˆharɨ na irɨrɨɨsɨ, akɨɨma. Aho, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vapooji vaachwe na vaantʉ ˆvajáa vafúmire ɨsɨ yoosi ya <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char>, múujii wa Yerusaléemu, na mbarɨmbarɨ ya mayɨya ya míiji ya <char style="w">Tíiro na Sidóoni</char>. Ava, vajáa vuújire noo mʉteerera Yéesu na vahoriwe ndwáala jaavo. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Na vara ˆvaturikiriwáa nɨ <char style="w">mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char>, avahoryáa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Vaantʉ voosi vasaakáa kʉmʉsaasya sa ngururu ˆjafumáa kwaachwe na avahoryáa vaantʉ voosi.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntálarya na Njumo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matáayo 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yéesu akavalaanga vapooji vaachwe akasea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mwatalariwa nyuunyu ˆmʉrɨ vakɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">sa <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> nɨ waanyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Mwatalariwa nyuunyu ˆmʉrɨ na njala haaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">sa kiikutiwa mʉrɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Mwatalariwa nyuunyu ˆmoorɨra haaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">sa seka mʉrɨ.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Mwatalariwa nyuunyu mpɨɨndɨ vaantʉ ˆvarɨ vasʉʉla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">ˆvarɨ vakera lʉtaamɨ na <char style="w" lemma="Tʉkɨra">kʉvatʉkɨra</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">na ˆvarɨ vasea mʉrɨ vavɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">sa mwamuruma Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ.<verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Sikʉ masáare aya ˆyarɨ fʉmɨra, eryi mɨtɨma na mʉndoofɨrɨra sa kʉnáálo yaanyu nɨ nkʉ́ʉ́lʉ kurumwii, sa baa vala baaba waavo vavabweeyyirirya viivyo <char style="w">valáali na mʉtwe</char> va Ijʉva.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Maa kaa, mpolaɨ nyuunyu ˆmʉrɨ vasúngaati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">sa kutuurya mɨtɨma kwaanyu mwahʉmʉla kʉkʉhokera.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Mpolaɨ nyuunyu ˆmwiíkutire haaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">sa kwaavwa mʉrɨ nɨ njala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Mpolaɨ nyuunyu ˆmooseka na cheerʉ haaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">sa rɨra mʉrɨ na rɨra mʉrɨ no myaa.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Mpolaɨ nyuunyu vaantʉ voosi ˆvakavadʉ́ʉmbɨrɨraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">sa baa vala baaba vaavo viivyo vavadʉʉmbɨrɨráa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">valáali na mʉtwe va ʉloongo.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉveenda Vavɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matáayo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>Maa kaa, nɨ vawyɨɨra niise nyuunyu vara ˆmookʉʉnteerera, veendi vavɨ vaanyu. Vabweeyyiryi wʉʉja vara ˆvavasʉʉla. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Vatalaryi vara ˆvavajúmaa, na vara ˆvavabwéeyyiryaa mavɨ valoomberi kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ akʉváire lʉsayya lwa ivaru rɨmwɨ, mʉvarindʉrɨre na lwa ivaru rɨɨngɨ. Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ akʉhókire ikóoti raako, kʉmʉsɨɨtɨra isháati raako tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ʉra ˆyookʉloomba kɨɨntʉ, mʉheere. Kei, koonɨ mʉʉntʉ akʉhókire máari jaako, karɨ ʉdáayyaa akʉhɨndʉrɨre tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Mʉndoovabweeyyirya vɨɨngɨ ja ˆvyeene nyuunyu moosaaka vandoovabweeyyirya.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>Koonɨ mʉveéndire vii vara ˆvaveenda nyuunyu, nɨ kʉnáálo che mʉrɨ turya? Amwɨ baa vaduwalo vaveenda vara ˆvaveenda voovo vii! <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Kei, koonɨ mʉvabwéeyyiriirye maaja vara ˆvavabwéeyyiryaa wʉʉja vii, nɨ kʉnáálo che mooturya? Amwɨ baa vaduwalo vabweeyya viivyo! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Koonɨ moovakopesha vara ˆmookiilaangya rɨha varɨ, nɨ kʉnáálo che moopata? Baa vaduwalo vavakópeshaa vaduwalo viivaavo kʉnʉ vookiilaangya hɨndʉrɨrwa varɨ vyoosi ˆvakopesha. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Maa kaa, nyuunyu mʉveende vavɨ vaanyu, na mʉndoovabweeyyirya wʉʉja. Kei, mʉndoovakopesha baa kiilaangya hɨndʉrɨrwa mʉrɨ tʉkʉ. Koonɨ mʉbwéeyyiirye jeyyo, ˆArɨ Mweerimweeri varɨha arɨ marɨho makʉʉlʉ. Kei, kʉva mʉrɨ vaana vaachwe sa yeeye aboohya kwa vara sɨ ˆvadʉ́ʉmbaa na vavɨ. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Sa jeyyo, mʉve na mbavariri ja Taáta waanyu ˆvyeene arɨ na mbavariri.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉlamʉrɨra Vɨɨngɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matáayo 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>Karɨ mʉlámʉrɨraa tʉkʉ, de baa nyuunyu mʉdɨɨre kʉndoolamʉrɨrwa. Karɨ mʉlʉ́ʉsaa irya tʉkʉ, de baa nyuunyu mʉdɨɨre kʉndoolʉʉsɨrwa irya. Mʉndoovasea viivaanyu yasírire, sa baa nyuunyu mʉndoosewa yasírire. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Mʉboohye ɨnda, aho naanyu heewa mweende. Kɨkomi, heewa mweende vipíimo ˆvyamema, vikasʉngʉsɨrwa mpaka vindookɨɨtɨkɨrɨra. Sa kipíimo kɨkɨra ˆmoopiimɨra vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ, noo ˆmʉrɨ piimɨrwa!”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Yéesu akavavaɨra lusímo ʉlʉ, akavasea, “Eri, mʉhoku ifaanaa amʉlongoole mwiiwaachwe wʉʉ? Kɨkomi voosi bʉrʉkɨra varɨ na iduundwii. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Mʉpooji sɨ arɨ mʉlookerera mukiindya waachwe tʉkʉ. Maa kaa, mʉpooji ʉra ˆahʉmʉla kiindiwa yoosi ifaanaa akadaha kʉva ja mukiindya waachwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Amwɨ woolaanga kajʉla karɨ riiswii ra mwaanaanyu na ʉlɨ sɨ wookoona mpóngoola ˆɨrɨ riiswii raako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Joolɨ ʉrɨ mʉsea mwaanaanyu, ‘Mwanawiitʉ, tʉʉla nɨkʉseyye kajʉla riiswii raako,’ kʉnʉ weewe sɨ wookoona mpóngoola ˆɨrɨ riiswii raako? Weewe mʉkweembi! Seyya ta mpóngoola riiswii raako, de woone neeja na ʉdahe seyya kajʉla riiswii ra mwaanaanyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉtɨ Watáangɨkanaa kwa Ndɨɨwa Jaachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matáayo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>Kusiina mʉtɨ ˆwabooha ˆwatʉ́ʉngaa ndɨɨwa ˆjavɨɨha tʉkʉ, na kusiina mʉtɨ ˆwavɨɨha ˆwatʉ́ʉngaa ndɨɨwa ˆjabooha tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Vaantʉ vʉʉtáangaa mʉtɨ kwa ndɨɨwa jaachwe. Vaantʉ sɨ vatʉ́ʉndaa saambu mihuungii tʉkʉ na sɨ vatʉ́ʉndaa sabíibu mbiirii tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Noo jeyyo viri, mʉʉntʉ mʉʉja afúmyaa maaja fuma máari jaachwe ja kɨkomi ja mberii ja mutimii waachwe mʉʉja. Na mʉʉntʉ mʉvɨ afúmyaa mavɨ fuma mutimii waachwe mʉvɨ. Sa viintʉ ˆvyamema mutimii wa mʉʉntʉ, noo mʉlomo waachwe ʉlʉ́ʉsaa.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉjeengi ˆArɨ na Tooti na Mʉjeengi Mʉhoho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matáayo 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>Sa che mookʉʉnyanɨrɨra, ‘Mʉkʉ́lʉ, Mʉkʉ́lʉ!’ amwɨ sɨ mootʉmama yara ˆnoovawyɨɨra? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆʉʉ́jaa na kʉrɨ nɨɨnɨ na ˆatéereraa no yakwaatya masáare yaanɨ, iifwɨ́ɨne na lusímo ʉlʉ, <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>yeeye nɨ ja mʉʉntʉ ˆajeengáa nyuumba, maa kaa, de aande jeenga, ajáa avɨɨka mwaariryo isii ya iduundu ˆrɨjáa rasiimbwa fʉʉrʉ mwaalaliwyii. Mbula ˆɨkavae na lʉʉjɨ lʉkʉʉlʉ ˆlukiike mpaka lʉkamoola ikɨko ra iboote, maaji yakakʉngʼʉntɨka na nyuumbii kwaachwe. Maa kaa, sa viintʉ nyuumba ɨra ɨjáa yajeengwa vyabooha, ayo maaji sɨ yadaha baa kwiisingisya tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Maa kaa, ʉra ˆatéeraa masáare yaanɨ baa yakwaatya tʉkʉ, nɨ ja mʉʉntʉ ˆajeenga nyuumba yaachwe ichuúkii baa siimba no vɨɨka mwaariryo tʉkʉ. Na maaji ˆyakabomole ikɨko ra maaji na maaji ˆyakakʉngʼʉntɨke na nyuumbii yaachwe, hahara nyuumba yaachwe yaawya, na ɨkabomoka vʉʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉtʉmami wa Mʉlʉkalʉka sɨ ˆArɨ Mʉyahúudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matáayo 8:5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Yooháani 4:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ˆakahʉmʉle lʉʉsa masáare ayo yoosi kʉnʉ vaantʉ voomʉteerera, maa akadoma na múujii wa Kaperenáumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Aho múujii, kwajáa kwatɨɨte mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ ʉmwɨ wa valwi nkoondo. Ʉhʉ mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ ajáa atɨɨte mʉtʉmami waachwe ˆajáa amweendamweenda. Haaha ʉhʉ mʉtʉmami ajáa alwaala sengerera akwye. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Ʉwo mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa valʉkalʉka ˆakateere masáare ya Yéesu, akatʉma vawosi va <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Kɨyahúudi</char> vadome na kwa Yéesu, vakamʉloombe ʉʉje jɨ amʉhorye mʉtʉmami waachwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Novo ˆvakafike kwa Yéesu, vakamʉkalaamya mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ voosea, “Koonɨ kʉrɨ na mʉʉntʉ ˆavalwa ɨɨma neeja kwaambiririwa, nɨ ʉhʉ. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Yeeye eenda ɨsɨ yiitʉ, baa kei noo atʉjeengera <char style="w">sinagóogi</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akadomanʼya novo. Maa kaa, viintʉ ˆajáa akaarɨ kʉlɨ kʉlɨ na nyuumba ya ʉra mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa valwi nkoondo, ʉra mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ akatʉma vijeengi vyaachwe vakamʉsee Yéesu, “Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ, karɨ ujuuwɨke tʉkʉ, nɨɨnɨ sɨ navalwa nɨɨma neeja kʉkʉteengya weewe wɨɨngɨre nyuumbii kwaanɨ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ɨkɨ noo ˆchooreka, niiyɨɨ́ne sɨ navalwa nɨɨma neeja kʉʉja na kwaako tʉkʉ. Maa kaa, lʉʉsa isáare vii na mʉtʉmami waanɨ ahole. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Sa nɨɨnɨ nɨ mʉʉntʉ ˆnavɨɨkwa ɨsɨ ya wiimiriri, baa kei natɨɨte valwi nkoondo ɨsɨ yaanɨ. Koonɨ namʉséire ʉhʉ ‘Doma,’ adómaa na wɨɨngɨ ‘Ʉja,’ ne ʉʉ́jaa. Koonɨ namʉséire mʉtʉmami waanɨ ‘Bweeyya ɨkɨ,’ yeeye abwéeyyaa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yéesu ˆakateere ayo masáare, akahwaalala mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, akiilorera akɨɨlaanga ɨra mpuka ˆyamutuubáa, maa akavasea, “Noovawyɨɨra, sɨ nɨnoona kuruma ja ʉkʉ baa kʉrɨ ɨsɨ yoosi ya <char style="w" lemma="Viisiraéeli">Isiraéeli</char> tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Na vara vaantʉ ˆvajáa vatúmirwe noo mwaanɨrɨra Yéesu ˆvakahɨndʉke na kaayii kwa mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa valʉkalʉka, vakamʉshaana ʉra mʉtʉmami ahórire.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉfʉfʉla Musinga wa Mʉlala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi, Yéesu akadoma na múujii ʉmwɨ, ˆʉséwaa Náini. Ʉko ajáa adomanʼya na vapooji vaachwe na mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>ˆAkasengerere mutiryaangwii wa múuji, akalʉmana na mpuka ya vaantʉ viínwɨɨre mʉvɨrɨ wa mʉtavana ˆajáa awʉ́lɨɨre vootwaala noo taaha. Ʉhʉ mʉtavana noo mwaana ʉmwɨ vii wa mʉlala ʉmwɨ ajáa. Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo fuma múuji ʉwo nɨ hamwɨ vajáa na ʉwo mʉʉntʉ muki. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Yéesu Mweenevyoosi ˆakamoone ʉwo maáma mʉlala, akamoonera mbavariri, maa akamʉsea, “Rɨra tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Yéesu akaseesa na heehi ya kɨtáanda, akakɨsaasya, maa vara vaantʉ ˆvajáa viínwɨɨre vakɨɨma. Aho, akasea, “Mʉtavana, nakʉséire inʉka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Ʉwo mʉtavana ˆajáa awʉ́lɨɨre, akiinʉka, akaanda lʉʉsɨka. Aho, Yéesu akamʉkwaatya íyo waavo. <verse eid="LUK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Vaantʉ voosi ˆvajáa aho, vakakwaatwa nɨ woowa, vakaanda mʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ voosea, “<char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">Mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> mʉkʉʉlʉ uújire na kʉrɨ suusu! Mʉlʉʉngʉ uújire noo vaambirirya vaantʉ vaachwe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Masáare aya ya Yéesu yakeenera ɨsɨ yoosi ya <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char> na ɨsɨ joosi ˆjiri mʉkaaya.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu na Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matáayo 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Vapooji va Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji vakamuwyɨɨra masáare yoosi ˆyatʉmamwáa nɨ Yéesu. Yooháani akavaanɨrɨra vapooji vaachwe vavɨrɨ, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>akavatʉma kwa Yéesu Mweenevyoosi vakamuurye jei, “Eri, weewe noo ʉra ˆalʉʉswa nɨ valáali na mʉtwe ˆyookʉʉja bakʉ tʉwoojere wɨɨngɨ?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Vara vapooji ˆvakafike kʉrɨ Yéesu, maa vakasea, “Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji atʉtʉ́mɨre tukuurye, ‘Eri, weewe noo ʉra ˆalʉʉswa nɨ valáali na mʉtwe ˆwookʉʉja bakʉ tʉwoojere wɨɨngɨ?’”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ɨʼɨra Yéesu ajáa ahorya vaantʉ ndwáala, na ʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ waavo. Vara ˆvajáa na <char style="w">mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char> akavahorya, na vahoku ˆvarɨ foo akavabweeyya voone. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavasea vara ˆvajáa vatúmirwe, “Tamanyi mʉkamʉwyɨɨre Yooháani yoosi ˆmwiiyónɨɨre na ˆmʉyatéɨɨre. Vahoku vookoona, vivete vooyeenda, ˆvarɨ na <char style="w">ʉlóónda</char> voojirʉlwa, vimatu vooteera, vaantʉ ˆvaakwya voofʉfʉlwa na kei vakɨva voovariyʉrɨrwa <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɨrɨmo ˆmyeene yoolʉʉsa aha, noo ɨra ˆyalʉʉswa nɨ Isáaya mʉláali na mʉtwe. Mɨrɨmo ɨyo noo Masía ˆarɨ tʉmama mpɨɨndɨ ˆarɨ kʉʉja. </char><char style="xt">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 26:19">Isáaya 26:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:18-19">29:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">35:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Atalariwa ʉra sɨ ˆarɨ hɨtwahɨtwa sa nɨɨnɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Vara vapooji va Yooháani ˆvakalooke, maa Yéesu akaanda kʉvawyɨɨra vara vaantʉ masáare ya Yooháani yoosea, “Nɨ che mwɨɨtáa laanga kʉra ɨsɨ ya ibaláángwii? Isaanga ˆrooringiwaringiwa nɨ mpeho wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Koonɨ sɨ jeyyo, nɨ che mwɨɨtáa laanga? Mʉʉntʉ ˆiirwíikire ɨngo ja iyoombe ikʉʉlʉ wʉʉ? Aka tʉkʉ, vaantʉ ˆviirwɨ́ɨkaa ɨngo ja iyoombe ikʉʉlʉ na ˆvarɨ na kɨra kɨɨntʉ ˆchabooha nɨ nyuumbii ja kɨtemi viíkalaa. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Haaha nɨ che mwɨɨtáa koo laanga? Nɨ mʉláali na mʉtwe mwɨɨtáa ko laanga wʉʉ? Kɨkomi, noovawyɨɨra nɨ kʉlookya mʉláali na mʉtwe mwɨɨtáa ko laanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Ʉhʉ noo masáare yaachwe ˆyaandɨkwa Masáarii ˆYarɨ Mpeho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Laanga, mʉtʉma ndɨrɨ <char style="w" lemma="Vatumwi">mutumwi</char> waanɨ akʉlongorɨre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">yeeye kʉtengenesherya arɨ njɨra yaako.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Maláaki 3:1</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Kei Yéesu akasea, “Nɨ vawyɨɨra niise, kwa vaantʉ voosi kusiina ˆarɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ kʉlookya Yooháani tʉkʉ. Maa kaa, ʉra ˆarɨ muduudiduudi <char style="w" lemma="Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ">Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>, noo mʉkʉʉlʉ kʉlookya Yooháani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Vaantʉ voosi, hamwɨ na <char style="w">vasaankanʼyi kóodi</char> vajáa vateera ayo masáare ya Yéesu. Vakaruma mʉryʉʉngʉ ˆiímyaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ nɨ mʉwoloki na avo noo vara ˆvajáa <char style="w" lemma="Batisa">vabatisiwa</char> nɨ Yooháani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Maa kaa, <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> sɨ vajáa vabatisiwa nɨ Yooháani tʉkʉ. Voovo vajáa vasiita mʉryʉʉngʉ Mʉlʉʉngʉ ˆajáa aviimirya.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Aho, Yéesu akavasea, “Na che ndɨrɨ kɨɨfwaanirirya mbyaala ɨhɨ? Nɨ na che yiifwɨ́ɨne mbyaala ɨhɨ? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Mbyaala ɨhɨ yiifwɨ́ɨne na vasinga viíkyɨɨre isóokwii de vandookiisea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‘Tavaváɨɨre firíimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">nyuunyu baa bwɨɨta tʉkʉ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Tavɨɨ́mbɨɨre nyɨɨ́mbo ja ʉsʉʉngʉ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">nyuunyu baa rɨra tʉkʉ!’<verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Sa Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji ʉʉja, sɨ arijáa mʉkáate baa kei sɨ anywijáa <char style="w">diváai</char> tʉkʉ, nyuunyu mʉkasea, ‘Atɨɨte murimʉ mʉvɨ!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Maa kaa, <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> ʉʉja, yoorya no nywa, nyuunyu mʉkasea, ‘Mʉlaangi ʉhʉ, mwaafu na mʉreevi, mare ya vasaankanʼyi kóodi na vaduwalo.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Baa neembe nɨ jeyyo, tooti ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ yiiyónekiirye kɨkomi nɨ ya ʉwoloki kwa vaana vaachwe voosi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉʉntʉ Muki Mʉvɨ Yoomʉhaka Yéesu Makuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, Mʉfarisáayo ʉmwɨ ˆasewáa Simóoni ajáa amʉteengya Yéesu noo rya chákurya kaayii kwaachwe. Yéesu akatamanya na kaayii kwa ʉwo Mʉfarisáayo, maa akiikala kurya chákurya.<figure style="fig" alt="Jews eat at the table" file="lb00320c.tif" size="col" copy="Bass, The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="7:36">Vayahúudi voorya méesii</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Haaha, aho múujii kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ muki ʉmwɨ ˆajáa mʉvɨ. Ʉwo mʉʉntʉ muki ˆakataange Yéesu amwaarɨ yoorya chákurya kwa Mʉfarisáayo, akatoola chʉ́pa ya iwye ˆɨrɨ na makuta ˆyanyʉ́kɨraa ya iyoombe ikarɨ. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>ˆAkafike, akɨɨma nyuma heehi na majeo ya Yéesu. Akaanda rɨra na miísoori yaachwe yandoowyɨɨra majewii ya Yéesu, de ɨndoomʉhonola Yéesu na njwɨɨrɨ jaachwe. Akatuuba sʉndɨra majeo ya Yéesu na akayahaka yara makuta.<verse eid="LUK 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Ʉra Mʉfarisáayo ˆajáa amʉtéengiirye Yéesu ˆakoone jeyyo, akaanda kiiririkana mutimii waachwe yoosea, “Ngaarɨ ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ nɨ mʉláali na mʉtwe wa Ijʉva, ngaarɨ amányire ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ muki yoomʉkwaata nɨ joolɨ ˆarɨ, na ngaarɨ amányire nɨ mʉvɨ.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akamʉsea ʉra Mʉfarisáayo, “Simóoni, natɨɨte isáare ˆnoosaaka nɨkʉwyɨɨre.” Ne akasea, “Mukiindya ngwyɨɨra.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yéesu akasea, “Kwajáa kwatɨɨte vaantʉ vavɨrɨ ˆvadaayiwáa noongwa nɨ mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ. Ʉmwɨ adaayiwáa mpía ja <char style="w">dináari</char> magana yasaano (500) na wɨɨngɨ mpía ja dináari makumi yasaano (50). <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Vaantʉ ava vajáa vasiindwa rɨha. Ʉwo ˆajáa avakopesha akavasea noongwa jaavo jasírire. Haaha nɨ arɨkwɨ kati ya ava vavɨrɨ ˆarɨ mweenda kʉlookya mwiiwaachwe?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simóoni akasea, “Nɨ ʉra ˆasewa noongwa yaachwe nkʉʉlʉ kʉlookya yasírire.” Yéesu akamʉsea, “Walámwɨɨre kwa ʉwoloki.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Aho, Yéesu akamʉlaanga ʉra mʉʉntʉ muki, maa akamʉsea Simóoni, “Wamwɨɨ́ne ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ muki? Nɨɨ́ngɨɨre aha nyuumbii kwaako baa sɨ wʉʉmpɨ́ɨre maaji nooyye majeo yaanɨ tʉkʉ, maa kaa, ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ muki oóyyiirye majeo yaanɨ na miísoori yaachwe na aampónwɨɨre majeo yaanɨ na njwɨɨrɨ jaachwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Weewe sɨ waansʉ́ndɨɨre mpɨɨndɨ ˆwakuunuumbya tʉkʉ. Maa kaa, ʉhʉ keende ˆnɨɨ́ngɨɨre aha sɨ anareka kʉʉnsʉʉndɨra majeo yaanɨ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Weewe sɨ waampákire makuta mutwii tʉkʉ, maa kaa, yeeye aampákire makuta ˆyanyʉ́kɨraa majewii yaanɨ.<verse eid="LUK 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Haaha nɨ kuwyɨɨra niise, kweenda kwaachwe nɨ kʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ sa ʉvɨ waachwe ˆʉrɨ foo wasírire. Maa kaa, ʉra ʉvɨ kiduudi ˆwasírire, eenda kiduudi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akamʉsea ʉra mʉʉntʉ muki, “Ʉvɨ waako wasírire!”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Maa kaa, vara ˆvarijáa ne aho, vakaanda kiiyurya voovo kwa voovo voosea, “Ʉhʉ nɨ ani ˆarɨ sea ʉvɨ wa mʉʉntʉ wasírire?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Aho, Yéesu akamʉsea ʉra mʉʉntʉ muki, “Kuruma kwaako kwakʉhóniirye, tamanya na mwiikalo mʉʉja.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Vaantʉ Vaki ˆVeene Vayeendanʼyáa na Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Aya ˆyakalooke, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ajáa akera njɨra na atweeráa na míijii na maturii ˆyiísimiresimire kʉnʉ yoovariyʉla <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> ya <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>. Na mpɨɨndɨ ijo nɨ na vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ ajáa. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Kei, nɨ hamwɨ ajáa na vaantʉ vaki vɨɨngɨ ˆveene ajáa avaseyya <char style="w">mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char> na vɨɨngɨ ˆajáa avahorya ndwáala jaavo. Na ʉmwɨ wa vaantʉ vaki avo nɨ <char style="w">Maríia Makɨdaléena</char>, ˆajáa aseyyiwa mirimʉ mɨvɨ mufungatɨ, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Yooáana muki wa Kúusa mwiimiriri wa máari ja mʉtemi <char style="w">Heróode</char>. Wɨɨngɨ nɨ Susáana na vɨɨngɨ ˆvarɨ foo. Vaantʉ vaki ava vatooláa máari jaavo kʉmwaambirirya Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mʉhaandi Mbeyʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matáayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maáriki 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Mpɨɨndɨ mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ ˆyiijiingáa fuma kɨra múuji, Yéesu akavavaɨra lusímo ʉlʉ, <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Mʉhaandi ʉmwɨ ajáa adoma noo haanda mbeyʉ jaachwe. Mpɨɨndɨ ˆamyaaháa, mbeyʉ jimwi jikawyɨɨra njirii, jikalwaatwa na ndee jikʉʉja jikajirya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Mbeyʉ jimwi jikawyɨɨra mwaalaliwyii. ˆJikamere, jikʉʉma sa viintʉ kʉjáa kusiina maaji. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Jimwi jikawyɨɨra haantʉ ˆhajáa na miíwa. Miíwa ɨkakʉlanʼya hamwɨ na jira mbeyʉ, miíwa ɨkajivaa, maa jikadundumala. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Maa kaa, jimwi jikawyɨɨra salwii ˆjiri na seve, jikamera, jikakʉla, jikavyaala maatʉkʉ vii, jimwi jikavyaala mara makumi ikimi (100).” ˆAkahʉmʉle kʉvawyɨɨra jeyyo, maa akasea na ngururu, “ˆArɨ na matu yo teerera, nɨ ateere!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovariyʉla Símo Jaachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matáayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maáriki 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi vapooji vaachwe vakamuurya, “Lusímo lwaako nɨ che loovariyʉla?” <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Ne akavasea, “Nyuunyu mwaheewa nkalo yo taanga viintʉ vya Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, ivyo nɨ fuumbo. Maa kaa, vara sɨ ˆvarɨ Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, noovawyɨɨra kwa símo, sa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">‘Kʉlaanga, valaange, baa koona tʉkʉ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">Na kʉteera, vateere, baa taanga tʉkʉ.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isáaya 6:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovariyʉla Lusímo lwa Mʉhaandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matáayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maáriki 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>Lusímo ʉlʉ ʉvariyuli waachwe nɨ ʉhʉ, mbeyʉ nɨ isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Mbeyʉ jira ˆjawyɨɨra njirii nɨ vara vaantʉ ˆvarɨtéeraa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Aho, Ikʉ́ʉ́lʉ ra Mirimʉ Mɨvɨ rɨkʉʉja, rɨkarɨseyya mitimii yaavo sa karɨ jɨ varume na valamuririwe tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Mbeyʉ jira ˆjawyɨɨra mwaalaliwyii, nɨ vaantʉ vara ˆvarɨtéeraa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ, maa vakarɨhokera na cheerʉ. Maa kaa, sɨ rɨvɨɨngɨ́raa mitimii tʉkʉ, sa viintʉ vasiina miriri yo rɨkwaata, kiikala varɨ noro kiduudi vii, na uturikiri ˆʉrɨ kʉʉja sa rɨra isáare, varékaa kʉra kuruma kwaavo. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Mbeyʉ jira ˆjawyɨɨra miíwii, nɨ ja vaantʉ vara ˆvarɨtéeraa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Maa kaa, ˆvarɨ tuuba kwiikala noro, raváwaa nɨ ʉhangaiki wa weerʉ, kukunguula máari na ʉláku wa viintʉ vya weerʉ, jeyyo, sɨ vakʉ́laa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Na mbeyʉ jira ˆjawyɨɨra sevii, noo vaantʉ vara ˆvarɨtéeraa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Vakarɨteengya na wʉʉja mitimii yaavo, vakarɨkwaatya, na kwa uyimiriryi mʉkʉʉlʉ, vavyáalaa ndɨɨwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Kɨmʉrɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maáriki 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>Kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆakórereryaa kɨmʉrɨ, maa akavisa nyiingwii tʉkʉ, au akakɨvɨɨka iruungwii ra kɨtáanda tʉkʉ. Kɨmʉrɨ nɨ kyaángwii kɨvɨ́ɨkwaa sa vaantʉ voosi ˆvookɨɨngɨra voone kɨweerʉ. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Sa kɨra kɨɨntʉ ˆchaviswa, vɨɨkwa kɨrɨ kɨweerwii, na kɨra ˆchakʉnɨkɨrɨrwa, taangwa kɨrɨ.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Haaha teereri neeja masáare ayo ˆnoovawyɨɨra. Ʉra ˆarɨ na kɨɨntʉ, koongereriwa arɨ kʉlookya, na ʉra ˆasiina kɨɨntʉ, vuulwa arɨ baa kɨra kidúúdi ˆiiséaa nɨ nocho arɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vandʉʉ va Yéesu na Íyo Waavo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matáayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maáriki 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Aho, ndʉʉ ya Yéesu na íyo waavo vakʉʉja noo mʉlaanga Yéesu, maa kaa, sɨ vadaha seesa na haantʉ ˆajáa tʉkʉ, sa vaantʉ vajáa ˆvamema maatʉkʉ vii. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Aho, mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ akamʉsea Yéesu, “Íyo waanyu na vaanaanyu vamwaarɨ weerwii, voosaaka vakoone.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akamʉsea, “Íyo wiitʉ na vandʉʉ vaanɨ nɨ vara voosi ˆvarɨtéeraa isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ no rituuba.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yootuurya Ihúmbuuto Irivii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matáayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maáriki 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, Yéesu ajáa aambʉka mashʉ́wa na vapooji vaachwe, maa akavasea, “Hendi tʉfɨrɨre na nyambʉko ya iriva.” Aho, vakakwaata lʉyeendo. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ˆvafɨrɨráa, Yéesu akakwaatwa nɨ tʉlo, maa akanyeyya. Aho, ihúmbuuto ˆradalavadalaava rɨkaanda wuva, maa mashʉ́wa ɨkaanda mema maaji, vakava vɨɨ́ngɨɨre iremii.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Vapooji vaachwe vakɨɨta noo mwiinukya, vakatʉla isóso voosea, “Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ! Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ! Sira tiise!” Hara Yéesu akiinʉka, akarɨdalavya rɨra ihúmbuuto na yara mapúunta. Hara, ihúmbuuto rɨkakirinya sawu, na maaji yakatʉʉla tʉ. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Aho, akavuurya vapooji vaachwe, “Kuruma kwaanyu hai kʉrɨ?” Vapooji vaachwe vakahwaalala na vakakwaatwa nɨ woowa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, vaakiiyurya voosea, “De ʉhʉ nɨ ani, ˆmweene baa ihúmbuuto na maaji vyoomʉteera?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ ˆArɨ na Murimʉ Mʉvɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matáayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maáriki 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe vakafɨrɨra na nyambʉko ya iriva ra <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>, vakafika ɨsɨ ya Vageráasi ˆɨrɨ mbarɨmbarɨ ya iriva. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yéesu ˆakakiime vii hara mashúwii, maa akalʉmana na mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆarɨ na mirimʉ mɨvɨ. Kwa mpɨɨndɨ nkʉʉlʉ ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ sɨ iivɨ́kɨraa ɨngo tʉkʉ, baa kei sɨ iikaláa kaayii tʉkʉ nɨ <char style="w" lemma="Mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra">mbiríírii</char> vii iikaláa.<verse eid="LUK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Ʉwo mʉʉntʉ ˆakamoone Yéesu, akachwaama mbere yaachwe, akatʉlatʉʉla isóso, yoosea, “Che woosaaka kʉrɨ nɨɨnɨ, weewe Yéesu, <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> ˆArɨ Mweerimweeri? Nookʉloomba, kuunturikirya tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Alʉʉsa jeyyo, sa Yéesu ajáa ɨɨséire ɨyo mirimʉ mɨvɨ yiisunke kʉrɨ ʉwo mʉʉntʉ. Ɨyo mirimʉ mɨvɨ, ɨjáa yamuturikirya maatʉkʉ vii. Vaantʉ vamʉyeekeráa nyuumbii na vamuchuungáa na mɨnyololo mɨkonwii na mawulwii, maa kaa, yeeye adʉmʉladʉmʉláa, na ɨyo mirimʉ mɨvɨ yamʉtwaaláa na ɨsɨ ya ibaláángwii.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Haaha, maa Yéesu akuuyurya, “Irina raako noo ani?” Ʉkasea, “Irina raanɨ nɨ Mayana na Mayana ya Valwi Nkoondo,” sa nɨ mirimʉ mɨvɨ ˆɨrɨ foo ɨjáa yamwɨɨngɨra. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Aho ɨra mirimʉ mɨvɨ ikiilomboola maatʉkʉ vii kʉrɨ Yéesu, karɨ iikibirye na <char style="w" lemma="Ntare">Ntarii</char> tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Haaha mpɨɨndɨ ijo, heehi na aho haantʉ kʉjáa kwatɨɨte ufya wa nkaamba ˆjooriisha mbarɨmbarɨ ya lʉʉlʉ. Ɨra mirimʉ mɨvɨ ikiilomboola kʉrɨ Yéesu, yoosea, “Kalaama tʉrekere, tʉkajɨɨngɨre jira nkaamba.” Ne akɨɨrekera. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Ɨra mirimʉ mɨvɨ ɨkafuma kwa ʉra mʉʉntʉ, maa ɨkɨɨta kɨɨngɨra jira nkaamba. Ufya woosi wa nkaamba ʉkagɨrɨtɨra na kɨwoongwii, maa jikabʉrʉkɨra na irivii na nkaamba joosi vʉʉ jikakwya.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Varíisi va jira nkaamba ˆvakoone jeyyo, vakakʉʉrɨka itɨ́ɨjo, vakatwaala mʉlomo kwa vaantʉ ˆvajáa mawundii na múujii. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Vaantʉ vakadoma noo laanga masáare ˆmeene yajáa yafʉ́mɨɨre. ˆVakafike kʉrɨ Yéesu, vakamoona ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa aséyyiiwe mirimʉ mɨvɨ, iíkyɨɨre mawulwii ya Yéesu, iivɨ́kɨɨre ɨngo, arɨ na mɨryʉʉngʉ yaachwe! Vakoofa maatʉkʉ vii. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Na vara ˆvajáa voona, vakavawyɨɨra vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ ˆvyeene ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa na mirimʉ mɨvɨ ahoriwa nɨ Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Vaantʉ voosi va ɨsɨ ya Vageráasi na ɨsɨ ˆjarɨɨngɨrɨra, vakakwaatwa nɨ woowa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, maa voosi vakamʉloomba Yéesu alooke aho meevo. Aho, maa Yéesu akaambʉka mashʉ́wa, akahɨndʉka.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Haaha de Yéesu alooke, ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa aséyyiiwe mirimʉ mɨvɨ akiiloombererya atamanyanʼye na Yéesu. Maa kaa, Yéesu akamʉsɨɨtɨra, yoosea, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Hɨndʉka na meenyu, ʉkavawyɨɨre vaantʉ ˆvyeene Mʉlʉʉngʉ akʉtʉ́mamɨɨre masáare makʉʉlʉ.” Aho, ʉra mʉʉntʉ akiitamanyirya, akɨtookaarya múujii waachwe woosi masáare makʉʉlʉ ˆmeene Yéesu ajáa amʉtʉ́mamɨɨre.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ Muki na Yoomʉfʉfʉla Muhíínja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matáayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maáriki 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Haaha Yéesu ˆakahɨndʉke na nyambʉko ya iriva ra Galiláaya, akateengiwa nɨ mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ ˆvamʉwoojeráa. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Aho, akʉʉja mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ irina raachwe Yaíiro. Ʉhʉ nɨ mʉlongooli wa <char style="w">sinagóogi</char> ajáa. Akawya majewii ya Yéesu yoomʉloomba atamanye na kaayii kwaachwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Ʉko kaayii kwaachwe muhíínja waachwe wa mpeke wa myaaka ikimi na ɨvɨrɨ ajáa aséngerɨɨre kukwya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Kati ˆadomáa na kwa Yaíiro, mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ ɨkava yoomufiinda. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Aho, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ muki ˆajáa na ndwáala yo fuma sakami kwa myaaka ikimi na ɨvɨrɨ. [Yeeye ajáa amala máari jaachwe joosi vʉʉ kwa vaanga,] baa kusiina yoyoosi ˆadaha mʉhorya tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Ʉra mʉʉntʉ muki akamutuuba Yéesu kʉnʉ nyuma, maa akasaasya mʉkáwo wa nkáancho yaachwe. Hahara, sakami ɨkadeenʼya.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Aho, Yéesu akuurya, “Nɨ ani aansáasiirye?” Vaantʉ voosi ˆvakasiite, maa <char style="w">Peéteri</char> akamʉsea, “Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ, ɨhɨ mpuka ya vaantʉ yoosi yookufiinda na vookiifenyenkererya!” <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akasea, “Kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ˆaansáasiirye, sa kwatɨɨte ngururu jo horya mʉʉntʉ ˆjaanfúmire.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Ʉra mʉʉntʉ muki ˆakataange sɨ arɨ daha kwiivisa tʉkʉ, akiiturirya, kʉnʉ yootetema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:47 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">yootetema: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ muki atetemáa, sa iiseáa amʉbweeyyirye Yéesu ave na njeo baa kei ajáa awúnire Miiro ya Vayahúudi. Sa kwa Vayahúudi mʉʉntʉ muki kufuma sakami, kwabweeyyáa ave na njeo. Na sɨ yasaakwáa asaangɨre na vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ.</char></note> nɨ woowa, maa akachwaama mbere ya Yéesu. Aho, akalʉʉsa mbere ja vaantʉ voosi ˆcheene kɨmʉbwéeyyiirye amʉsaasye Yéesu na ˆvyeene ahóriiwe hahara. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Aho, maa re Yéesu akamʉsea, “Muhíínja waanɨ, kuruma kwaako kwakʉhóriirye. Tamanya na mwiikalo mʉʉja!”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆajáa akaarɨ yoolʉʉsɨka, akʉʉja mʉʉntʉ fuma kaayii kwa Yaíiro, maa akamʉsea, “Muhíínja waako awʉ́lɨɨre. Aaɨ reka tuuba kumujuuwa Mukiindya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu ˆakateere jeyyo, akamʉsea Yaíiro, “Kwiitweetya tʉkʉ, ruma vii, muhíínja waako hola arɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Yéesu ˆakafike kaayii kwa Yaíiro, akavakaanʼya vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ kwɨɨngɨra hamwɨ ne na nyuumbii, maa kaa, ˆveene ɨɨngɨra novo nɨ vala Peéteri, Yooháani, Yaakúupu, na taáta na íyo waala ʉra muhíínja. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo vaantʉ voosi varɨráa no myaa sa ʉra muhíínja. Maa kaa, Yéesu akavasea, “Reki kʉrɨra! Muhíínja sɨ awʉ́lɨɨre tʉkʉ, nɨ anyéyyiirye vii.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Vaantʉ ˆvajáa aho, vakaanda kʉmʉseka na heenchʉ, sa vajáa vatáangire ʉra muhíínja akwíire. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Aho, Yéesu akamʉkwaata mʉkono ʉra muhíínja, maa akamʉsea na ngururu, “Musinga, inʉka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Hahara, mʉtɨma waachwe ʉkamʉhɨndʉkɨra, ne akiinʉka chaangʉ. Yéesu akavasea vara vaantʉ vamʉheere chóorya ʉra muhíínja arye. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Taáta na íyo waala ʉra muhíínja vakahwaalala maatʉkʉ vii. Maa kaa, Yéesu akavakaanʼya karɨ valʉʉse kʉrɨ mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi yara ˆyajáa yafʉ́mɨɨre tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovatʉma Vatumwi Vaachwe Ikimi na Vavɨrɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matáayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maáriki 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> akavajiinga <char style="w">vatumwi</char> vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ. Akavaheera ngururu na wiimiriri wo kibirya <char style="w">mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char> no horya ndwáala. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Aho, akavatʉma vakavavariyʉrɨre vaantʉ <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> na vavahorye valwɨ́ɨrɨ. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Akavasea, “Kati ˆmookera njɨra, sumuli muriwa tʉkʉ, baa nkome tʉkʉ, mufuko tʉkʉ, chóorya tʉkʉ, mpía tʉkʉ baa na nkáancho ivɨrɨ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Kaaya ˆngʼeene mʉrɨ teengiwa, ikali haaho fʉʉrʉ sikʉ ˆmʉrɨ looka múuji ʉwo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Koonɨ kaaya yoyoosi vasíitire kʉvateengya, mpɨɨndɨ ˆmoolooka, <char style="w" lemma="Konkoma marʉrɨ">ikonkomi marʉrɨ</char> majewii yaanyu, koonekya ʉvɨ waavo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Aho, vara vatumwi vaachwe vakadoma, vakava vootweera ituri ɨrɨ fʉʉrʉ rɨra kʉnʉ voovavariyʉrɨra vaantʉ <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> no vahorya valwɨ́ɨrɨ kɨra haantʉ.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Inkwya ya Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matáayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maáriki 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Haaha, mʉtemi <char style="w" lemma="Heróode">Heróode Antípaasi</char> ajáa ateera masáare yoosi ˆyatʉmamwáa nɨ Yéesu, akoololokera sa vamwɨ va vaantʉ vaseáa nɨ Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji ˆafúfukire fuma inkwyii. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Kei, vaantʉ vamwɨ vaseáa nɨ <char style="w">Elía</char> <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> wa Ijʉva afʉ́mɨɨre na vamwɨ vaséaa nɨ ʉmwɨ wa valáali na mʉtwe wa kalɨ afúfukire. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Maa kaa, Heróode akasea, “Yooháani namʉdʉmʉla mʉtwe. Ha ʉhʉ ˆnooteera masáare yaachwe nɨ ani?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maáriki 6:14-29</ref>.</char></note> Heróode akava na mpɨɨma yo moona Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooriisha Vaantʉ Valʉme Mayana Yasaano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matáayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maáriki 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yooháani 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Vatumwi va Yéesu ˆvakahɨndʉke, vakamuwyɨɨra viintʉ vyoosi ˆvatʉ́mamire. Aho, akadomanʼya novo, maa vakiinʉka vooveene fʉʉrʉ iturii rɨmwɨ ˆraséwaa Besaída. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Maa kaa, mpuka ya vaantʉ ˆvakataange na haantʉ Yéesu ˆajáa atámiinye, maa vakamutuuba. Yéesu akavateengya, maa akaanda vakiindya masáare ya Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ no vahorya valwɨ́ɨrɨ ˆveene vasaakáa horiwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ja kyʉʉlwa ˆjikafike, vatumwi vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ vakɨɨta kʉrɨ Yéesu, maa vakamʉsea, “Aaɨ, varekere vaantʉ vakiiwʉrɨre vyóorya na vakiisaakɨre viláalo ʉko mawundii na maturii sa aha haantʉ ˆtʉrɨ nɨ kʉlɨ na kaaya ja vaantʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akavasea, “Vaheeri nyuunyu chóorya.” Maa vakamʉsea, “Tusiina chóorya tʉkʉ. Aha ɨmwaarɨ mɨkáate ɨsaano na soompa ivɨrɨ vii. Nɨ saaka wiise tʉkavawʉrɨre vaantʉ voosi ava chóorya wʉʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Aho, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte vaantʉ valʉme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">vaantʉ valʉme: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vayahúudi vavaláa vaantʉ valʉme vii, maa kaa, kwajáa kwatɨɨte vaantʉ vaki na vasinga ˆvaarya ɨyo mɨkáate na soompa.</char></note> ja mayana yasaano (5,000).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yéesu akavasea vapooji, “Viikaryi vaantʉ vitoonge vya vaantʉ makumi yasaanosaano (50).” <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Novo vakabweeyya ja ˆvyeene vajáa vaséirwe, vakaviikarya vaantʉ voosi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Aho, Yéesu akatoola ɨra mɨkáate ɨsaano na jira soompa ivɨrɨ. Akiinurirya miiso yaachwe na kurumwii yoomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Akabendʉlabendʉla, maa akavaheera vapooji vaachwe novo vakavaheera vaantʉ. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Vaantʉ voosi vakarya, vakiikuta. Vapooji vakatoorera mabéendʉ ya mɨkáate, vakamemya vikápu ikimi na vivɨrɨ.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peéteri Yooruma Yéesu noo Masía</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matáayo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maáriki 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe vajáa viikera kijiraawa. Yéesu amʉloombáa Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Ʉko Yéesu akavuurya vapooji vaachwe, “Eri, vaantʉ vaséaa nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ ani?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Novo vakamʉsea, “Vamwɨ vaséaa weewe ʉrɨ Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji, vɨɨngɨ vaséaa ʉrɨ Elía mʉláali na mʉtwe wa Ijʉva, na vɨɨngɨ vaséaa ʉrɨ ʉmwɨ wa valáali na mʉtwe va Ijʉva va kalɨ ˆafúfukire.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Aho, maa akavuurya, “Ha nyuunyu, mwaséaa nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ ani?” <char style="w">Peéteri</char> akamʉsea, “Weewe noo <char style="w">Masía</char> wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ!” <verse eid="LUK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Maa Yéesu akavakaanʼya yoosea, “Karɨ muwyɨɨra mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi isáare ɨrɨ tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoolʉʉsɨkɨra Inkwya na Kʉfʉfʉka Kwaachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matáayo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maáriki 8:31–9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Kei akavasea, “<char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char>, nɨ mpaka aturikiriwe mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, kei asiitwe nɨ vawosi, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char>, na ʉʉlawe. Maa kaa, sikʉ ya katatʉ fʉfʉlwa arɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lʉkemero lo Kʉva Mʉpooji wa Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Kei akavawyɨɨra voosi yoovasea, “Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi yoosaaka aantuube nɨ mpaka iisiite yeemweene, avaale <char style="w">mʉsaláaba</char> waachwe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lʉ́ka 14:27</ref>.</char></note> kɨra siikʉ, aantuube. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Sa mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆyoosaaka honʼya nkaasʉ yaachwe, kɨɨtaaha arɨ, maa kaa, mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆyookɨɨtaaha nkaasʉ yaachwe sa nɨɨnɨ ʉwo kɨɨhonʼya arɨ. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Kwatɨɨte kʉnáálo che mʉʉntʉ kuturya weerʉ yoosi, maa kaa, ataahe nkaasʉ yaachwe? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi aanyónɨɨre soni nɨɨnɨ na masáare yaanɨ, baa Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ moonera arɨ soni, mpɨɨndɨ ˆakuújire na nkongojima ya Taáta na <char style="w">mirimʉ miija</char>. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, vamwaarɨ vɨɨngɨ viímire aha, sɨ varɨ kukwya tʉkʉ mpaka vʉʉyone Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovalandʉka Buuwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matáayo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maáriki 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Ja sikʉ inaanɨ jei ˆjikalooke keende Yéesu ˆalʉʉsa ayo masáare, Yéesu akaambʉkanʼya na vala Peéteri, Yaakúupu na Yooháani na luulwii noo mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆamʉloombáa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, buuwo yaachwe ɨkavalandʉka, ɨngo jaachwe jikava njerʉ chwee, mpaka jindoolavalava. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Koonka, vaantʉ valʉme vavɨrɨ vakafʉmɨra maa vakaanda lʉʉsɨka ne. Novo nɨ vala <char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> na Elía vajáa. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Vajáa voonekana na nkongojima ya kurumwii na valʉʉsɨkáa na Yéesu ˆvyeene arɨ kiimanʼya mʉrɨmo wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ kwa inkwya yaachwe ʉko Yerusaléemu.<verse eid="LUK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, Peéteri na vara vatumwi viivaachwe vajáa vanyéyyiirye fúti. ˆVakiinʉke, vakamoona Yéesu na nkongojima yaachwe. Na kei vakoona vaantʉ vavɨrɨ vajáa viímire ne. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Na kati vara vaantʉ vavɨrɨ ˆviinʉkáa fuma kʉrɨ Yéesu, maa Peéteri akamʉsea Yéesu, “Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ, vyabooha tʉveere haaha aha. Tʉjeenge vivaanda vitatʉ, kɨmwɨ chaako, kɨmwɨ cha Mʉ́sa na kɨmwɨ cha Elía.” Peéteri alʉʉsa jeyyo maa kaa, sɨ ataangáa kɨra ˆyoolʉʉsa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Na viintʉ Peéteri ˆajáa akaarɨ yoolʉʉsɨka jeyyo, ichu rɨkafʉmɨra, maa rɨkavawɨɨkɨra. Aho, vakoofa maatʉkʉ vii.<verse eid="LUK 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Sawúti ɨkafuma aho ichwii, yoosea, “Ʉhʉ nɨ Mwaana waanɨ. Yeeye namʉsaawʉla. Mʉteereri yeeye.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Na ɨyo sawúti ˆɨkalooke, Yéesu akoónekana arɨ yeemweene. Vapooji vaachwe sɨ vamuwyɨɨra mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi masáare aya ˆvajáa vɨɨ́ne sikʉ ijo tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉtavana ˆArɨ na Murimʉ Mʉvɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matáayo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maáriki 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Lomʉtóondo yaachwe mpɨɨndɨ ˆvagiritáa fuma luulwii, vakalʉmana na mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Aho, ʉmwɨ wa vaantʉ va ɨyo mpuka akalʉʉsɨka na ngururu yoosea, “Mukiindya, nookʉloomba ʉmʉlaange mʉtavana waanɨ, yeeye noo mwaana waanɨ wa mpeke. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Yeeye atɨɨte <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ mɨvɨ">murimʉ mʉvɨ</char> ˆwamʉtáavityaa akaanda tʉla isóso mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ. Kei, wamusíngisyasingiisyaa akawya na ɨsɨ ja arɨ na kiinkwiisha, maa de ɨndootuumpa ifulo mʉlomwii. Ʉhʉ murimʉ mʉvɨ wamutúrikiryaa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, wamʉrékaa kiduudi vii. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Navalóombire vapooji vaako vuukibirye ʉhʉ murimʉ mʉvɨ, maa kaa, vasíindirwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Aka! Ɨhɨ mbyaala sɨ ˆirúmaa, na ˆyakɨɨkana. Niikale na nyuunyu mpaka naadi? Na nɨvayimirirye mpaka naadi? Hoonɨ mʉreete mʉtavana waako na aha!”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Kati ʉra mʉtavana ˆasesáa na kwa Yéesu, murimʉ mʉvɨ ʉkamʉvayya na ɨsɨ, maa ʉkamʉkwaatya kiinkwiisha. Aho, Yéesu akʉʉyamirirya ʉra murimʉ mʉvɨ, akamʉhorya ʉra mʉtavana, maa akamʉhɨndʉla na kʉrɨ taáta waavo. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Vaantʉ voosi vakatʉlʉvala maatʉkʉ vii koona ʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yéesu Yoolʉʉsɨkɨra Kei Inkwya na Ʉfʉfʉ́ʉko Waachwe</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matáayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maáriki 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Mpɨɨndɨ vaantʉ ˆvajáa vakaarɨ vahwáalɨɨre sa yoosi Yéesu ˆajáa abwéeyyiirye, maa akavasea vapooji vaachwe, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Teereri neeja aya ˆnoosaaka nɨvawyɨɨre. Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ valandʉkwa arɨ na vɨɨkwa arɨ mɨkonwii ya vaantʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Maa kaa, vapooji vaachwe sɨ vataanga ʉvariyuli wa masáare yara tʉkʉ. Masáare aya yajáa yiivisa kwaavo sa vadɨɨre taanga. Kei voofáa kumuurya.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ani nɨ Mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matáayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maáriki 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Haaha kʉkava na nkaani kwa vapooji va Yéesu nɨ ani arʉʉva mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ kati yaavo voosi. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu ˆakataange miiririkano yaavo, akamwaanɨrɨra musinga muduudi, maa akamwiimya heehi ne. <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>Aho, maa akavasea, “Mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆarɨ mʉteengya musinga ja ʉhʉ sa irina raanɨ, kʉva arɨ aantéengiirye nɨɨnɨ. Kei, yoyoosi ˆarɨ kʉʉnteengya nɨɨnɨ, kʉva arɨ amʉtéengiirye Mʉlʉʉngʉ, na yeeye aantʉma. Sa ʉra ˆarɨ mudúúdi kufuma kʉrɨ nyuunyu noo mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ kʉlookya voosi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutumia Irina ra Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maáriki 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yooháani akamʉsea Yéesu, “Mʉkʉ́lʉ, tamwɨɨ́ne mʉʉntʉ yookibirya mirimʉ mɨvɨ kwa irina raako, maa tʉkamʉkaanʼya sa viintʉ sɨ arɨ hamwɨ na suusu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akavasea, “Karɨ mʉmʉkáanʼyaa tʉkʉ, sa ˆmweene sɨ yoovakɨɨkana nyuunyu, nɨ hamwɨ arɨ na nyuunyu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vasamaría Voosiita Kʉmʉteengya Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Sikʉ ja Yéesu jo sʉmʉlwa na kurumwii ˆjikasengerere, maa yeeye akawolola kisho chaachwe yoodoma na Yerusaléemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Yeeye akatʉma vaantʉ valongoole na iturii rɨmwɨ ra ɨsɨ ya <char style="w">Samaría</char> sa vakiimye neeja haantʉ ˆarɨ fɨkɨra. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Maa kaa, vaantʉ va ɨro ituri vakasiita kʉmʉteengya sa viintʉ aleáa na Yerusaléemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Vapooji vaachwe, noo kʉsea vala Yaakúupu na Yooháani, ˆvakoone jeyyo, maa vakamʉsea, “Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ, tʉloombe mooto ukiime fuma kurumwii sa ʉvamale wʉʉ [ja ˆvyeene Elía abweeyya]?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="2KI 1:10">2 Vatemi 1:10</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 1:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 1:14">14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akavavalandʉkɨra, akavadalavya <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>[yoosea, nyuunyu sɨ mʉmányire nɨ vaantʉ ˆvarɨ joolɨ mʉrɨ tʉkʉ]. Aho, maa vakatamanya na iturii rɨɨngɨ.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Koonɨ Mʉʉntʉ Yoosaaka Kumutuuba Yéesu Kɨkomi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matáayo 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Kati Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe ˆvajáa lʉyeendwii, maa mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ akamʉsea, “Kukutuuba ndɨrɨ na haantʉ hohoosi ˆʉrɨ doma.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Mʉʉnjʉ jatɨɨte viláalo mpáángii, na ndee jatɨɨte vivururu, maa kaa, Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ asiina baa ho laarya mʉtwe waachwe vii tʉkʉ.”<figure style="fig" alt="fox shelter" file="bk00051c.tif" size="col" copy="The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="9:58">Kɨláalo cha mʉʉnjʉ</figure><verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Aho, Yéesu akamʉsea mʉʉntʉ wɨɨngɨ ˆajáa aho, “Ntuuba.” Maa kaa, ʉra mʉʉntʉ akamʉsea, “Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ, reka ta nkataahe taáta wiitʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Reka vaantʉ ˆvaakwya vataahe vaantʉ ˆvaakwya viivaavo, maa kaa, weewe doma ʉkavariyʉle Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Mʉʉntʉ wɨɨngɨ akamʉsea Yéesu, “Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ, kukutuuba ndɨrɨ, maa kaa, reka ta nkavasee vaantʉ va kaayii kwaanɨ nasúukiirye.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akamʉsea, “Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi aándire rɨma, maa kei ɨndoolaanga kɨrɨ nyuma, ʉwo sɨ asaakwa Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ tʉkʉ.”<figure style="fig" alt="person farming" file="lb00018c.tif" size="col" copy="Bass, The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="9:62">Mʉʉntʉ yoorɨma</figure><verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovatʉma Vapooji Makumi Mufungatɨ na Vavɨrɨ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Ayo ˆyakalooke, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> Mweenevyoosi akavasaawʉla vapooji vɨɨngɨ makumi mufungatɨ na vavɨrɨ (72), maa akavatʉma vavɨrɨvɨrɨ. Voovo vakalongoola na kɨra múuji na kɨra haantʉ ˆasaakáa tamanya yeeye mweeneevyo. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Viintʉ vyo chwa nɨ foo viri, maa kaa, vachwi nɨ vake. Sa jeyyo, mʉloombi Mweenevyoosi wo chwa, atʉme vachwi, na iwundii raachwe ro chwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Haaha tamanyi, na mʉtaange nɨ vatʉma niise nyuunyu ja vaana va muundi katɨ na katɨ ya mbʉʉjɨ. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Sumuli mpía tʉkʉ, mufuko wo kɨɨnjɨra tʉkʉ, baa viráatʉ vya kavɨrɨ tʉkʉ. Mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉrɨ njirii, karɨ mʉndoololoosha ko luumbya vaantʉ tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Nyuumba yoyoosi ˆmʉrɨ kɨɨngɨra, valuumbyi jei, ‘Mwiikalo mʉʉja ʉve nyuumbii ɨhɨ!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Koonɨ mwiikalo mʉʉja ʉrɨ na mweenenyuumba, mwiikalo waanyu mʉʉja kiikala ʉrɨ ne. Maa kaa, koonɨ mweenenyuumba sɨ yoovahokera na mwiikalo mʉʉja, mwiikalo waanyu mʉʉja hɨndʉka ʉrɨ na kʉrɨ nyuunyu. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Ikali nyuumba yɨɨyo ɨmwɨ, kʉnʉ moorya no nywa kɨra ˆcheene mooheewa. Sa mʉtʉmami ɨɨma neeja kʉrɨhwa marɨho yaachwe. Kʉsaamasaama fuma nyuumba ɨhɨ fʉʉrʉ ɨra tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Koonɨ mwɨɨ́ngɨɨre múuji ʉmwɨ na vaantʉ va múuji ʉwo vavateengiirye na cheerʉ, iryi vyóorya ˆviri vɨɨkwa mbere yaanyu. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Valwɨ́ɨrɨ ˆvarɨ múujii ʉwo vahoryi na mʉvasee, ‘<char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> wafíkire kʉrɨ nyuunyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Maa kaa, múuji wowoosi ˆmʉrɨ kɨɨngɨra maa vasiite kʉvateengya, looki, na mʉtamanye na njirii ja ʉwo múuji mʉsee jei, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘Baa marʉrɨ ya múuji waanyu ˆmeene yanámatɨɨre majewii yiiswi, <char style="w" lemma="Konkoma marʉrɨ">tayakónkomire</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">tayakónkomire: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laanga </char><char style="bdit">konkoma marʉrɨ</char> Ʉtamanulii wa Masáare na Kɨlaangi.</note> kʉvalʉma kutu ʉvɨ waanyu. Maa kaa, taangi Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ wafíkire kʉrɨ nyuunyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Nɨ vawyɨɨra niise, sikʉ ɨyo, kʉva viri pwee kwa múuji wa <char style="w" lemma="Sodóoma na Gomóora">Sodóoma</char> kʉlookya múuji ʉwo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="GEN 19:1-29">Ncholo 19:1-29</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Marema kwa Míiji ˆƗrɨ Siita Valandʉka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matáayo 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>Mpolaɨ múuji wa Korasíini! Mpolaɨ ituri ra Besaída! Sa ngaarɨ myuujíisa ˆyatʉ́mamirwe kwaanyu, ngaarɨ yatʉmamwa míiji ya <char style="w">Tíiro na Sidóoni</char>, ngaarɨ <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">vamʉvalandʉkɨra</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ kalɨ vii, ko kiivɨkɨra magunía no kiihaka mavu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Maa kaa, sikʉ ɨra yo lamʉrɨrwa vaantʉ voosi, kʉva ɨrɨ pwee kwa vaantʉ va míiji ya Tíiro na Sidóoni kʉlookya nyuunyu. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Naanyu vaantʉ va múuji wa Kaperenáumu, eri, kiinʉlwa mʉrɨ fʉʉrʉ kurumwii wʉʉ? Aka tʉkʉ! Kiimiriwa mʉrɨ fʉʉrʉ <char style="w" lemma="Ntare">Ntarii</char>.<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Mʉʉntʉ ˆavatéereraa nyuunyu, aantéereraa nɨɨnɨ. Na ˆavasíitaa nyuunyu, aansíitaa nɨɨnɨ. Kei mʉʉntʉ ˆaansíitaa nɨɨnɨ, amusíitaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ na yeeye aantʉma.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vapooji Makumi Mufungatɨ na Vavɨrɨ Voohɨndʉka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Vara vapooji makumi mufungatɨ na vavɨrɨ (72) ˆvakahɨndʉke, vakamuwyɨɨra Yéesu na cheerʉ voosea, “Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ, baa <char style="w">mirimʉ mɨvɨ</char> tookiikibirya kwa irina raako na yootʉteera!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Nɨjáa naroonáa <char style="w">Irimʉ</char> roohangalamʉka fuma kurumwii ja lʉlávo. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Laangi, navahɨ́ɨre wiimiriri mweeri ya ʉra mʉvɨ kwa kɨra kɨɨntʉ. Kwa ngururu ijo, lwaata mweende njoka na ingi, kei kusiina kɨɨntʉ ˆkɨrɨ vatamikya tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Baa neembe nɨ jeyyo, kʉvyeendi sa viintʉ mirimʉ mɨvɨ yoovateera tʉkʉ, maa kaa, vyeendi sa viintʉ marina yaanyu yaándikirwe kurumwii.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoova na Cheerʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matáayo 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ɨʼɨra, Yéesu kʉnʉ avyeéndire mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ kwa ngururu ja <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char>, maa akasea, “Nookʉdʉʉmba ee Taáta, Mweenevyoosi wa kurumu na ɨsɨ, sa masáare aya ʉvavisa vara ˆvarɨ na tooti na mɨryʉʉngʉ, maa kaa, ʉkavakʉnʉkʉrɨra vadúúdi. Kɨkomi Taáta, ivyo noo vyakweerya mʉtɨma.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Kei akasea, “Taáta waanɨ aankwáatiirye viintʉ vyoosi. ˆMweene amʉmányire Mwaana nɨ Taáta vii. Kusiina wɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ. Kei ˆmweene amʉmányire Taáta nɨ Mwaana vii, na mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆmweene Mwaana arɨ saaka kʉmʉkʉnʉkʉrɨra.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Aho, Yéesu akavavalandʉkɨra vapooji vaachwe, akalʉʉsɨka na vooveene vii kijiraawii, akavasea, “Yatalariwa miiso aya ˆyookoona masáare aya! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Nɨ vawyɨɨra niise, <char style="w">valáali na mʉtwe</char> ˆvarɨ foo na vatemi vajáa vatɨɨte mpɨɨma yo koona aya ˆmookoona nyuunyu, maa kaa, sɨ vayoona tʉkʉ. Kei, vajáa vatɨɨte mpɨɨma yo teera ˆmeene mooteera nyuunyu, maa kaa, sɨ vayateera tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mʉsamaría Mʉʉja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, <char style="w" lemma="Vakiindya va Miiro">mukiindya wa Miiro</char> ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ akɨɨma, maa akamuurya Yéesu ko mʉyera, akasea, “Mukiindya, che ndɨrɨ bweeyya sa mpokere nkaasʉ ya sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “<char style="w">Miiro</char> ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ joolɨ yalʉʉsa? Che ʉsómaa weewe aho?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Ʉra mukiindya wa Miiro akamʉsea Yéesu, “Vyaandɨkwa jei, ‘Mweende <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ waako, na mʉtɨma waako woosi, na nkaasʉ yaako yoosi, na ngururu jaako joosi, na mʉryʉʉngʉ waako woosi.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27a </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 6:5</ref>.</char></note> Kei, ‘Ʉmweende mwiiwaako ja ˆvyeene wiiyenda mweeneevyo.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27b </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Valáawi 19:18</ref>.</char></note>” <verse eid="LUK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Wuúyiirye vyoovyo, bweeyya jeyyo, naawe turya ʉrɨ nkaasʉ ya sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Ʉra mukiindya wa Miiro asaakáa kiiyonekya kɨkomi yeeye nɨ mʉwoloki. Sa jeyyo akamuurya Yéesu kei yoosea, “Ha mwiiwaanɨ nɨ ani?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ agiritáa fuma Yerusaléemu yoodoma na múujii wa Yerɨ́ɨko. Njirii akakɨɨmɨrɨrwa nɨ viívi. Vakamufumya ɨngo jaachwe, vakamʉvaa mpaka vakamʉtamikya, vakamʉreka aséngerɨɨre kukwya.<verse eid="LUK 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Haaha ɨkava ja baháati, <char style="w" lemma="Veeneɨsɨ">mweeneɨsɨ</char> ʉmwɨ wa Ijʉva alookáa na ɨra njɨra. ˆAkamoone, akakengeeja na ivarwii, maa akiilookera. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Viivyo, <char style="w" lemma="Valáawi">Mʉláawi</char> ʉmwɨ ne alookáa na aho. ˆAkamoone ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa atámikiiwe, ne akakengeeja nɨ ivarwii, maa akiilookera.<verse eid="LUK 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Maa kaa, <char style="w" lemma="Samaría">Mʉsamaría</char> ʉmwɨ ne akeráa njɨra, akatweera na ɨra njɨra. ˆAkamoone ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa atámikiiwe, maa akamoonera mbavariri. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Akamʉseeserera, akamooyya njʉʉma jaachwe na <char style="w">diváai</char>, maa akamʉhaka makuta. Akajichuunga njʉʉma jaachwe na ntaamɨ, maa akamwaambukya ndákwii yaachwe. Aho, akamʉtwaala fʉʉrʉ nyuumbii ya vayeni na akava yoomʉlaangirirya. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Sikʉ ya kavɨrɨ yaachwe, akatoola mpía ja <char style="w">dináari</char> ivɨrɨ, akamʉheera mweenenyuumba ya vayeni, maa akamʉsea, ‘Mʉlaangirirye ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ. Koonɨ iji jasírire na woóngeriirye mpía jɨɨngɨ so mʉlawurya, ˆndɨrɨ hɨndʉka kʉrɨha ndɨrɨ.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akamuurya ʉra mukiindya wa Miiro, “Kati ya ava vatatʉ nɨ ani noo mwiiwaachwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mwiiwaachwe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aha Yéesu sɨ alʉʉsa isáare mwiiwaako ja mʉʉntʉ ˆiíkalaa heehi ne tʉkʉ. Kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, Yéesu asea mwiiwaachwe, isáare iwarɨwarɨ. Sa jeyyo, mustáarii ʉhʉ, </char><char style="fk" closed="false">mwiiwaachwe</char><char style="ft" closed="false">nɨ baa Mʉsamaría, mʉʉntʉ wa nkolo ˆyasʉʉlwasʉʉlwa nɨ Vayahúudi.</char></note> wa ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆajáa akɨɨmɨrɨrwa akatamikiwa nɨ viívi?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Ʉra mukiindya wa Miiro akasea, “Nɨ ʉra ˆamʉlaanga na riiso ra wʉʉja.” Aho, maa Yéesu akamʉsea, “Doma, naawe ʉkabweeyye viivyo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Kaayii Kwaala Maárita na Maríia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Yéesu na vapooji vaachwe vakakwaata njɨra, maa vakɨɨngɨra iturii rɨmwɨ. Aho, maa mʉʉntʉ muki ʉmwɨ ˆasewáa Maárita akamʉteengya na kaayii kwaachwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Maárita ajáa atɨɨte mudúúdi waachwe ˆasewáa Maríia. Yeeye ajáa iikala mawulwii ya Yéesu Mweenevyoosi kʉnʉ yoomʉteerera. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Maa kaa, Maárita ajʉʉwɨkáa na mɨrɨmo ˆɨrɨ foo yo mʉteengya mʉyeni. Sa jeyyo, akadoma na kʉrɨ Yéesu, maa akamʉsea, “Mweenevyoosi, sɨ wookoona nɨ vyavɨɨha viintʉ ʉhʉ mudúúdi waanɨ ˆyookʉʉndekera mɨrɨmo yoosi nɨɨmweene tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Haaha mʉwyɨɨre aanyambɨre.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu Mweenevyoosi akamʉsea, “Maárita, Maárita, sa che woojʉʉwɨka na wookoofa sa viintʉ ˆviri foo? <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Kɨɨntʉ ˆchoosaakwa nɨ kimudu vii. Maríia asáawɨɨre kɨɨntʉ ˆchabooha, na kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ daha kʉkɨseyya kʉrɨ yeeye tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookiindya Kʉmʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matáayo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ajáa haantʉ hamwɨ yoomʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. ˆAkahʉmʉle, maa ʉmwɨ wa <char style="w">vatumwi</char> vaachwe akamʉsea, “Aaɨ mʉkʉ́lʉ, tukiindye baa suusu kʉmʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ ja viintʉ Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji ˆavakiindya vatumwi vaachwe.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Mpɨɨndɨ ˆmoomʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, mʉlʉʉse jei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Taáta [wiitʉ wa kurumwii,]</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">irina raako rɨbweeyyiriwe nkongojima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">ʉtemi waako wʉʉje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">[ˆMeene woosaaka yatʉmamwe aha weerwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">yatʉmamwe ja ˆvyeene yatʉ́mamwaa ʉko kurumwii.]<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Ʉtʉheere chóorya chiitʉ cha kɨra siikʉ.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Ʉtʉsee ʉvɨ wiitʉ wasírire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">ja ˆvyeene suusu tavaséaa vara ˆvatʉhonerya ʉvɨ waavo wasírire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Kʉtʉrekera twɨɨngɨre na mʉtehwii tʉkʉ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">[maa kaa, ʉtʉlamurirye na ʉra Mʉvɨ.]’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavasea, “Hoonɨ iririkani, koonɨ ʉmwɨ waanyu adómire na kwa kɨjeengi chaachwe nuuchikʉ katɨ, maa amʉsee kɨjeengi chaachwe, ‘Aaɨ kɨjeengi, hoonɨ nkopesha mɨkáate ɨtatʉ. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Amwaarɨ kɨjeengi chaanɨ yookera njɨra alúumbiirye uchikʉ ʉhʉ, na nɨɨnɨ nsiina kɨɨntʉ cho mʉheera tʉkʉ.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Maa kaa, ʉra ˆarɨ nyuumbii amʉsee, ‘Reka kʉʉnjuuwa, nachúungire mʉryaango! Kei, nɨɨnɨ na vaana vaanɨ tahʉ́mwɨɨre laala. Sɨ ndɨrɨ kiinʉka nɨkʉheere chóorya tʉkʉ.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Nɨ vawyɨɨra niise, koonɨ mʉʉntʉ ʉwo atúubire loomba, kɨjeengi chaachwe kiinʉka arɨ na amʉheere kɨra ˆyoosaaka. Sɨ arɨ bweeyya jeyyo sa viintʉ nɨ kɨjeengi chaachwe tʉkʉ, maa kaa, sa viintʉ atúubire loomba.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Sa jeyyo, nɨ vawyɨɨra niise, loombi, naanyu heewa mʉrɨ, saakiri, naanyu turya mʉrɨ, luumbyi mʉryaangwii, naanyu yʉʉrɨrwa mʉrɨ. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Sa kɨra ˆalóombaa, ahéewaa na ʉra ˆasáakɨraa, atúryaa na ʉra ˆalúumbyaa mʉryaangwii, ayʉ́ʉrɨrwaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Eri, kwatɨɨte ʉmwɨ waanyu nyuunyu vala taáta mwaana waachwe ˆarɨ mʉloomba soompa, amʉheere njoka wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Bakʉ kei koonɨ amʉlóombire ii, amʉheere ingi wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Haaha koonɨ nyuunyu baa neembe mʉrɨ vavɨ mʉmányire kʉvaheera vaana vaanyu viintʉ ˆvyabooha, ha Taáta waanyu wa kurumwii sɨ arɨ bweeyya vyabooha kʉlookya ivyo vyaanyu ko vaheera <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char> vara ˆvoomʉloomba tʉkʉ wʉʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu na Belisebúuri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matáayo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Maáriki 3:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, Yéesu akibiryáa <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ mɨvɨ">murimʉ mʉvɨ</char> fuma kwa kimumu ʉmwɨ. Ʉwo murimʉ ˆʉkakibiriwe, maa ʉra mʉʉntʉ akaanda lʉʉsɨka. Aho, ɨra mpuka ya vaantʉ vajáa hara vakahwaalala. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Maa kaa, vamwɨ va vaantʉ ˆvajáa aho vakasea, “Yookibirya mirimʉ mɨvɨ kwa ngururu ja <char style="w">Belisebúuri</char>, noo kʉsea <char style="w">Irimʉ</char>.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ novo vamʉyeráa ko mʉloomba avalaɨre isháara fuma kurumwii.<verse eid="LUK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu kʉnʉ yootaanga miiririkano yaavo, akavasea, “Ʉtemi wowoosi koonɨ wiigávire havɨrɨ kwiilwa woowo kwa woowo, ʉtemi ʉwo, sɨ ʉrɨ lʉʉnga tʉkʉ. Kei, koonɨ vaantʉ va lʉkolo lʉmwɨ viigávire, lʉkolo ʉlo, sɨ lʉrɨ lʉʉnga tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Haaha koonɨ Irimʉ riigávire havɨrɨ, ʉtemi waachwe joolɨ ʉrɨ lʉʉnga? Nɨ lʉʉsa niise jeyyo sa nyuunyu moosea, nooseyya mirimʉ mɨvɨ kwa ngururu ja Belisebúuri. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Ha de haaha koonɨ nookibirya mirimʉ mɨvɨ kwa lʉvɨro lwa Belisebúuri, ha vaantʉ vaanyu nɨ kwa lʉvɨro lwa ani vakíbiryaa mirimʉ mɨvɨ? Sa jeyyo, avo kʉvalamʉrɨra varɨ nyuunyu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Maa kaa, koonɨ nɨɨnɨ nookibirya mirimʉ mɨvɨ kwa lʉvɨro lwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, taangi haaha <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> wafíkire kʉrɨ nyuunyu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Mpɨɨndɨ mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ na ngururu iichʉ́ʉngɨrɨɨre mata yaachwe kʉlaangirirya nyuumba yaachwe, máari jaachwe nɨ nkaasʉ jiri. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Maa kaa, mʉʉntʉ wɨɨngɨ ˆarɨ na ngururu kʉlookya yeeye koonɨ amukíimɨrɨɨre na amusíindire, mʉhoka arɨ mata yaachwe yoosi yara ˆiiláangyaa na nyahɨra arɨ máari joosi, maa asʉmʉle. <verse eid="LUK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>Mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ʉra sɨ ˆarɨ ivarwii raanɨ, ʉwo nɨ mʉvɨ waanɨ. Kei, ʉra sɨ ˆajíingaa hamwɨ na nɨɨnɨ, apálaa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mʉʉntʉ ˆArɨ na Murimʉ Mʉvɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matáayo 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>Mpɨɨndɨ murimʉ mʉvɨ ˆʉrɨ fuma kwa mʉʉntʉ, wadómaa na ɨsɨ ya ibaláángwii kʉra ˆkusiina maaji noo saakɨra haantʉ ho hʉmʉlʉkɨra. Na ˆʉrɨ siindwa kʉhoona aho haantʉ ho hʉmʉlʉkɨra, sea ʉrɨ, ‘Hɨndʉka ndɨrɨ na nyuumbii kwaanɨ haantʉ ˆnafuma.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>ˆɄrɨ hɨndʉka, washáanaa ɨra nyuumba yafyáahɨɨrwe no haambwa vyabooha. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Jeyyo, ʉwo murimʉ mʉvɨ wadómaa noo sʉmʉla viivaachwe mufungatɨ, vavɨ kʉlookya woowo. Aho, ɨyo mirimʉ yɨɨ́ngɨraa kwa ʉwo mʉʉntʉ na yiíkalaa aho. Ʉwo mʉʉntʉ asáambʉkɨrwaa kʉlookya vya ncholo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉvyeenda kwa Kɨmáárɨ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆalʉʉsáa ayo masáare, mʉʉntʉ muki ʉmwɨ ˆajáa aho mpukii ya vaantʉ, akatʉla isóso yoosea, “Yatalariwa ɨnda ˆyakuvyaala na masʉʉsʉ ˆwoonka!” <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akamʉsea, “Vatalariwa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ vara ˆvarɨtéeraa no rituuba isáare ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vaantʉ Voosaaka Valaɨrwe Isháara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matáayo 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Maáriki 8:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Mpɨɨndɨ mpuka ya vaantʉ ˆyatuubáa kɨɨngɨka, maa Yéesu akatuuba kiindya yoosea, “Ɨhɨ mbyaala nɨ mbɨ, yoosaaka yoonekiwe isháara, sɨ ɨrɨ heewa isháara yoyoosi tʉkʉ, maa kaa, ɨra ya Yóona <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char>. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Sa ja viintʉ Yóona ˆaava isháara kwa Vanináawi, noo ˆvyeene <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> arʉʉva kwa mbyaala ɨhɨ.<verse eid="LUK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Sikʉ ya ʉlamu mʉtemi muki wa ɨsɨ ya saame kɨɨma arɨ na vaantʉ va mbyaala ɨhɨ, ne lʉʉsa arɨ irya. Sa yeeye ajáa avaa njɨra fuma ɨsɨ ya kʉlɨ mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, akʉʉja joo teerera tooti ja mʉtemi Solomóoni.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1 Vatemi 10:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Masáare ya Mpɨɨndɨ 9:1-12</ref>.</char></note> Haaha aha amwaarɨ mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ kʉlookya Solomóoni. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Kei, sikʉ ya ʉlamu vaantʉ va Nináawi kɨɨma varɨ na vaantʉ va ɨhɨ mbyaala, novo lʉʉsa varɨ irya. Sa Vanináawi ˆvakateere ʉvariyuli wa Yóona, <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">vavalandʉka</char> fuma uvii waavo, na aha amwaarɨ mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ kʉlookya Yóona!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="JON 3:5">Yóona 3:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɨweerʉ cha Mʉvɨrɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matáayo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>Kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆakórereryaa kɨmʉrɨ, maa akakɨvɨɨka haantʉ ˆhiivisa tʉkʉ au akakɨkʉnɨkɨrɨra na nyiingʉ ya kweenga tʉkʉ. Kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, kɨmʉrɨ nɨ kyaángwii chavɨ́ɨkwaa, sa vara ˆvookɨɨngɨra voone kɨweerʉ.<verse eid="LUK 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Riiso nɨ kɨmʉrɨ cha mʉvɨrɨ waako. Koonɨ riiso rɨrɨ nkaasʉ, mʉvɨrɨ waako woosi wamema kɨweerʉ. Maa kaa, koonɨ riiso raako rasaambʉka, mʉvɨrɨ waako wamema kilwiirya. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Haaha ʉlaange neeja, kɨweerʉ ˆʉrɨ nocho karɨ jɨ kɨve kilwiirya tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Haaha koonɨ mʉvɨrɨ waako woosi ʉrɨ na kɨweerʉ baa kusiina haantʉ ˆharɨ na kilwiirya tʉkʉ, mʉvɨrɨ waako woosi watɨɨte kɨweerʉ ja viintʉ kɨmʉrɨ ˆchakʉmʉ́rɨkɨraa na kɨweerʉ chaachwe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovadalavya Mafarisáayo na Vakiindya va Miiro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matáayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maáriki 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yéesu ˆakamarikirye lʉʉsa ayo masáare, maa <char style="w" lemma="Mafarisáayo">Mʉfarisáayo</char> ʉmwɨ akamʉteengya noo rya chákurya kaayii kwaachwe. Yéesu akatamanya, akɨɨngɨra maa akiikala méesii kurya chákurya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Ʉwo Mʉfarisáayo ˆakamoone Yéesu yoorya baa kooyya mɨkono ja ˆvyeene tʉʉva jasea tʉkʉ, akahwaalala maatʉkʉ vii. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Aho, maa Yéesu Mweenevyoosi akamʉsea, “Nyuunyu Mafarisáayo musúuntaa ndʉvo na saháani kwa weerwii vii, maa kaa, mitimii yaanyu mwamema kʉnyahɨra máari na ʉvɨ. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Nyuunyu mʉrɨ vahoho! Eri, sɨ mootaanga ʉra ˆʉʉmba weerwii sɨ noo ˆʉʉmba isii tʉkʉ wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Vaambiriryi vakɨva ko mɨtɨma yaanyu yoosi, na viintʉ vyɨɨngɨ vyoosi booha viri kwaanyu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>Nɨ mpolaɨ nyuunyu Mafarisáayo! Nyuunyu mʉtóolaa ilʉʉndʉ rɨmwɨ ra malʉʉndʉ ikimi baa vira viintʉ viduudi, baa ja mbowa ja masaambɨ na viintʉ ˆvibwéeyyaa chóorya kinyʉkɨre. Maa kaa, sɨ mʉkwáatyaa ʉwoloki na kweenda kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ tʉkʉ. Mwasaakwa mʉtʉmame aya na baa kei, karɨ mʉreke aya yɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>Nɨ mpolaɨ kʉrɨ nyuunyu Mafarisáayo, sa mweenda kiikala machuumbii ya mbere <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">masinagóogii</char> na kuluumbiwa kwa nyemi sóokwii! <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Nɨ mpolaɨ kwaanyu sa mwiifwɨ́ɨne na <char style="w">mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra</char> ˆjisiina aláama, na vaantʉ vayéendaa mweeri yaachwe baa taanga tʉkʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Aho, maa ʉmwɨ wa <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> akamʉsea Yéesu, “Mukiindya, ayo ulúusire nɨ kituki. Baa suusu vakiindya va Miiro <char style="w" lemma="Tʉkɨra">ʉtʉtʉ́kɨɨre</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Mpolaɨ kʉrɨ nyuunyu vakiindya va Miiro! Nyuunyu mwiitíikyaa vaantʉ miriwa ˆyarutaha sɨ ˆvarɨ daha kwiitɨɨka, maa kaa, kʉmba nyuunyu veeneevyo sɨ mʉvaámbiriryaa baa nɨ imaamba vii tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Mpolaɨ kʉrɨ nyuunyu, sa mwajéengereraa mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra ja valáali na mʉtwe, vara ˆvʉʉlawa nɨ vala baaba waanyu! <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Jeyyo, nyuunyu moónekyaa mwaruma yara vala baaba waanyu ˆvatʉmama. Voovo vavʉláa valáali na mʉtwe, na nyuunyu moovajeengera mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra avo valáali na mʉtwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Ɨkɨ noo kɨra Mʉlʉʉngʉ ˆalʉʉsa kwa tooti yaachwe, ‘Laanga, vatʉma ndɨrɨ valáali na mʉtwe na vatumwi na kwaavo, maa kaa, vamwɨ kʉvʉʉlaa varɨ na vɨɨngɨ kʉvaturikirya varɨ.’<verse eid="LUK 11:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Haaha, vaantʉ va mbyaala ɨhɨ lamʉrɨrwa varɨ sa sakami ya valáali na mʉtwe voosi, ɨra ˆyiitwa keende weerʉ ˆyʉʉmbwa, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>kwaandɨra sakami ya Abéeli, mpaka sakami ya Sakaría, ʉra ˆʉʉlaɨrwa katɨ na katɨ ya masabáahʉ na Haantʉ Haaja. Kɨkomi noovawyɨɨra vaantʉ va mbyaala ɨhɨ lamʉrɨrwa varɨ kwa ayo yoosi.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>Mpolaɨ nyuunyu vakiindya va Miiro! Nyuunyu mʉtʉ́ʉnɨkaa njɨra ya vaantʉ yo mʉtaanga Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Nyuunyu sɨ mwɨɨpata tʉkʉ, kei vara ˆvoosaaka kwɨɨpata nyuunyu mʉvakɨ́tɨraa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yéesu ˆakafume kaayii kwa ʉra Mʉfarisáayo, maa vakiindya va Miiro na Mafarisáayo vakaanda hʉʉmba na vakaanda kumuurya masáare ˆyarɨ foo. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Vasaakáa vamʉtee kwa masáare yaachwe sa vapate kɨmwɨ cho musitakirya.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ʉkweembi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matáayo 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, iyɨɨmbɨ ra vaantʉ mayana na mayana vajáa viijiinga fʉʉrʉ vandookiilwaatɨrɨra, kʉnʉ voomʉteerera <char style="w">Yéesu</char>. Yéesu akaanda ta lʉʉsɨka na vapooji vaachwe yoovasea, “Laangi neeja, mʉnehe ʉsasɨ wa <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char>, noo kʉsea ʉkweembi. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Kusiina isáare ˆrakʉnɨkɨrɨrwa sɨ ˆrɨrɨ kʉnʉkʉlwa tʉkʉ, na kusiina isáare ˆraviswa, sɨ ˆrɨrɨ taangwa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Sa jeyyo, roroosi ˆmwarɨvariyʉla kilwiiryii, teerwa rɨrɨ kɨweerwii, na roroosi ˆmwarɨhweeha mberii, variyʉlwa rɨrɨ italii.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉlʉʉngʉ vii noo wo Koofa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matáayo 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>Nɨ vawyɨɨra niise nyuunyu vijeengi vyaanɨ, koofi vara ˆvʉʉ́laa mʉvɨrɨ vii tʉkʉ, na ivyo viri looka sɨ varɨ daha tʉmama chochoosi ˆkɨrɨ lookya ivyo tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Maa kaa, nɨɨnɨ kʉvawyɨɨra ndɨrɨ wo moofa. Ofi Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Yeeye ˆarɨ hʉmʉla kʉsʉmʉla mʉtɨma wa mʉʉntʉ, atɨɨte wiimiriri wo mʉfweitɨra na mootwii wa <char style="w">Jehénamu</char>. Hɨɨ, noovawyɨɨra moofi ʉhʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Eri, seese isaano sɨ jiváwaa iyoombe magwáare yavɨrɨ tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Baa neembe nɨ ndee nduudi, kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ sɨ ɨrɨ rimiriwa baa ɨmwɨ vii tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Kɨkomi, njwɨɨrɨ ˆjiri mitwii yaanyu javalwa joosi. Sa jeyyo koofi tʉkʉ, nyuunyu mʉrɨ va iyoombe ikʉʉlʉ kʉlookya seese ˆjiri foo.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉmʉvariyʉla Yéesu Mbere ja Vaantʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matáayo 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>Nɨ vawyɨɨra niise, yoyoosi ˆarɨ kuunduma, noo kʉsea, kʉʉndʉʉsɨkɨra nɨɨnɨ mbere ja vaantʉ, <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> ne muruma arɨ mbere ja Mʉlʉʉngʉ na <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ miija">mirimʉ yaachwe miija</char>. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Maa kaa, ˆarɨ sea sɨ aamányire mbere ja vaantʉ tʉkʉ, Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ ne sea arɨ sɨ amʉmányire tʉkʉ mbere ya mirimʉ miija ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Na kɨra mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ mʉkɨɨkana Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ, ʉvɨ waachwe sewa ʉrɨ wasírire, maa kaa, ˆarɨ <char style="w" lemma="Hɨɨntɨka">mʉhɨɨntɨkɨra</char> <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char> sɨ arɨ sewa ʉvɨ waachwe wasírire tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvarɨ vatwaala na <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">masinagóogii</char>, mbere ja vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ na mbere ja viimiriri, karɨ mwiítweetyaa joolɨ ˆmʉrɨ lʉʉsa au joolɨ ˆmʉrɨ kuuyirya tʉkʉ, <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>sa Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja mpɨɨndɨ jiijo vakiindya arɨ kɨra ˆmwasaakwa mʉlʉʉse.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Musúngaati Mʉhoho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ fuma aho mpukii ya vaantʉ vara ˆvamʉteereráa, akamʉsea Yéesu, “Mukiindya, mʉsee mʉndʉʉ waanɨ aangavɨre viintʉ vya ʉpaari ˆtarekerwa nɨ taáta wiitʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Aaɨ, nɨ ani aanvíikire nɨɨnɨ nɨve mʉlamuli au mʉgavi wa ʉpaari waanyu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavasea, “Laangi neeja! Mwɨɨme kʉlɨ na kʉdɨɨra kwiikinkima koosi, sa nkaasʉ ya mʉʉntʉ sɨ ifúmaa kʉrɨ viintʉ vyaachwe ˆviri foo ˆatɨɨte tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Maa Yéesu akavavaɨra lusímo ʉlʉ, “Kwajáa kwatɨɨte musúngaati ʉmwɨ ˆajáa na iwʉnda. Aho iwundii kwaachwe, viintʉ vyakwaatáa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Sa jeyyo, ʉwo musúngaati akiiyurya mutimii waachwe, ‘Joolɨ ndɨrɨ bweeyya? Ha de amwɨ nsiina haantʉ ho vivɨɨka viintʉ vyaanɨ ˆnaachwa tʉkʉ?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Aho, maa ʉwo musúngaati akasea, ‘Jei noo viintʉ ˆndɨrɨ bweeyya, vaa ndɨrɨ madongʼa yaanɨ yoosi, maa njeenge yɨɨngɨ makʉlʉkʉʉlʉ. Aho, noo kʉʉntʉ ndɨrɨ vɨɨka viintʉ vyoosi ˆndɨrɨ kuchwa na viintʉ vyɨɨngɨ vyoosi.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Aho, noo ndɨrɨ sea, ‘Ee mʉtɨma waanɨ, watɨɨte viintʉ ˆvyabooha ˆviri foo ˆwiivɨɨkɨra kwa myaaka ˆɨrɨ foo. Hʉmʉlʉka, urye, unywe, na uvyeende.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Maa kaa, Mʉlʉʉngʉ akamʉsea, ‘Weewe ʉrɨ mʉhoho! Uchikʉ wa isikʉ nkaasʉ yaako yoosaakwa. Ha ivi viintʉ ˆwiivɨɨkɨra nɨ vya ani viri kʉva?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Jeyyo, noo ˆvyeene viri kwa vaantʉ vara ˆvakunguula máari ja weerʉ, vakareka kʉʉnga kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumwiilaangya Mʉlʉʉngʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matáayo 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Sa jeyyo reki koofa sa nkaasʉ ya mɨvɨrɨ yaanyu, che mʉrɨ kurya, au sa mɨvɨrɨ yaanyu, che mʉrɨ kiivɨkɨra. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Sa nkaasʉ nɨ mweeri ɨrɨ ya chóorya na mʉvɨrɨ nɨ kʉlookya ɨngo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Laangi makʉʉ́ngʉlʉ! Yooyo sɨ yaháandaa tʉkʉ baa kei sɨ ya chwíjaa tʉkʉ, yasiina madongʼa tʉkʉ. Maa kaa, Mʉlʉʉngʉ ayaríishaa. Kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, nyuunyu nɨ mweeri ya ndee mʉrɨ. <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Nɨ ani kʉrɨ nyuunyu so manyɨka kwaachwe ifaanaa oongererye nkaasʉ yaachwe kwa sáa baa ɨmwɨ vii? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Ha de haaha koonɨ sɨ mʉrɨ daha kʉtʉmama baa isáare iduudi ja ɨrɨ, sa che mookoofa sa aya yɨɨngɨ?<verse eid="LUK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Laangi malʉva ˆvyeene yakʉ́laa. Yooyo sɨ yatʉ́mamaa baa kei sɨ yachúmaa ɨngo jaavo tʉkʉ. Kɨkomi noovawyɨɨra, baa mʉtemi Solomóoni na nkongojima yaachwe yoosi, sɨ arwɨɨkwa vyabooha ja rɨmwɨ ra malʉva ayo tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Ha de koonɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ ayarwɨ́ɨkaa masaambɨ ya iwundii aya ˆyavíjaa isikʉ na lomʉtóondo yakafweitɨrwa na iviivii, sɨ arɨ varwɨɨka nyuunyu kʉlookya ayo tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Eri, sa che mumurúmaa kiduudi jei?<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Haaha reki kwiitweetya, che mʉrɨ kurya au che mʉrɨ kʉnywa. Koofi tʉkʉ sa viintʉ ivi. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Vaantʉ sɨ ˆvamʉmányire Mʉlʉʉngʉ noo viitwéetyaa sa viintʉ ivi vyoosi. Maa kaa, kʉrɨ nyuunyu Taáta waanyu amányire visaaka mwiise. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Haaha, saakiri <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> na ivyo vyoosi heewa mʉrɨ ko koongereriwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usúngaati wa Kurumwii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matáayo 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>Reki kwiitweetya nyuunyu mpuka nduudi, sa Taáta waanyu oona nɨ kɨɨntʉ ˆchabooha kʉvaheera nyuunyu Ʉtemi waachwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Vai iyoombe máari jaanyu mʉkavaheere vakɨva. Ibweeyyiryi mifuko ya mpía sɨ ˆɨsákahalaa, noo kʉsea, kʉvɨɨka máari ya kɨkomi ya mberii kurumwii. Ʉko kusiina mwiívi ˆaséngereraa tʉkʉ na mbuuvu ˆjiríjaa ɨngo tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Sa kʉʉntʉ ˆkʉrɨ máari yaako ya kɨkomi ya mberii, noo kʉʉntʉ mʉtɨma waako ˆʉrɨ.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɨɨma Neeja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>Kɨra siikʉ mʉndoolaarɨra ndɨrɨ kʉtʉmama mʉrɨmo, na vimʉrɨ vyaanyu vive vikórɨɨre. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Mʉve ja vatʉmami vara ˆvoomʉwoojera mweenenyuumba waavo atámiinye na ngovii ya ilóola, sa mpɨɨndɨ ˆarɨ fika vii vamʉyʉʉrɨre. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Vatalariwa vara vatʉmami ˆveene varɨ shaanwa nɨ mweenenyuumba waavo vookeesha mpɨɨndɨ ˆarɨ kʉʉja. Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, kwiivɨkɨra arɨ sa avatʉmamɨre, yeeye vaseeserya arɨ chákurya varye. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Vatalariwa vatʉmami avo, mweenenyuumba waavo koonɨ avashɨ́hɨɨne varɨ miiso voomʉwoojera, baa koonɨ uújire nuuchikʉ katɨ, au namuyiingʉ.<verse eid="LUK 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Taangi neeja masáare aya, mweenenyuumba ngaarɨ ajáa ataanga mpɨɨndɨ ˆngʼeene mwiívi arɨ kʉʉja, ngaarɨ sɨ areka nyuumba yaachwe ɨbokwe tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Baa nyuunyu moosaakwa mʉve mwɨɨ́mɨre neeja mpɨɨndɨ joosi, sa Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ kʉʉja arɨ mpɨɨndɨ sɨ ˆmookoona kʉʉja arɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉtʉmami Mʉʉja na Mʉtʉmami Mʉvɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matáayo 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Aho, maa <char style="w">Peéteri</char> akamuurya, “Mʉkʉ́lʉ, lusímo ʉlʉ nɨ suusu vii wootuwyɨɨra bakʉ vaantʉ voosi?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Mweenevyoosi akamʉsea, “Nɨ mwiimiriri arɨkwɨ noo ˆarɨ wo kiilaangiwa na ˆarɨ na tooti? Kei, nɨ mʉtʉmami arɨkwɨ arɨ rekwa nɨ mweenenyuumba waachwe avɨɨmɨrɨre viivaachwe na avaheere chóorya mpɨɨndɨ ˆjasaakwa, maa mweenenyuumba akere njɨra? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Atalariwa mʉtʉmami ʉra mweenenyuumba waachwe ˆarɨ mʉshaana yoobweeyya jeyyo, mpɨɨndɨ ˆarɨ hɨndʉka. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, mweenenyuumba waachwe mʉvɨɨka arɨ ʉwo mwiimiriri ɨɨmɨrɨre viintʉ vyaachwe vyoosi vʉʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Maa kaa, koonɨ ʉwo mwiimiriri iírɨrɨkɨɨne, ‘Mweenenyuumba waanɨ achérevire,’ na aande kʉvavaa vara vatʉmami va kɨɨntʉ kɨlʉme na va kɨɨntʉ kiki, kʉnʉ yoorya, no nywa, no reeva, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>mweenenyuumba waachwe kʉʉja arɨ sikʉ ˆngʼeene sɨ yookoona arɨ kʉʉja, na sáa sɨ ˆɨɨmányire. Aho, Mweenenyuumba waachwe mʉtematema arɨ na mʉvɨɨka arɨ hamwɨ na vara sɨ ˆvarɨ vookiilaangya.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Mʉtʉmami ʉra ˆamányire ˆcheene mweenenyuumba waachwe asáakaa, maa kaa, akareka kwɨɨma neeja baa kei akareka tʉmama ja ˆvyeene ʉwo mweenenyuumba waachwe eenda, laɨrwa arɨ ˆkɨrɨ mooto. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Maa kaa, mwiimiriri ʉra sɨ ˆamányire, ˆatʉ́mamire yara ˆyɨɨma neeja kʉvawa, vawa arɨ kiduudi. Mʉʉntʉ ʉra ˆaheewa ˆviri foo, ʉwo atɨɨte noongwa ya ˆviri foo na ʉra ˆakwaatiwa mɨrɨmo ˆɨrɨ foo, saakwa ɨrɨ, ˆɨrɨ foo.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Areeta Vaantʉ Kwiikera Ndʉʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matáayo 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>Nʉʉja na kʉrɨ weerʉ, sa nkorererye mooto. Nɨ vyaangʉ ngaarɨ waándire korera. <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Maa kaa, natɨɨte uturikiri, ˆnoosaaka nturikiriwe na tuuba ndɨrɨ tʉrɨkɨra mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ mutimii waanɨ fʉʉrʉ uturikiri ʉwo ˆʉrɨ hʉmʉla. <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Mukiisea nʉʉja na aha weerwii kʉreeta mwiikalo mʉʉja? Aka tʉkʉ, nareeta kwiikera! <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Kwaandɨra haaha, nyuumba ˆɨrɨ na vaantʉ vasaano, kwiikera veende vatatʉ kwiiruta ndihi na vavɨrɨ na vavɨrɨ kwiiruta ndihi na vatatʉ. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Taáta kwiitoola eende na mwaana waachwe na mwaana kwiitoola eende na taáta waavo. Íyo kwiitoola eende na muhíínja waachwe, na muhíínja kwiitoola eende na íyo waavo. Íyo mʉkwɨ kwiitoola eende na muki wa mwaana waachwe, na muki wa mwaana kwiitoola eende na mʉkwɨ waachwe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉtaanga Mpɨɨndɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matáayo 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Kei Yéesu akɨɨsea ɨra mpuka, “Koonɨ mwɨɨ́ne ichu raándukire ivaru ra ʉsweero hahara mʉséaa, ‘Mbula vaa ɨrɨ,’ noyo yaváa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Na koonɨ mwɨɨ́ne mpeho yoowuva fuma saame, mwaséaa, ‘Kʉva kʉrɨ na irʉtɨra,’ na kɨkomi vyavíjaa jeyyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Nyuunyu vakweembi, mwamányire taanga viintʉ vya kurumu na vya weerʉ kwa ˆvyeene ko koonekana! Sa che moosiindwa taanga masáare aya ˆyootʉmamwa haaha?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwiiteerwa na Mʉvɨ Waako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matáayo 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>Sa che sɨ moolamʉla veeneevyo kɨɨntʉ cha ʉwoloki? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉrɨ njirii moodoma na balásii na mʉvɨ waako, mʉloombe iivae na mpʉʉlo chaangʉ mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉkaarɨ njirii. Koonɨ sɨ ʉbwéeyyiirye jeyyo, kʉtwaala arɨ na balásii na ʉko mʉlamuli kʉkwaatya arɨ mɨkonwii ya mʉlʉkalʉka, ne kʉtwaala arɨ na mʉnyololwii na ngururu. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Kɨmaarɨ nookuwyɨɨra, sɨ ʉrɨ rekerwa ʉko tʉkʉ, mpaka ʉrɨhe mpoocho yo marikirirya.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kʉvalandʉka au Kʉmalwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Mpɨɨndɨ yɨɨyo, vaantʉ vamwɨ vajáa vamuwyɨɨra <char style="w">Yéesu</char> masáare ya <char style="w" lemma="Galiláaya">Vagaliláaya</char> vamwɨ ˆveene <char style="w">Piláato</char> ajáa avʉʉlaa mpɨɨndɨ ˆvamʉtooreráa Mʉlʉʉngʉ <char style="w">mpóryo</char>. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavuurya, “Eri, mukiisea ava Vagaliláaya ˆvaakwya inkwya ɨhɨ, nɨ vavɨ vajáa kʉlookya Vagaliláaya vɨɨngɨ voosi vʉʉ wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Aka tʉkʉ! Noovawyɨɨra, koonɨ sɨ <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">mʉválandukire</char> fuma uvii waanyu, voosi sira mʉrɨ jeyyo! <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Au vara ikimi na vanaanɨ (18) ˆveene valaarɨrwa nɨ mʉnáara vakakwya kʉra Siloáamu, nɨ kiisea mwiise nɨ vavɨ vajáa kʉlookya vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ voosi ˆveene viikaláa múujii wa Yerusaléemu wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Aka tʉkʉ! Noovawyɨɨra nyuunyu, koonɨ sɨ mʉválandukire fuma uvii waanyu, baa nyuunyu sira mʉrɨ viivyo!”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mʉsaambu sɨ ˆUvíjaa na Ndɨɨwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavawyɨɨra lusímo ʉlʉ, “Mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ajáa atɨɨte mʉsaambu ˆwahaandwa iwundii raachwe ra sabíibu. Sikʉ ɨmwɨ akatamanya noo tʉʉnda saambu aho mʉsaambwii, maa kaa, sɨ ashaana saambu baa ɨmwɨ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Sa jeyyo akamʉsea mʉtʉmami wa iwundii raachwe, ‘Laanga, kwa myaaka ɨtatʉ nʉʉja noo tʉʉnda saambu ja mʉtɨ ʉhʉ, maa kaa, sɨ nɨnapata baa saambu ɨmwɨ vii tʉkʉ! Ʉkanye! Sa nɨ woosaambʉla iwʉnda vii!’<verse eid="LUK 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Ʉra mʉtʉmami wa iwundii akamʉsea, ‘Mʉkʉ́lʉ, ʉreke ʉhʉ mwaaka kei, nɨɨnɨ kʉʉrɨmɨra ndɨrɨ na kʉʉvɨkɨra ndɨrɨ nchuúkuru. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Koonɨ ʉrɨ tʉʉnga saambu mwaaka ˆwookʉʉja, booha viri, koonɨ sɨ jeyyo wʉʉkanye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉʉntʉ Muki Sikʉ ya Sabáato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char>, Yéesu akiindyáa <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">sinagóogii</char> ɨmwɨ. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Aho sinagóogii, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ muki ʉmwɨ, ˆajáa na <char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ mɨvɨ">murimʉ mʉvɨ</char>. Ʉwo murimʉ mʉvɨ ʉjáa wamukukumarya na sɨ adaháa woloka tʉkʉ kwa myaaka ikimi na ɨnaanɨ (18). <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yéesu ˆakamoone, maa akamwaanɨrɨra yoosea, “Íyo, ʉrékɨɨrwe nɨ ndwáala yaako!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Aho, Yéesu akamʉvɨkɨra mɨkono yaachwe, na hahara akawoloka na akaanda kʉmʉbweeyyirya Mʉlʉʉngʉ nkongojima.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Maa kaa, mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa sinagóogi akakalala sa viintʉ Yéesu ˆajáa amʉhóriirye ʉra mʉʉntʉ muki sikʉ ya Sabáato. Sa jeyyo, ʉra mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ akavasea vaantʉ, “Júma yatɨɨte sikʉ mʉsasatʉ jo tʉmama. Moosaakwa mʉndookʉʉja noo horiwa sikʉ ijo na sɨ sikʉ ya Sabáato tʉkʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Maa kaa, Mweenevyoosi akamʉsea, “Aka, nyuunyu vakweembi! Eri, nɨ ani sɨ ayʉ́ʉrɨraa ngʼoombe jaachwe na ndákwi fuma waámii noo jitwaala noo nyweesha sikʉ ya Sabáato? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ muki nɨ mwaana wa <char style="w">Aburaháamu</char>. <char style="w">Irimʉ</char> ramuchuunga kwa myaaka ikimi na ɨnaanɨ. Eri, sɨ asaakwa arekerwe fuma mʉnyololwii sikʉ ya Sabáato tʉkʉ wʉʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Yéesu ˆakalʉʉse aya, vavɨ vaachwe vakakwaatwa nɨ soni, maa kaa, vaantʉ vakavyeenda sa masáare ˆyoohwaalarya ˆatʉmamáa.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mpeke ya Haradáali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matáayo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maáriki 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavuurya, “<char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> wiifwɨ́ɨne na che? Nʉʉfwaanirirye na che? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Wiifwɨ́ɨne na mpeke nduudi ya <char style="w">haradáali</char> ˆngʼeene mʉʉntʉ atoola akahaanda iwundii raachwe. Ɨyo mbeyʉ ɨkamera, ɨkava mʉtɨ na ndee jikajeenga vivururu matáampii yaachwe.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Ʉsasɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matáayo 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Yéesu akavuurya kei, “Na che ndɨrɨ kʉʉfwaanirirya Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Wiifwɨ́ɨne na ʉsasɨ ˆmweene mʉʉntʉ muki atoola, akakaandɨra muchu wa ngáano viháárɨ vitatʉ vya saimʉ. Ʉra ʉsasɨ, ʉkasuuwya muchu woosi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉryaango ˆWafinya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matáayo 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yéesu akatuuba njɨra yaachwe ɨra ˆadomáa na Yerusaléemu. Na njirii akiindyáa vaantʉ míijii na maturii kʉʉntʉ ˆatweeráa. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ akamuurya, “Mʉkʉ́lʉ, nɨ vake vii noo Mʉlʉʉngʉ arɨ lamurirya wʉʉ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yéesu akamʉsea, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“Ifafiriryi mwɨɨngɨre na mʉryaango ˆwafinya. Kɨkomi noovawyɨɨra, ˆvarɨ foo saaka varɨ kwɨɨngɨra maa kaa, sɨ varɨ daha tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kʉʉja jiise, mweenenyuumba kiinʉka arɨ na chuunga arɨ mʉryaango, aho kɨɨma mʉrɨ weerwii de mwaande luumbya kʉnʉ moosea, ‘Ee mʉkʉ́lʉ, tʉyʉʉrɨre!’ Maa kaa, yeeye vasea arɨ, ‘Sɨ nɨvamányire na sɨ nootaanga kʉʉntʉ ˆmufúmire tʉkʉ!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Naanyu sea mʉrɨ, ‘Suusu noo vara ˆtarijáa no nywa hamwɨ na weewe! Kei, weewe utukiindyáa maturii ya mɨɨtʉ.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Ne vasea arɨ, ‘Navawyɨ́ɨrɨɨre, sɨ nɨvamányire tʉkʉ, na sɨ mányire kʉʉntʉ ˆmufúmire tʉkʉ! Isunki kwaanɨ nyuunyu vavɨ!’<verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Ʉko rɨra mweende no sha mayeo, mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉrɨ moona Aburaháamu, Isaka na Yaakúupu na <char style="w">valáali na mʉtwe</char> Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ na kʉnʉ nyuunyu mʉfwéitirwe na weerwii. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Vaantʉ kʉʉja varɨ, fuma itʉʉmba na ʉsweero, ʉtʉ́rʉko na saame, novo kiikala varɨ haantʉ ˆviimiriwa neeja ngovii ʉko Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Laanga, vamwaarɨ va mukirii ˆvarɨ kʉva va ncholo, na va ncholo varɨ kʉva mukirii.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookaavwa Mʉtɨma sa Múuji wa Yerusaléemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matáayo 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Mpɨɨndɨ jiijo, <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> vamwɨ vakɨɨta na kʉrɨ Yéesu, maa vakamʉsea, “Looka aha, tamanya na kwɨɨngɨ sa <char style="w">Heróode</char> saaka iise kʉkʉʉlaa.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Tamanyi mʉkɨɨsee ɨra mʉʉnjʉ ˆɨrɨ kɨnchʉnkʉla, ‘Laanga, mwaarɨ nookibirya mirimʉ mɨvɨ, no horya vaantʉ isikʉ na lomʉtóondo. Na sikʉ ya katatʉ marikirirya ndɨrɨ mʉrɨmo waanɨ.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Baa neembe nɨ jeyyo, tuuba niise na njɨra yaanɨ isikʉ, lomʉtóondo na kukyɨɨre fika ndɨrɨ. Bweeyya niise jeyyo, sa sɨ vyasaakwa mʉláali na mʉtwe akwye haantʉ hɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ, maa kaa, nɨ Yerusaléemu vii.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>Aka Yerusaléemu, aka Yerusaléemu, weewe ˆwʉʉ́laa valáali na mʉtwe no vavaa na mawye vara ˆvatʉ́mwaa kwaako! Nɨ kangaɨ nasáakaa kʉvajiinga vaana vaako ja nkʉkʉ viintʉ ˆijíingaa nchʉʉ́rʉ jaachwe mbavii? Baa jei sɨ wuunduma tʉkʉ! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Laangi! Mʉlʉʉngʉ avarékɨɨre nyuumba jaanyu nyuuveene! Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, sɨ mʉrɨ kʉʉnyona kei tʉkʉ, fʉʉrʉ mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉkaséire, ‘Atalariwa yeeye ˆyookʉʉja kwa irina ra <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char>.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sabúuri 118:26</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ Sikʉ ya Sabáato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char>, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ajáa adoma noo rya chákurya kaayii kwa mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ ʉmwɨ wa <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char>. Mpɨɨndɨ ˆajáa aho, vaantʉ vamʉlaangisháa sa voone nɨ che arɨ tʉmama sikʉ ya Sabáato. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Aho, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆajáa na ndwáala yo suuwa mawʉlʉ na mɨkono. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Hara, maa Yéesu akavuurya Mafarisáayo na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char>, “Eri, Miiro yaruma kʉmʉhorya mʉʉntʉ sikʉ ya Sabáato, bakʉ tʉkʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Novo vakakirinya sawu. Jeyyo Yéesu akamʉsaasya ʉra mʉlwɨ́ɨrɨ, akamʉhorya, maa akamʉsea itamanyɨre.<verse eid="LUK 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Aho, maa akavuurya, “Ivi koonɨ ʉmwɨ waanyu mwaana waachwe au ngʼoombe yaachwe yawyɨ́ɨrɨɨre isimii sɨ arɨ doma no mʉseyya chaangʉ baa neembe nɨ sikʉ ya Sabáato tʉkʉ wʉʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Voovo, vakasova cho muuyirya.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwiikiimya na Ɨsɨ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yéesu akoona vara ˆvajáa valáarikirwe ˆvyeene viisaawʉrɨráa machuumbi ya nyemi mpɨɨndɨ ja chákurya. Aho, akavawyɨɨra lusímo ʉlʉ, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Koonɨ ʉláarikirwe na ngovii ya ilóola, karɨ wiíkalaa ichuumbii ra mbere tʉkʉ, sa ifaanaa ɨkava amwaarɨ wɨɨngɨ ˆaláarikirwe ˆanyémiwaa kʉlookya weewe. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ˆarɨ kʉʉja mweenengovi ʉra ˆavaláarikire, weewe na yeeye kʉsea arɨ, ‘Sosoloka ʉhʉ iikale.’ Aho, saama ʉrɨ na ichuumbii ra nyuma kʉnʉ ʉkwáatirwe nɨ soni.<verse eid="LUK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Kɨrɨ vyoobweeyya jeyyo, weewe koonɨ ʉláarikirwe, ikala ichuumbii ra nyuma sa ˆarɨ kʉʉja mweenengovi ya ilóola akʉsee, ‘Aaɨ yeenda jiwiikale aha mbere.’ Aho, noo nkongojima yaako ɨrɨ koonekana mbere ja vaantʉ voosi ˆvaláarikirwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Sa kɨra mʉʉntʉ ˆiiyámbukyaa na mweeri, kiimiwa arɨ na ɨsɨ, na ʉra ˆiikíimyaa na ɨsɨ, kaambukiwa arɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akamʉsea ʉra ˆajáa avaláarikire, “Mpɨɨndɨ ˆwookiimya neeja ngovi ya cháámuusi au kiiwʉlo, karɨ ʉláarɨkaa vijeengi vyaako, au vandʉʉ vaako, au vaantʉ va lʉkolo lwaako, au vakaaya vaako vara ˆvarɨ vasúngaati vii tʉkʉ. Koonɨ ʉbwéeyyiirye jeyyo, baa voovo ifaanaa vakʉlaarɨke weewe na kwaavo, maa ʉve uríhirwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Maa kaa, weewe koonɨ woobweeyya ngovi, laarɨka vakɨva, vivete na vahoku. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Aho, talariwa ʉrɨ, sa avo vasiina lʉvɨro lo kʉrɨha tʉkʉ. Weewe rɨhwa ʉrɨ nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ mpɨɨndɨ jo fʉfʉlwa vara vawoloki.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Ngovi Nkʉʉlʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-14">Matáayo 22:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Ʉmwɨ ˆajáa iíkyɨɨre aho chákuryii na Yéesu ˆakateere masáare ayo, maa akasea, “Atalariwa mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ kurya ngovi <char style="w" lemma="Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ">Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>.” <verse eid="LUK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Aho, Yéesu akamʉsea, “Mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ajáa iimya neeja ngovi nkʉʉlʉ, maa akavalaarɨka vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ja ngovi ˆjikafike, akamʉtʉma mʉtʉmami waachwe kwa vaantʉ vara ˆajáa avalaarɨka sa akavasee, ‘Teengi, viintʉ vyoosi vyahʉ́mwɨɨre!’<verse eid="LUK 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Maa kaa, voosi ˆvajáa valaarɨkwa vakaanda ʉkooveri wo lʉʉsa vadɨɨre kʉʉja. Wa ncholo ko koovera akasea, ‘Nawúrire iwʉnda noosaakwa nkarɨlaange. Kalaama sɨ ndɨrɨ kʉʉja tʉkʉ.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Wa kavɨrɨ ne akasea, ‘Nawúrire ngʼoombe ikimi jo rɨma, jei nɨ tamanya niise noo jiyera, kalaama sɨ ndɨrɨ kʉʉja tʉkʉ.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Wa katatʉ ko koovera ne akasea, ‘Nasʉ́mwɨɨre muki, sa jeyyo sɨ ndɨrɨ daha kʉʉja tʉkʉ.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Ʉra mʉtʉmami akahɨndʉka, akɨɨta muwyɨɨra mweenenyuumba waachwe kɨra ˆvaséire. Aho, ʉra mweenenyuumba akakalala, maa akamʉlairirya mʉtʉmami waachwe yoomʉsea, ‘Tamanya chaangʉ na balíbalii na njirii joosi ja ʉhʉ múuji, ʉkavareete na aha vakɨva, vivete na vahoku.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Ʉra mʉtʉmami ˆakahɨndʉke, maa akamʉsea mweenenyuumba waachwe, ‘Mʉkʉ́lʉ, yoosi ˆmeene waandáiriirye nayatʉ́mamire, maa kaa, nkalo ɨmwaarɨ ɨchɨ́hɨɨre.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Sa jeyyo, mweenenyuumba waachwe akamʉsea mʉtʉmami, ‘Tamanya na balíbalii jira ˆjiri weerwii ya múuji, ʉkavadoomererye vaantʉ sa nyuumba yaanɨ ɨmeme. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Sa kɨkomi noovawyɨɨra, kusiina mʉʉntʉ baa ʉmwɨ wa vara ˆnavalaarɨka arɨ saɨra ngovi yaanɨ tʉkʉ.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumutuuba Yéesu sɨ Vyoolo Tʉkʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matáayo 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Haaha mpuka nkʉʉlʉ yamutuubáa Yéesu. Yéesu akiilorera, maa akavasea, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“Mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ˆyoosaaka kuuntuuba, asaakwa aanyende nɨɨnɨ kʉlookya ˆvyeene amweenda taáta waavo, íyo waavo, muki waachwe, vaana vaachwe, marʉʉmbʉ yaachwe, vandʉʉ vaachwe na baa kʉlookya ˆvyeene eenda nkaasʉ yaachwe. Koonɨ sɨ jeyyo, sɨ arɨ kʉva mʉpooji waanɨ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi koonɨ sɨ avérekire <char style="w">mʉsaláaba</char> waachwe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lʉ́ka 9:23</ref>.</char></note> ko tʉrɨkɨra na baa koonɨ nɨ kukwya sa nɨɨnɨ na aantuube, sɨ arɨ kʉva mʉpooji waanɨ tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Nɨ ani ʉmwɨ waanyu, koonɨ yoosaaka jeenga sɨ iíkalaa ɨsɨ ta kʉlaanga viintʉ vyoosi ˆyoosaakwa ave novyo, sa ataange koonɨ arɨ na mpía jo marikirya ijeengo raachwe? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Koonɨ sɨ abwéeyyiirye jeyyo, ifaanaa akajeenga mwaariryo wa nyuumba vii, maa asiindwe marikirirya ijeengo roosi. Na voosi ˆvarɨ koona ijeengo raachwe, mʉsekerera varɨ, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>voosea, ‘Mʉʉntʉ ʉhʉ aanda jeenga, maa akasiindwa ngururu jo marikirirya.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Haaha iririkani mʉtemi ʉra ˆyoosaaka atamanye na nkoondwii noo lwa na mʉtemi wɨɨngɨ. Nɨ mʉtemi arɨkwɨ sɨ ˆarɨ kiikala ta iiririkane neeja, koonɨ arɨ daha kʉlwa na mʉtemi ˆarɨ na vaantʉ va nkoondo mayana makumi yavɨrɨ (20,000), na kʉnʉ yeeye arɨ na vaantʉ va nkoondo mayana ikimi rɨmwɨ (10,000) vii? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Koonɨ ɨɨ́ne siindwa arɨ, tʉma arɨ vaantʉ vaachwe, vatamanye na kwa ʉra mʉtemi wɨɨngɨ ntɨ ˆakaarɨ kʉlɨ, sa viiteerwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Noo jeyyo viri kʉrɨ nyuunyu, kusiina ʉmwɨ waanyu ˆarɨ kʉva mʉpooji waanɨ koonɨ sɨ arékire vira vyoosi ˆarɨ novyo tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sangása ˆIsiina Mwerere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matáayo 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maáriki 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>Sangása nɨ kɨɨntʉ ˆchabooha kʉterekera, maa kaa, koonɨ yasúukire nɨ che ɨrɨ vɨkɨrwa sa mwerere waachwe ʉhɨndʉkɨre kei? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Sangása ˆɨrɨ jeyyo, sɨ yabooha baa kwiita iwundii tʉkʉ, baa nchuúkurwii tʉkʉ, ɨyo nɨ ɨfwéitwaa vii. ˆArɨ na matu yo teerera, nɨ ateere!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Muundi ˆYataahɨka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matáayo 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Haaha, <char style="w">vasaankanʼyi kóodi</char> na vaduwalo vadomáa na kʉrɨ <char style="w">Yéesu</char> noo mʉteerera. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Maa kaa, <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> vakaanda ngʼuula voosea, “Sa che ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ iíkalaa na maduwalo baa kei ɨndoorya chóorya noyo?”<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavasɨmɨra lusímo ʉlʉ, <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Koonɨ ʉmwɨ waanyu arɨ na muundi igana rɨmwɨ (100), na koonɨ muundi ɨmwɨ yarɨ́mɨɨre, che arɨ bweeyya? Jireka arɨ jira muundi makumi keenda na keenda (99) ibaláángwii adome akasaake ɨra ˆyatáahikire mpaka ɨɨpate. <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Na ˆarɨ kɨɨpata, kɨɨvaala arɨ mavei kʉnʉ arɨ na cheerʉ. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>ˆArɨ fika kaayii, kʉvaanɨrɨra arɨ vijeengi vyaachwe na vakaaya vaachwe kʉnʉ yoovasea, ‘Eryi mɨtɨma hamwɨ na nɨɨnɨ, sa muundi yaanɨ ˆngʼeene yaarɨ yarɨ́mɨɨre, nɨɨyɨɨ́ne!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Viivyo noovawyɨɨra, kʉva kʉrɨ na cheerʉ mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ kurumwii, haantʉ mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ mʉvɨ ˆarɨ <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">mʉvalandʉkɨra</char> Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Cheerʉ ɨkyo kʉva kɨrɨ nɨ kɨkʉʉlʉ kʉlookya vaantʉ makumi keenda na keenda (99) vara ˆviiyónaa voovo nɨ vawoloki, ˆvasiina kɨɨntʉ cho vabweeyya vamʉvalandʉkɨre Mʉlʉʉngʉ tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mpía ˆYataahɨka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>Yéesu akavawyɨɨra lusímo lwɨɨngɨ, “Tʉsee baa ja koonɨ mʉʉntʉ muki arɨ na mpía ikimi na koonɨ ɨmwɨ yarɨ́mɨɨre che arɨ bweeyya? Korererya arɨ kɨmʉrɨ na fyaahɨra arɨ nyuumba yoosi vʉʉ, yoosaakɨra ɨra mpía mpaka ɨɨpate. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Na ˆarɨ kɨɨpata, vaanɨrɨra arɨ vijeengi vyaachwe na vakaaya vaachwe na vasea arɨ, ‘Eryi mɨtɨma hamwɨ na nɨɨnɨ, sa mpía yaanɨ ˆngʼeene yaarɨ yarɨ́mɨɨre, nɨɨyɨɨ́ne.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Viivyo, noovawyɨɨra, kwatɨɨte cheerʉ kɨkʉʉlʉ kwa <char style="w">mirimʉ miija</char> ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, mpɨɨndɨ mʉvɨ ʉmwɨ ˆarɨ mʉvalandʉkɨra Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mwaana ˆArɨmɨra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yéesu kei akavawyɨɨra lusímo lwɨɨngɨ yoovasea, “Mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ajáa atɨɨte vaana valʉme vavɨrɨ. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Mwaana waachwe muduudi, akamʉsea taáta waavo, ‘Taáta nooloomba ʉpaari waanɨ.’ Jeyyo, akavagavɨra vaana vaachwe ʉpaari waavo.<verse eid="LUK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi ˆjikalooke, ʉra mudúúdi akasaankanʼya máari jaachwe joosi vʉʉ, maa akatamanya na ɨsɨ ya kʉlɨ. Ʉko akɨɨta takʉna máari yoosi vʉʉ. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>ˆAkamarikirye kɨra kɨɨntʉ ˆajáa nocho, ɨra ɨsɨ yoosi ɨkava na njala ya imalo, ne akava asiina chochoosi tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Aho, akatamanya na kwa mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ wa ɨsɨ ɨra, akɨtooloomba mʉrɨmo. Ʉra mʉʉntʉ akamʉtwaala na iwundii kwaachwe ɨndookooriisha nkaamba jaachwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Ʉwo mʉtavana akava yoomererya matɨ mafaala ˆmeene nkaamba jarijáa. Na kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆamʉheráa chákurya chochoosi tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Maa kaa, ˆakiiririkane mutimii waachwe, maa akasea, ‘Amwɨ vatʉmami va taáta wiitʉ varijáa mpaka vandoocheerya? Nɨɨnɨ mwaarɨ nookwya na njala aha! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Haaha hɨndʉka niise na kwa taáta nkamʉsee, “Taáta, nabweeyya ʉvɨ kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ na kʉrɨ weewe. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Nɨɨnɨ sɨ nɨɨma neeja kwaanɨrɨrwa mwaana waako kei tʉkʉ, mbɨɨka nɨve ja ʉmwɨ wa vatʉmami vaako. ”’<verse eid="LUK 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Aho, akiinʉka, akakwaata njɨra na kaayii kwa taáta waavo. ˆAkasengerere kaayii, taáta waavo akamoona kʉra kʉlɨ, maa akamoonera mbavariri. Akamʉkɨbɨrɨra, akamʉkwaatɨrɨra, maa akamʉsʉndɨra mwaana waachwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Aho, mwaana waachwe akamʉsea, ‘Taáta, nabweeyya ʉvɨ kʉrɨ kurumu na kʉrɨ weewe. Nɨɨnɨ sɨ nɨɨma neeja kwaanɨrɨrwa mwaana waako kei tʉkʉ.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Maa kaa, taáta waavo akavasea vatʉmami vaachwe, ‘Reeti chaangʉ ɨngo ˆyaboohabooha mʉmʉvɨkɨre, muvikiri ipoo mʉkonwii waachwe na viráatʉ majewii. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Reeti njɨɨkʉ ˆyaneneha, mʉsɨɨnje, turye ngovi. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Sa ʉhʉ mwaana waanɨ ajáa aakwya haaha afúfukire, ajáa ataahɨka haaha oónekɨɨne.’ Aho, vakaanda bweeyya ngovi.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, ʉra mwaana mʉkʉʉlʉ nɨ iwundii ajáa. Mpɨɨndɨ ˆahɨndʉkáa ˆakasengerere kaayii, akateera chɨɨ́mbo na vina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Aho, akamwaanɨrɨra mʉtʉmami ʉmwɨ, maa akamuurya, ‘Nɨ che kwatɨɨte?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Ʉra mʉtʉmami akamʉsea, ‘Mudúúdi waako uújire na taáta waanyu amʉsɨ́ɨnjɨɨre ɨra njɨɨkʉ ˆyanona sa taáta waanyu amʉhókɨɨre arɨ nkaasʉnkaasʉ.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Ʉra mwaana mʉkʉʉlʉ akavisʉʉla, maa akasiita kwɨɨngɨra na nyuumbii. Aho, taáta waavo akafuma na weerwii noo mʉkalaamya ɨɨngɨre. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Maa kaa, yeeye akamʉsea taáta waavo, ‘Laanga, myaaka yoosi ɨhɨ nɨɨnɨ natʉmama aha kaayii, baa sɨ nɨnawaayya kuchwa matɨ ʉlairiri waako wowoosi baa sikʉ ɨmwɨ tʉkʉ! Maa kaa, nɨɨnɨ sɨ ʉnawaayya kʉʉmpeera baa kaburi vii, nkárye nɨvyeende na viivaanɨ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Haaha ʉhʉ mwaana waako ˆmweene atakuna máari jaako na vaantʉ vaki ˆvayéendaa na valʉme va vaantʉ, uújire na kaayii ʉmʉsɨ́ɨnjɨɨre njɨɨkʉ ɨra ˆyanona.’<verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Taáta waavo akamʉsea, ‘Mwanawaanɨ, weewe nɨ na nɨɨnɨ ʉrɨ sikʉ joosi, viintʉ vyoosi ˆndɨrɨ novyo nɨ vyaako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Haaha nɨ vyabooha kʉbweeyya ngovi tuvyeende, sa mwaanaanyu ajáa aakwya, haaha nɨ nkaasʉ arɨ. Yeeye ajáa arɨmɨra, haaha oónekɨɨne.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mwiimiriri Mʉweere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Kei <char style="w">Yéesu</char> akavawyɨɨra lusímo ʉlʉ vapooji vaachwe, yoovasea, “Kʉjáa kwatɨɨte musúngaati ʉmwɨ na mwiimiriri wa máari jaachwe. Ʉwo musúngaati akateera mwiimiriri wa máari jaachwe yoosaambʉla máari. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Sa jeyyo ʉwo musúngaati akamwaanɨrɨra mwiimiriri akamʉsea, ‘Natéɨɨre kɨra ˆwoobweeyya na máari jaanɨ! Laɨra kɨra ˆʉbweeyyirya máari jaanɨ, sa sɨ ʉrɨ kʉva mwiimiriri wa máari jaanɨ tʉkʉ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Ʉra mwiimiriri akiiririkana mutimii waachwe, ‘Musúngaati waanɨ nɨ kʉʉnseyya iise murimwii waanɨ. Haaha nɨ che ndɨrɨ bweeyya? Nɨɨnɨ nsiina ngururu jo rɨma tʉkʉ, na nookoona soni yo loombaloomba. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Natáangire ˆcheene ndɨrɨ bweeyya, sa ˆndɨrɨ rekiwa mʉrɨmo waanɨ vaantʉ vaanteengye na nyuumbii jaavo.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Jeyyo, akavaanɨrɨra vaantʉ voosi vara ˆvadaayiwáa noongwa nɨ musúngaati waachwe. Wa ncholo akamuurya, ‘Noongwa yaako kwa musúngaati waanɨ nɨ viintʉ vingaɨ?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Ne akasea, ‘Noongwa yaanɨ ndáayiwaa nɨ líita mayana yatatʉ na magana mufungatɨ (3,700) ya makuta ya saitúuni.’ Aho, mwiimiriri akamʉsea, ‘Toola karatáasi ɨhɨ ˆngʼeene yaandɨkwa noongwa yaako chaangʉ, andɨka noongwa yaako nɨ líita iyana rɨmwɨ, magana yanaanɨ na makumi yasaano (1,850).’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Aho, akamuurya wa kavɨrɨ akamʉsea, ‘Weewe viintʉ vingaɨ ʉdáayiwaa?’ Ʉra akamʉsea, ‘Magunía magana yatatʉ na makumi yatatʉ (330) ya ngáano.’ Mwiimiriri akamʉsea, ‘Toola karatáasi ɨhɨ ˆngʼeene yaandɨkwa noongwa yaako, andɨka magana yavɨrɨ na makumi mʉsasatʉ (260).’<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Ʉra musúngaati akamʉdʉʉmbɨrɨra ʉra mwiimiriri sɨ ˆarɨ wo kiilaangiwa, sa viintʉ ˆajáa abwéeyyiirye ʉweere. Sa kʉrɨ vaantʉ va mbyaala ɨhɨ, vara sɨ ˆvamurúmaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ nɨ vaweere mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ kwa masáare ya ɨhɨ weerʉ, kʉlookya vaantʉ vara ˆvamuruma Mʉlʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="LUK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, vaambiriryi viivaanyu na máari jaanyu ja aha weerwii, sa ˆjiri sira mʉteengiwe na kiikalwii cha sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero.<verse eid="LUK 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Mʉʉntʉ ˆiiláangiwaa kwa masáare maduudi, kiilaangiwa eende kwa masáare makʉʉlʉ. Noo jeyyo, mʉʉntʉ ʉra ˆasova ʉwoloki kwa viintʉ viduudi, kʉva arɨ mʉʉntʉ ˆasova ʉwoloki kwa viintʉ ˆviri foo. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Na koonɨ sɨ mʉrɨ vo kiilaangiwa kwa máari ja ɨhɨ weerʉ, nɨ ani ˆarɨ viilaangya kwa máari ya kɨkomi? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Kei koonɨ sɨ mʉrɨ kiilaangiwa kwa máari ya mʉʉntʉ wɨɨngɨ, nɨ ani ˆarɨ kʉvaheera máari yaanyu veeneevyo?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>Kusiina mʉtʉmami ˆadáhaa tʉmamɨra vasúngaati vavɨrɨ tʉkʉ. Sa mʉsʉʉla arɨ ʉmwɨ na amweende wɨɨngɨ, au mʉnyemya eende ʉmwɨ na kumuchwa eende matɨ wɨɨngɨ. Sɨ mʉrɨ daha kʉmʉtʉmamɨra Mʉlʉʉngʉ na máari tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>
    <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> ˆvakateere masáare yoosi Yéesu alʉʉsáa, maa vakamʉseka ko muchwa matɨ, sa vajáa veenda mpía maatʉkʉ vii. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yéesu akavawyɨɨra yoovasea, “Nyuunyu mwiiyónekyaa kɨkomi mbere ja vaantʉ mʉrɨ vawoloki. Maa kaa, Mʉlʉʉngʉ amányire mɨtɨma yaanyu. Sa vira viintʉ vaantʉ ˆvavyoónaa nɨ vya kɨkomi, Mʉlʉʉngʉ avisʉʉla.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miiro na Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matáayo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maáriki 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>
    <char style="w">Miiro</char> na masáare ya <char style="w">valáali na mʉtwe</char>, yavariyʉlwa fʉʉrʉ mpɨɨndɨ ja Yooháani Mʉbatisáaji. Fuma mpɨɨndɨ ijo, <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> ya <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> yaváriyʉlwaa na kɨra mʉʉntʉ iiyingiryáa ʉtemii ʉwo na ngururu. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Maa kaa, nɨ vyoolo kwa kurumu na weerʉ kʉlooka, kʉlookya lʉtalo baa lʉmwɨ kʉrɨmɨra fuma Miirwii ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>Mʉʉntʉ mʉlʉme ˆamusíitaa muki waachwe, maa akaloola muki wɨɨngɨ, ʉwo ayéendaa na muki wa mʉʉntʉ. Kei, mʉʉntʉ mʉlʉme ʉra ˆamʉlóolaa mʉʉntʉ muki ˆarekwa nɨ mʉlʉme waachwe, ʉwo ayéendaa na muki wa mʉʉntʉ.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Musúngaati na Lasáaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Haaha, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte musúngaati ʉmwɨ, ˆiivɨkɨráa ɨngo ja <char style="w">kɨtáani</char> ˆjiri gyaa ja kisúngaati, ˆjalʉkwa na mputi ja kɨkomi. Na sikʉ joosi yeeye arijáa chóorya cha kibuya. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Kei, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉkɨva ʉmwɨ ˆasewáa Lasáaro. Areetwáa, maa akavɨɨkwa mʉryaangwii kwaachwe. Ʉhʉ ajáa atɨɨte viloonda mʉvɨrɨ vʉʉ. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Yeeye iikaláa mʉryaangwii na ajáa atɨɨte mpɨɨma yo rya mangʼenyengʼenye ˆyawíire ɨsɨ ya méesa kwa ʉhʉ musúngaati. Kei, kúri jʉʉjáa noo mʉnaampa viloonda vyaachwe.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Sikʉ ˆjikalooke, ʉra mʉkɨva akakwya. <char style="w">Mirimʉ miija</char> ɨkʉʉja noo mʉsʉmʉla, ɨkamʉtwaala fʉʉrʉ kɨpeembii cha <char style="w">Aburaháamu</char>. Ʉra musúngaati ne akɨjoowulala na akataahwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Yeeye akatamanya na <char style="w" lemma="Ntare">ntarii</char>. Ʉko uturikirii, akiinurirya miiso yaachwe na mweeri, maa akamoona Aburaháamu kwa kʉlɨ arɨ na Lasáaro. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Aho, ʉra musúngaati akamwaanɨrɨra Aburaháamu, ‘Taáta Aburaháamu, naanga na riiso ra wʉʉja. Nooloomba ʉmʉtʉme Lasáaro atukye imaamba raachwe luujii, maa atoonyerye lurimii lwaanɨ sa lʉhole. Kɨkomi nɨ tʉrɨkɨra niise mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ mootwii ʉhʉ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Aho, Aburaháamu akamʉsea, ‘Mwanawaanɨ, kʉmbʉkɨra, weewe mpɨɨndɨ ˆʉjáa mooyo, ʉjáa ʉtɨɨte viintʉ vyoosi ˆvyabooha ˆʉsaakáa. Maa kaa, Lasáaro nɨ uturikiri vii apatáa. Haaha yeeye atúuriiwe mʉtɨma aha na weewe ʉmwaarɨ wootʉrɨkɨra mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Sɨ jeyyo vii tʉkʉ, katɨkatɨ yiiswi na nyuunyu kwatɨɨte iduundu ikʉʉlʉ mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ. Iduundu ɨro, ravɨɨkwa sa vaantʉ va kʉnʉ ˆvarɨ saaka kʉʉja nooko kwaanyu, vasiindwe fɨrɨra na vaantʉ va ʉko vasiindwe kʉʉja na kʉnʉ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Aho, ʉra musúngaati akasea, ‘Haaha nookʉloomba ee taáta ʉmʉtʉme Lasáaro atamanye na kaayii kwa taáta wiitʉ. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Ʉko natɨɨte vaaniitʉ vasaano. Lasáaro akavalʉme kutu sa karɨ luu vʉʉje na kʉnʉ kʉʉntʉ kwa uturikiri tʉkʉ.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Maa kaa, Aburaháamu akamʉsea, ‘Vaanaanyu vatɨɨte ʉtali wa <char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> na valáali na mʉtwe va Ijʉva, vayateere ayo!’<verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Ʉra musúngaati akamʉsea, ‘Taáta Aburaháamu tʉkʉ! Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ afúfukire na adome akavawyɨɨre, aho, <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">valandʉka varɨ</char> fuma uvii waavo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Aburaháamu akamʉsea, ‘Koonɨ sɨ vatéerɨɨre yara ˆyaandɨkwa nɨ Mʉ́sa na valáali na mʉtwe, sɨ varɨ ruma baa ya mʉʉntʉ afúfukire tʉkʉ.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Kʉsea Yasírire</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matáayo 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maáriki 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> akavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Masáare ˆyabwéeyyaa vaantʉ viikunguvale, mpaka yʉʉje vii. Maa kaa, mpolaɨ kwa ʉra yoyoosi ˆyooyareeta. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Nɨ pwee viri kwa mʉʉntʉ ʉwo kʉchʉʉngɨrwa lwaala nkiingwii, maa afweitɨrwe na mayiyii, kʉlookya uturikiri ˆarɨ turya ko mʉhaanda ʉmwɨ wa ava vadúúdi atʉmame ʉvɨ! <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Sa jeyyo, imi neeja.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Koonɨ mwaanaanyu abwéeyyiirye ʉvɨ, mʉdalavye. Koonɨ <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">aválandukire</char> fuma uvii waachwe, mʉsee yasírire. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Koonɨ ahóniirye kwa sikʉ ɨmwɨ mara mufungatɨ na uújire na kwaako yoosea, ‘Haɨ, naválandukire fuma uvii waanɨ,’ weewe woosaakwa ʉmʉsee yasírire.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngururu yo Muruma Mʉlʉʉngʉ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Aho, <char style="w">vatumwi</char> va Yéesu vakamʉsea Mweenevyoosi, “Toongererye kukuruma.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Mweenevyoosi akavasea, “Ngaarɨ mʉrɨ na kuruma baa kuduudi ja mpeke nduudi ya <char style="w">haradáali</char>, ngaarɨ mʉdáhire kʉʉsea ʉhʉ mʉkʉyʉ, ‘Ngʼooka, ʉkakondiwe mayiyii!’ Nowo ngaarɨ wavɨ́ɨre matu kwa kɨra ˆmuuwyɨ́ɨrɨɨre.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉrɨmo wa Mʉtʉmami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>Baa ja tʉsee, koonɨ ʉmwɨ waanyu arɨ na mʉtʉmami waachwe ˆafúmire rɨma iwundii au kuriisha muundi, nɨ ani ʉmwɨ waanyu ifaanaa amʉsee, ‘Yeenda chaangʉ, ikala, urye chóorya?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Sɨ jeyyo tʉkʉ. Kɨrɨ vyoolʉʉsa jei sea arɨ, ‘Nyimirya neeja chóorya, na wʉʉntʉmamɨre fʉʉrʉ mpʉmʉle kurya no nywa. ˆNdɨrɨ hʉmʉla de weewe urye no nywa.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Eri, mʉdʉʉmba ʉrɨ mʉtʉmami ko bweeyya kɨra ˆcheene ʉmʉwyɨ́ɨrɨɨre abweeyye wʉʉ? Aka tʉkʉ! <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Viivyo, baa nyuunyu ˆmʉrɨ hʉmʉla tʉmama yoosi ˆmwalaiririwa, sei, ‘Suusu tʉrɨ vatʉmami vii, tatʉ́mamire yara ˆmeene tasaakwa tʉtʉmame vii.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovahorya Vaantʉ Ikimi ˆVarɨ na Ʉlóónda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆadomáa na Yerusaléemu, ajáa atweera na mʉhakii wa ɨsɨ ya <char style="w">Samaría</char> na <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆɨɨngɨráa iturii rɨmwɨ, ajáa alʉmana na vaantʉ ikimi ˆvarɨ na <char style="w">ʉlóónda</char>. Avo vaantʉ vakɨɨma kʉlɨ, maa <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>vakaanɨrɨra voosea, “Yéesu, Mweenevyoosi, tʉlaange na riiso ra wʉʉja!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yéesu ˆakavoone akavasea, “Tamanyi, mukiiyonekye kwa <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LUK 5:14">5:14</ref>.</char></note> Na mpɨɨndɨ ˆvajáa njirii vootamanya, maa vakajirʉlwa ʉlóónda waavo.<verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Ʉmwɨ waavo ˆakoone ahórire, maa akahɨndʉka na kwa Yéesu kʉnʉ yoomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ na sawúti nkʉʉlʉ. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Akalaala majewii ya Yéesu na ɨnda kʉnʉ yoomʉdʉʉmba. Ʉwo mʉʉntʉ nɨ Mʉsamaría ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yéesu akamuurya, “Voosi ikimi sɨ vajírwiilwe tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Hai varɨ vara vɨɨngɨ keenda? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Kusiina baa ʉmwɨ ˆahíndukire joo mʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ tʉkʉ, maa kaa, ʉhʉ mʉyeni vii?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Inʉka, ʉtamanye, kuruma kwaako kwakʉhóniirye.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉʉja kwa Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matáayo 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> vajáa vamuurya Yéesu voosea, “<char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> naadi ʉrɨ kʉʉja?” Yéesu akavasea, “Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, sɨ wʉʉjáa ko kʉʉlaangishalaangisha tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Kusiina mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ daha sea, ‘La nʉ aha!’ au ‘La haʉra kʉra,’ tʉkʉ. Sa Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ nɨ nowo mʉrɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Aho, akavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Mpɨɨndɨ kʉʉja jiise, kʉva mʉrɨ na mpɨɨma jo va na <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> baa kwa sikʉ ɨmwɨ vii, maa kaa, sɨ mʉrɨ kʉʉnyona tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Vaantʉ kʉndoovasea veende, ‘La haʉra hara,’ au ‘Haʉhʉ aha!’ Karɨ mʉdómaa na karɨ mʉvarúmaa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Sa Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ sikʉ ˆarɨ kʉʉja, kʉʉja arɨ ja lʉlávo ˆvyeene lʉʉ́jaa loomʉrɨka mavaru yoosi ya kurumu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Maa kaa, saakwa arɨ aturikiriwe kwa masáare ˆyarɨ foo na siitwa arɨ nɨ mbyaala ɨhɨ.<verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Ja viintʉ ˆvijáa sikʉ ja Nʉ́hʉ, noo ˆvyeene ɨrɨ kʉva sikʉ yo hɨndʉka Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ja Nʉ́hʉ, vaantʉ varijáa no nywa, valoolwáa no loola fʉʉrʉ sikʉ ɨra Nʉ́hʉ ˆakɨɨngɨre na safíinii. Aho, ɨra mbula ya imalo ɨkʉʉja, maa ɨkavamala voosi vʉʉ.<verse eid="LUK 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Baa mpɨɨndɨ ja Lúutu nɨ ja jeyyo vijáa. Vaantʉ varijáa no nywa, vaváa iyoombe no wʉla, varɨmáa no jeenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Maa kaa, sikʉ ɨra Lúutu ˆakiinʉke <char style="w" lemma="Sodóoma na Gomóora">Sodóoma</char>, mooto na sálʉfa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:29 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">sálʉfa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɨ kemikáali ˆɨrɨ ja iwye au muchu ˆʉrɨ lubúusi. Sálʉfa yakóreraa mooto ja wa ngʼaanjo na yanyúkaa ja iyɨrɨra. Isáarii ra Mʉlʉʉngʉ sálʉfa yoónekyaa nkalari ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ.</char></note> ʉjáa wakiima fuma kurumwii, ʉkavamala voosi vʉʉ. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Noo jeyyo ˆviri kʉva sikʉ ɨra Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ variyʉlwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Sikʉ ɨyo, mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ ikekeerii karɨ akiime sa atoole viintʉ vyaachwe nyuumbii tʉkʉ. Na ʉra ˆarɨ iwundii karɨ ahɨ́ndʉkaa na kaayii noo toola chochoosi tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Kumbukiri kɨra alʉmana nocho muki wa Lúutu!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="GEN 19:26">Ncholo 19:26</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ʉra ˆyooyera kʉlamurirya nkaasʉ yaachwe, ʉwo kɨɨtaaha arɨ. Maa kaa, mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ʉra ˆyookɨɨtaaha nkaasʉ yaachwe, ʉwo kɨɨlamurirya arɨ.<figure style="fig" alt="Jewish house" file="lb00234c.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994" ref="17:31">Nyuumba ya Kɨyahúudi</figure><verse eid="LUK 17:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, sikʉ ɨyo, vaantʉ vavɨrɨ ˆvalɨ́ɨre kɨtáanda kɨmwɨ, ʉmwɨ sʉmʉlwa arɨ, na wɨɨngɨ rekwa arɨ. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Vaantʉ vaki vavɨrɨ ˆvoosha hamwɨ, ʉmwɨ sʉmʉlwa arɨ na wɨɨngɨ rekwa arɨ. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Vaantʉ valʉme vavɨrɨ kʉva varɨ vootʉmama iwundii, ʉmwɨ sʉmʉlwa arɨ na wɨɨngɨ rekwa arɨ.]”<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Aho, vapooji vaachwe vakamuurya, “Mweenevyoosi, aya nɨ hai ˆyarɨ fʉmɨra?” Ne akavasea, “Hara kʉʉntʉ ˆkʉrɨ na maka ˆikwíire, aho noo kʉʉntʉ nkuumba jilʉ́manɨraa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mʉlala sɨ ˆAkéraa Mpɨɨma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> akavavaɨra vapooji vaachwe lusímo ʉlʉ yoovakiindya vatuube kʉndooloomba bila yookatala. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Akavasea, “Múujii ʉmwɨ, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉlamuli ʉmwɨ. Ʉhʉ mʉlamuli, sɨ amoofáa Mʉlʉʉngʉ tʉkʉ, baa kei, sɨ avanyemyáa vaantʉ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Na múujii ʉwo, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉlala ʉmwɨ ˆatamanyáa na kwaachwe yoomʉloomba, ‘Kalaama nooloomba ʉlamʉle kɨloongi chaanɨ na mʉvɨ waanɨ sa mpate kɨra <char style="w">Miiro</char> ˆyaruma.’<verse eid="LUK 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Kwa sikʉ ˆjiri foo ʉra mʉlamuli ajáa asiita kʉmwaambirirya. Maa kaa, sikʉ ɨmwɨ akiisea yeemweene, ‘Baa neembe sɨ nɨmoófaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ na baa neembe sɨ nɨvanyémyaa vaantʉ, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>sa viintʉ ʉhʉ mʉlala yookuunjuuwa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, lamʉla ndɨrɨ kɨloongi chaachwe, apate kɨra ˆkɨmʉtéire sa areke kʉʉnkatarya.’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Aho, Mweenevyoosi akavasea, “Ikiindyi fuma kwa ʉhʉ mʉlamuli sɨ ˆarɨ mʉwoloki. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Eri, Mʉlʉʉngʉ sɨ arɨ vaheera vira ˆvivatéire vaantʉ ˆavasaawʉla vara ˆvoomʉloomba uchikʉ na muusi tʉkʉ wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, Mʉlʉʉngʉ kʉvaheera arɨ chaangʉ kɨra ˆkɨvatéire. Maa kaa, <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> ˆarɨ hɨndʉka na aha weerwii, shaana arɨ vaantʉ ˆvamuruma wʉʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mʉfarisáayo na Mʉsaankanʼyi Kóodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Yéesu akavawyɨɨra kwa lusímo vaantʉ ˆveene viiyonáa voovo nɨ vawoloki na vavachwijáa matɨ vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>Akavasea, “Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, vaantʉ vavɨrɨ vajáa vatamanya na <char style="w" lemma="Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva">Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</char> noo mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Ʉmwɨ nɨ <char style="w" lemma="Mafarisáayo">Mʉfarisáayo</char> ajáa na wɨɨngɨ, <char style="w" lemma="Vasaankanʼyi kóodi">mʉsaankanʼyi kóodi</char>. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Ʉra Mʉfarisáayo akɨɨma yeemweene, maa akaanda mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ yoosea, ‘Ee Mʉlʉʉngʉ, nakʉdʉ́ʉmbaa sa nɨɨnɨ sɨ ndɨrɨ ja vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ, vakumuriryi, sɨ ˆvarɨ vawoloki tʉkʉ, ˆvayéendaa na vaki va vaantʉ, baa kei sɨ ndɨrɨ ja ʉhʉ mʉsaankanʼyi kóodi tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Nɨɨnɨ kwa júma ɨmwɨ niirékyaa kurya kavɨrɨ. Kei, natóolaa ilʉʉndʉ rɨmwɨ ra kɨra malʉʉndʉ ikimi ra viintʉ vyaanɨ.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Maa kaa, ʉra mʉsaankanʼyi kóodi akɨɨma kʉlɨ, sɨ asaaka baa kwiinʉla miiso yaachwe na kurumwii tʉkʉ. Yeeye, akiivaavaa kɨpeembe kʉnʉ yookaavwa nɨ mʉtɨma yoosea, ‘Ee Mʉlʉʉngʉ nookʉloomba wʉʉnyonere mbavariri, nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ mʉvɨ!’<verse eid="LUK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, ʉhʉ mʉsaankanʼyi kóodi, ahɨndʉka na kaayii kwaachwe kʉnʉ avárirwe nɨ mʉwoloki, maa kaa, kwa ʉra Mʉfarisáayo sɨ jeyyo tʉkʉ. Sa kɨra mʉʉntʉ ˆiiyámbukyaa na mweeri, kiimiwa arɨ, na ʉra ˆiikíimyaa na ɨsɨ, kaambukiwa arɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovatalarya Vasinga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matáayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maáriki 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Haaha vaantʉ vamʉreteráa Yéesu vasinga vaduudi sa avavɨkɨre mɨkono. Vapooji vaachwe ˆvakoone jeyyo, maa vakavaamirirya. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akavaanɨrɨra vara vasinga, akavasea, “Vareki vasinga vaduudi vʉʉje na kʉrɨ nɨɨnɨ, karɨ mʉvakɨtɨre tʉkʉ! Sa <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> nɨ sa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ ja vasinga ava. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, yoyoosi ʉra sɨ ˆarɨ kʉʉhokera Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ ja musinga muduudi, sɨ arɨ kʉʉyɨngɨra vii kaa tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉheewa Nkaasʉ ya Sikʉ ˆJisiina Ʉhero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matáayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maáriki 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Aho, mʉlongooli ʉmwɨ akamuurya Yéesu, “Mukiindya mʉʉja, che ndɨrɨ bweeyya mpokere nkaasʉ ya sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Sa che wookʉʉnyanɨrɨra mʉʉja? Kusiina mʉʉja tʉkʉ, mʉʉja nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ yeemweene vii. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Ʉmányire ndairiri ja Mʉlʉʉngʉ wʉʉ? ‘Karɨ ʉyéendaa na muki wa mʉʉntʉ tʉkʉ, karɨ wʉʉ́laa tʉkʉ, karɨ wiívaa tʉkʉ, karɨ ʉlóngowereryaa mʉʉntʉ tʉkʉ, na ʉvanyemye vala íyo na taáta waanyu.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ufumo 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 5:16-20</ref>.</char></note>” <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Ne akasea, “Ayo yoosi nayakwaatya keende usinga waanɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yéesu ˆakateere jei, akamʉsea, “Kɨmwaarɨ kɨɨntʉ kimudu vii sɨ ˆʉnabweeyya. Tamanya, ʉkavae iyoombe máari joosi ˆʉrɨ nojo, na mpía ˆʉrɨ turya, ʉvaheere vakɨva. Jeyyo, turya ʉrɨ máari ya kɨkomi ya mberii kurumwii. Aho, yeenda, wuuntuube.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆakateere ayo, akiirya mʉtɨma maatʉkʉ vii, sa yeeye nɨ musúngaati maatʉkʉ vii ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yéesu akamoona ʉra mʉʉntʉ iíriirye mʉtɨma, maa akasea, “Kʉva viri vyafafa maatʉkʉ vii kwa musúngaati kwɨɨngɨra Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Kɨkomi, nɨ vyaangʉ ngamɨ́a kʉtweera na ihengerii ra sinkeni, kʉlookya musúngaati kwɨɨngɨra na Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Vaantʉ vara ˆvateera masáare aya vakasea, “Nɨ ani de arɨ daha lamuririwa?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Yara sɨ ˆyadáhɨkaa kwa vaantʉ, kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ yadáhɨkaa.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/><char style="w">Peéteri</char> akamʉsea, “Laanga! Suusu tareka vyoosi ˆtʉjáa novyo tʉkakutuuba weewe!”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, mʉʉntʉ yoyoosi ʉra ˆareka nyuumba yaachwe, au mʉdala waachwe, au vandʉʉ vaachwe, au vala íyo na taáta, au vaana vaachwe sa Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>ʉwo hokera arɨ ˆviri foo mpɨɨndɨ iji kʉlookya vira ˆareka. Na weerʉ ˆyookʉʉja, hokera arɨ nkaasʉ ya sikʉ ˆjisiina ʉhero.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoolʉʉsa Inkwya na Kʉfʉfʉka Kwaachwe lwa Katatʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matáayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maáriki 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Aho, Yéesu akavasʉmʉla vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ na ivarwii, maa akavasea, “Haaha nɨ kwaambʉka tiise na Yerusaléemu. Masáare yoosi ˆmeene yaandɨkwa nɨ <char style="w">valáali na mʉtwe</char> sa Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ, kiimana yarɨ. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Yeeye vɨɨkwa arɨ mɨkonwii ya vaantʉ sɨ ˆvarɨ <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char>. Aho, muchwa varɨ matɨ, <char style="w" lemma="Tʉkɨra">mʉtʉkɨra varɨ</char> na kʉmʉchwɨɨra varɨ matɨ. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Kei kʉmʉvaa varɨ na <char style="w">mɨjeléedi</char> na kʉmʉʉlaa varɨ na sikʉ ya katatʉ fʉfʉka arɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Maa kaa, vapooji vaachwe sɨ vataanga ʉvariyuli wa masáare aya tʉkʉ, sa ʉvariyuli waachwe ʉjáa wiivisa kʉrɨ voovo. Sɨ vataanga nɨ che alʉʉsáa tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉhorya Mʉhoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matáayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maáriki 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yéesu ˆakasengerere múuji wa Yerɨ́ɨko, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉhoku ʉmwɨ ˆaloombáa iíkyɨɨre heehi na njɨra. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Ʉwo mʉhoku ˆakateere mpuka ya vaantʉ voolooka, akuurya, “Nɨ che kwatɨɨte?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Vakamʉsea, “Yéesu wa Nasaréeti yoolooka.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Aho, akatʉla isóso yoosea, “Ee Yéesu, <char style="w">Sha Daúdi</char>, naanga na riiso ra wʉʉja!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Vaantʉ vara ˆvajáa valóngwɨɨre mbere ya Yéesu vakaanda kʉmʉdalavya akirinye. Maa kaa, yeeye akadoomererya kʉmwaanɨrɨra, “Ee Sha Daúdi, naanga na riiso ra wʉʉja Aaɨ!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yéesu akɨɨma, maa akavalairirya vamʉreete na kwaachwe. Ʉra mʉhoku ˆakaseese, maa Yéesu akamuurya, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Che woosaaka nɨkʉbweeyyiirye?” Ne akasea, “Ee Mweenevyoosi, noosaaka noone!”<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus heals a blind man" file="CN01741B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978" ref="18:40-41">Yéesu yoomʉhorya mʉhoku</figure><verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Aho, Yéesu akamʉsea, “Haaha ona kaa! Kuruma kwaako kwakʉhóniirye.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Hahara akaanda koona kei. Akamutuuba Yéesu kʉnʉ yoomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Na vaantʉ voosi ˆvakoone ayo, vakamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoolʉmana na Sakáayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>
    <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ˆakɨɨngɨre na múuji wa Yerɨ́ɨko, akakwaatɨra na katɨkatɨ ya ʉwo múuji. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Ʉko, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ wa <char style="w">vasaankanʼyi kóodi</char>. Ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ nɨ musúngaati ajáa na irina raachwe noo Sakáayo asewáa. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Sakáayo akava yoosaaka kʉmoona Yéesu. Maa kaa, sa viintʉ ajáa mukufi, akasiindwa kʉmoona Yéesu sa kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mpuka nkʉʉlʉ ya vaantʉ. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Sa jeyyo, akakʉʉrɨka itɨ́ɨjo, akalongorera na mbere. Akaambʉka mʉsaambwii sa amoone Yéesu kati ˆyoolooka.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yéesu ˆakafike hara mʉsaambwii, akalaanga mweeri, maa akamʉsea Sakáayo, “Sakáayo, kiima chaangʉ! Isikʉ nɨ kwaako ndɨrɨ kʉʉmba!” <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Aho, Sakáayo akakiima chaangʉ na ɨsɨ, maa akamʉteengya Yéesu na kaayii kwaachwe na cheerʉ.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Vaantʉ voosi ˆvakoone, vakaanda ngʼuula voosea, “Sa che yookɨɨngɨra noo va mʉyeni kwa iduwalo?” <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Maa kaa, Sakáayo akɨɨma, ma akamʉsea Mweenevyoosi, “Aaɨ laanga, haaha jei kera niise máari yaanɨ havɨrɨ. Ivaru rɨmwɨ vaheera ndɨrɨ vakɨva na koonɨ nasʉmʉla kɨɨntʉ cha mʉʉntʉ kwa ʉloongo, ʉwo mʉhɨndʉrɨra ndɨrɨ mara kanɨ ya ɨkyo kɨɨntʉ ˆnasʉmʉla.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Aho, Yéesu akamʉsea, “Ʉlamuriri wɨɨ́ngɨɨre kʉrɨ kaaya ɨhɨ, sa baa weewe umurúmire Mʉlʉʉngʉ ja taáta wiitʉ <char style="w">Aburaháamu</char>. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Sa <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> ʉʉja joo saakɨra no lamurirya vara ˆvarɨmɨra.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Vatʉmami ˆVaheewa Mpía</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matáayo 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Vaantʉ vara ˆvamʉteereráa Yéesu yoovavaɨra símo viiseáa <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> fika wiise, sa viintʉ vajáa vaséngerɨɨre fika múuji wa Yerusaléemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Aho, Yéesu akavasea, “Kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ wa lʉkolo lwa kɨtemi. Yeeye ajáa akera njɨra na ɨsɨ ya kʉlɨ. Ʉko ajáa atamanya noo heewa ʉtemi de ahɨndʉke na ɨsɨ yaachwe kʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ kʉva mʉtemi. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>De alooke, ajáa avaanɨrɨra vatʉmami vaachwe ikimi, akavaheera kɨra mʉʉntʉ mpía ˆjiri foo akavasea, ‘Saakiri kʉnáálo na mpía iji fʉʉrʉ sikʉ ˆndɨrɨ hɨndʉka!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Maa kaa, vaantʉ va ɨsɨ yaachwe vajáa vamʉsʉʉla, sa jeyyo vakatʉma vaantʉ nyuma yaachwe voosea, ‘Sɨ toosaaka mʉʉntʉ ʉhʉ ave mʉtemi wiitʉ tʉkʉ.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Baa neembe vajáa valʉʉsa jeyyo, yeeye ajáa aheewa ʉtemi. ˆAkahɨndʉke, akavaanɨrɨra vara vatʉmami ˆajáa avaheera mpía sa ataange kʉnáálo ˆngʼeene vaturya.<verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Mʉtʉmami wa ncholo ˆakʉʉje, maa akasea, ‘Ee mʉtemi, mpía ˆngʼeene waampeera, nasaakɨrɨra kʉnáálo nkapata malʉʉndʉ ikimi yɨɨngɨ.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Ʉra mʉtemi akamʉsea, ‘Wabweeyya vyabooha mʉtʉmami mʉʉja! Sa viintʉ waava wo kiilaangiwa kwa viintʉ viduudi, kʉheera ndɨrɨ wɨɨmɨrɨre míiji ikimi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Mʉtʉmami wa kavɨrɨ ne akʉʉja akasea, ‘Ee mʉtemi, mpía ˆngʼeene waampeera nasaakɨrɨra kʉnáálo nkapata malʉʉndʉ yɨɨngɨ yasaano.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Mʉtemi akamʉsea ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ, ‘Baa weewe nakʉhɨ́ɨre wɨɨmɨrɨre míiji ɨsaano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Maa re, akʉʉja ʉra mʉtʉmami wɨɨngɨ akasea, ‘Ee mʉtemi, mpía jaako nɨ iji aha. Najichʉʉngɨrɨra kɨtabárii sa jidɨɨre rɨmɨra. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Nɨjáa nakoofa sa weewe ʉrɨ mʉʉntʉ mʉfafu. Ʉsʉ́mʉlaa viintʉ haantʉ sɨ ˆwavɨɨka, na wachwíjaa kʉʉntʉ sɨ ˆʉhaanda.’<verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Mʉtemi akamʉsea, ‘Mʉtʉ́mwa mʉvɨ weewe! Kwa masáare ˆyafúmire mʉlomwii waako kʉkʉlamʉrɨra niise! Weewe ʉjáa ʉmányire nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ mʉʉntʉ mʉfafu, nasʉ́mʉlaa kʉʉntʉ sɨ ˆnavɨɨka kɨɨntʉ, baa kei nachwíjaa kʉʉntʉ sɨ ˆnahaanda. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Ha de haaha, sa che sɨ ujivɨɨka mpía jaanɨ kwa vaantʉ ˆvachúrushaa sa nɨɨnɨ ˆndɨrɨ hɨndʉka nsʉmʉle mpía jaanɨ na kʉnáálo yaachwe?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Aho, mʉtemi akavasea vara vaantʉ ˆvajáa viímire aho, ‘Mʉhóki ilʉʉndʉ raachwe mʉkamʉheere ʉra ˆarɨ na ikimi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Maa kaa, voovo vakamʉsea, ‘Mʉkʉ́lʉ, amwɨ ʉra atɨɨte malʉʉndʉ ikimi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Ne akavasea, ‘Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, kɨra ˆarɨ na kɨɨntʉ, koongereriwa arɨ kʉlookya, maa kaa, ʉra ˆasiina kɨɨntʉ, vuulwa arɨ baa kɨra kidúúdi ˆarɨ nocho. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Na kwa vara vavɨ vaanɨ, vara sɨ ˆvasaakáa nɨve mʉtemi mweeri yaavo, vareeti na aha, mʉvʉʉlae mbere yaanɨ.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooteengiwa Yerusaléemu na Siriri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matáayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maáriki 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yooháani 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yéesu ˆakahʉmʉle kʉlʉʉsa ayo, akavalongorera mbere yookaambʉka na Yerusaléemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>ˆVakasengerere maturii ya Besifáage na Besanía ˆyarɨ luulwii ˆlwaséwaa Lʉʉlʉ lwa <char style="w">Mɨseitúuni</char>, akavatʉma vapooji vaachwe vavɨrɨ, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>akavasea, “Tamanyi na ituri ˆrɨrɨ mbere yaanyu, na kati ˆmookɨɨngɨra koona mʉrɨ mwaana wa ndákwi sɨ ˆanavereka mʉʉntʉ, achúungirwe aho. Muchunguriri, mʉmʉreete na aha. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ avuúriirye, ‘Sa che moomʉchʉngʉrɨra mwaana wa ndákwi?’ mʉsei, ‘Mweenevyoosi yoomʉsaaka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Vara vapooji vakadoma, maa vakashaana kɨra kɨɨntʉ ja ˆvyeene Yéesu ajáa avawyɨ́ɨrɨɨre. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Kati ˆvamʉchʉngʉrɨráa ʉra mwaana wa ndákwi, veene ndákwi vakavuurya, “Amwɨ moomʉchʉngʉrɨra mwaana wa ndákwi?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Vara vapooji vakavasea, “Mweenevyoosi yoomʉsaaka.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Vakamʉtwaarɨra Yéesu. ˆVakahʉmʉle kwaala ɨngo jaavo mweeri ya ʉwo mwaana wa ndákwi, vapooji vaachwe vakamwaambukya ndákwii.<verse eid="LUK 19:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆatamanyáa, vaantʉ vakaala ɨngo jaavo njirii.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus enters Jerusalem with joy" file="DN00487b.tif" size="col" copy="United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya" ref="19:36">Yéesu yookɨɨngɨra na Yerusaléemu na siriri</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Yéesu ˆakafike mugiritwii wa Lʉʉlʉ lwa Mɨseitúuni, mpuka yoosi na vapooji vaachwe vakaanda vaa siriri kʉnʉ voomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ na sawúti nkʉʉlʉ, sa myuujíisa yoosi ˆvajáa voona Yéesu yoobweeyya. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Vaseáa jei,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Atalariwa Mʉtemi ˆyookʉʉja kwa irina ra <char style="nd">Ijʉva</char>!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">Mwiikalo mʉʉja kurumwii na nkongojima kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ ˆArɨ Mweerimweeri.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sabúuri 118:26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Vamwɨ va <char style="w">Mafarisáayo</char> ˆvajáa vamwaarɨ mʉra mpukii, maa vakamʉsea Yéesu, “Mukiindya, valairirye vapooji vaako vakirinye.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, koonɨ ava vakíriinye, mawye tʉla yarɨ isóso.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookʉʉrɨrɨra Múuji wa Yerusaléemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Yéesu akasengerera múuji wa Yerusaléemu. ˆAkʉʉyone múuji, maa akʉʉrɨrɨra, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>yoosea, “Ngaarɨ wataanga sikʉ ɨhɨ yara ˆyarɨ kʉretera mwiikalo mʉʉja, haaha yaviswa miiswii yaako. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Kɨkomi, sikʉ kʉʉja jiise, vavɨ vaako kʉkereesa varɨ, na kʉrɨɨngɨrɨra varɨ nkaande joosi na kʉkɨtɨra varɨ isii. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Kʉkʉkanya varɨ weewe na vaantʉ vaako voosi. Kei sɨ varɨ reka iwye baa rɨmwɨ mweeri ya rɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ, sa sɨ ʉtaanga mpɨɨndɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ ʉʉja na kwaako tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matáayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maáriki 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yooháani 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Aho, Yéesu akɨɨngɨra <char style="w" lemma="Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva">Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</char> akaanda vakibirya vaantʉ ˆvaváa iyoombe viintʉ aho. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Akavasea, “Yaandɨkwa Masáarii ˆYarɨ Mpeho, ‘Nyuumba yaanɨ kʉva ɨrɨ nyuumba yo mʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46a </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isáaya 56:7</ref>.</char></note> Maa kaa, nyuunyu mwɨɨválandwɨɨre ɨkava ‘mpaanga ya viívi.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:46b </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yeremía 7:11</ref>.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Kɨra siikʉ akiindyáa Kaayii Njija. Maa kaa, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> na valongooli va vaantʉ vasaakɨráa njɨra yo mʉʉlaa Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Maa kaa, vakasova njɨra sa vaantʉ voosi vateereráa masáare yaachwe na vamʉteeráa matu kamwɨ.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoofoorimwa Lʉvɨro Lwaachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matáayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maáriki 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Sikʉ ɨmwɨ, <char style="w">Yéesu</char> avavariyʉrɨráa <char style="w">Masáare Maaja</char> vaantʉ waámii wa <char style="w">Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva</char>. Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva, <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> na vawosi vakamʉʉjɨra. <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Aho, vakamuurya voosea, “Tʉwyɨɨre nɨ kwa wiimiriri wa ani wootʉmama masáare aya? Nɨ ani akʉheera wiimiriri ʉhʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Ne akavasea, “Naanɨ kuvuurya ndɨrɨ, mʉʉngwyɨɨre, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>eri, <char style="w" lemma="Batisa">ʉbatíiso</char> wa Yooháani nɨ kurumwii wafuma, bakʉ kwa vaantʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Aho, vakalʉʉsɨkanʼya voovo kwa voovo, “Koonɨ taséire ‘Wafuma kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ,’ sea arɨ, ‘Haaha amwɨ sɨ mwamuruma?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Maa kaa, koonɨ taséire, ‘Wafuma kwa vaantʉ,’ vaantʉ voosi kʉtʉvaa varɨ na mawye tukwye sa vaantʉ voosi vamuruma Yooháani nɨ <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Aho, maa re vakamʉsea, “Sɨ tamányire kʉʉntʉ wiimiriri waachwe ˆwafuma tʉkʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yéesu ne akavasea, “Naanɨ sɨ ndɨrɨ vawyɨɨra nɨ kwa wiimiriri ʉrɨkwɨ nootʉmama aya tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovafwaanirirya Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va Vayahúudi na<optbreak/>Varimi Vavɨ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matáayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maáriki 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akaanda kʉvavaɨra vaantʉ lusímo ʉlʉ, “Mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ajáa ahaanda mɨsabíibu iwundii kwaachwe. Ɨro iwʉnda akarɨkojya kwa varimi. Maa yeeye akakera njɨra na ɨsɨ ya kʉlɨ. Ʉko akɨɨta kiikala kwa sikʉ ˆjiri foo. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Mpɨɨndɨ jo chwa ˆjikafike, akamʉtʉma mʉtʉmami waachwe kwa vara vaantʉ sa vamʉheere haantʉ haachwe ha sabíibu ˆvachwíire. Maa kaa, vara varimi ˆajáa avakojya vakamʉvaa ʉra mʉtʉmami, maa vakamukibirya na mɨkono mɨtʉhʉ. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Akamʉtʉma mʉtʉmami wɨɨngɨ, ʉhʉ ne vakamʉvaa, vakamʉbweeyyirya masáare ya soni, maa vakamukibirya na mɨkono mɨtʉhʉ. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Kei akamʉtʉma wa katatʉ, ʉhʉ ne vakamʉtamikya, maa vakamʉfweitɨra na weerwii ya iwʉnda.<verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Maa re mweeneiwʉnda ra mɨsabíibu akiiyurya, ‘Che ndɨrɨ bweeyya? Haaha kʉmʉtʉma niise mwaana waanɨ. Ʉhʉ namweenda maatʉkʉ! Ʉhʉ ifaanaa vamʉnyemye.’<verse eid="LUK 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Maa kaa, vara ˆvakojiwa iwʉnda ˆvakamoone vii, maa vakiiwyɨɨra voovo kwa voovo voosea, ‘Ʉhʉ noo mʉpaari wa ɨrɨ iwʉnda. Tʉmʉʉlae haaha sa ʉpaari waachwe ʉve wiiswi.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Vakamʉfweitɨra na weerwii ya iwʉnda ra mɨsabíibu, maa vakamʉʉlaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Aho, Yéesu akavuurya, “Haaha mweeneiwʉnda che arɨ vabweeyya vaantʉ vara? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Kʉʉja arɨ na kʉvʉʉlaa arɨ avo vaantʉ ˆavakojya iwʉnda na kʉvakojya arɨ vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ ɨrɨ iwʉnda ra mɨsabíibu.” Vaantʉ ˆvakateere ayo masáare, maa vakasea, “Aka tʉkʉ! Karɨ baa luu vifʉmɨre vii tʉkʉ!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Yéesu akavalaanga, maa akavasea, “Masáare aya ˆYarɨ Mpeho nɨ che yalʉʉsa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Iwye ˆrasiitwa nɨ vajeengi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">ravɨ́ɨre iwye ikʉʉlʉ ra kichurii.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sabúuri 118:22</ref>.</char></note><figure style="fig" alt="conerstone" file="GT00081.tif" size="col" copy="Gordon Thompson, Wycliffe Bible Translators 2012" ref="20:17">Iwye ikʉʉlʉ ra kichurii</figure><verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Kɨra mʉʉntʉ ˆawíjaa mweeri ya iwye ɨrɨ, ngʼenyekangʼenyeka arɨ, na ʉra ˆrɨrɨ muwyɨɨra, chɨnɨka arɨ kamwɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Vakiindya va Miiro, na vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva, vakasaakɨra njɨra yo mʉkwaata chaangʉ sa vajáa vatáangire lusímo ʉlo nɨ voovo lʉjáa lwavalúusire. Maa kaa, vakavoofa vaantʉ.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉrɨha Kóodi kwa Kaisáari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matáayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maáriki 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Aho, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char> vakava voomʉrɨɨra iyeo. Vakatʉma vaantʉ viibweeyye vawoloki sa vandoomʉsola. Vabweeyyáa jei sa vapate kɨɨntʉ cho mʉkwaatɨra, vamʉvɨɨke ɨsɨ ya ngururu na wiimiriri wa gávana. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Avo vuurikiriri vakamuurya, “Mukiindya, tamányire weewe ʉlʉ́ʉsaa na ʉváriyʉlaa ya kɨmáárɨ. Weewe sɨ woófaa ʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa vaantʉ tʉkʉ, weewe wakíindyaa kɨmáárɨ ja ˆvyeene Mʉlʉʉngʉ asáakaa. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Eri, ndairiri jaruma tʉndoorɨha kóodi kwa <char style="w">Kaisáari</char> bakʉ tʉkʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akataanga ʉkwaata waavo, maa akavasea, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Ndairi mpía ya <char style="w">dináari</char>. Buuwo ɨhɨ na irina ɨrɨ nɨ vya ani?” Vakuuyirya voosea, “Nɨ vya Kaisáari.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Aho, Yéesu akavasea, “Vya Kaisáari, mʉheeri Kaisáari. Na vya Mʉlʉʉngʉ, mʉheeri Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Vakasiindwa kʉmʉkwaata kwa yara ˆalʉʉsáa mbere ja vaantʉ. Vakahwaalala maatʉkʉ vii kwa vira ˆvyeene uuyiryáa, vakakirinya sawu.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉfʉfʉka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matáayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maáriki 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆjikalooke, <char style="w">Masadukáayo</char>, noo kʉsea vaantʉ vara ˆvaséaa kusiina kʉfʉfʉka tʉkʉ, vajáa vamʉʉjɨra Yéesu, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>maa vakamuurya, “Mukiindya, <char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> ajáa atwaandɨkɨra, ‘Koonɨ mʉʉntʉ akwíire baa kʉva na vaana tʉkʉ, mwaanaavo yoosaakwa amʉpaale ʉwo mʉlala sa amʉvyaarɨre vaana mwaanaavo ʉra ˆaakwya.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 25:5-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Haaha, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte vaana valʉme mufungatɨ va mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ. Ndaambere yaachwe ajáa aloola, maa akawulala baa kʉva na mwaana tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Wa kavɨrɨ [akamʉpaala ʉwo mʉlala, ne akawulala baa reka mwaana tʉkʉ.] <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Wa katatʉ ne akamʉpaala ʉwo mʉlaala, ne akakwya baa reka mwaana tʉkʉ. Ɨkava viivyo kwa vaana voosi mufungatɨ ˆvamʉloola ʉra mʉʉntʉ muki, na kusiina ˆareka mwaana tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Maa reerʉ ʉra mwaana muki akawulala. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Haaha, sikʉ ya ʉfʉfʉ́ʉko nɨ muki wa ani arɨ kʉva? Sa ajáa aloolwa nɨ voosi mufungatɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Aha weerwii vaantʉ valóolaa no loolwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Maa kaa, vara ˆvarɨ valwa nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ, vafʉfʉlwe fuma inkwyii na vaturye nkalo weerwii ifya, avo sɨ varɨ loola no loolwa tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Ava sɨ varɨ kukwya kei tʉkʉ, sa avo kʉva varɨ ja <char style="w">mirimʉ miija</char>. Voovo nɨ vaana va Mʉlʉʉngʉ sa voovo nɨ vaana ˆvafʉfʉlwa.<verse eid="LUK 20:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Maa kaa, kwa isáare ra vara ˆvaakwya kʉfʉfʉka, baa Mʉ́sa alʉʉsa vaantʉ ˆvaakwya fʉfʉka varɨ. Alʉʉsa aya masáarii ya rɨra itʉʉndʉ ˆrakoreráa mooto. Alʉʉsa ˆakamwaanɨrɨre Ijʉva nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa <char style="w">Aburaháamu</char>, Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa Isaka na wa Yaakúupu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kɨtáabwii cha Ufumo 3:6, Mʉlʉʉngʉ ajáa amuwyɨɨra Mʉ́sa masáare aya. Maa kaa, mpɨɨndɨ ijo, Aburaháamu, Isaka na Yaakúupu vajáa vawulala aho kalɨ vii.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Yeeye sɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa vaantʉ ˆvaakwya tʉkʉ. Yeeye nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa vaantʉ ˆvarɨ nkaasʉ, na kwaachwe voosi nɨ nkaasʉ varɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Vamwɨ va vakiindya va Miiro vakamʉsea, “Mukiindya, ulúusire kɨkomi kamwɨ!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Kwaandɨra aho, kusiina ˆayera kumuurya tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Masía nɨ Mwaana wa Daúdi na Mweenevyoosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matáayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maáriki 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavuurya, “Eri, nɨ joolɨ vyaava vaantʉ vandoomwaanɨrɨra <char style="w">Masía</char> Mwaana wa mʉtemi <char style="w">Daúdi</char>? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Daúdi mweeneevyo alʉʉsa jei kɨtáabwii cha Sabúuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘<char style="nd">Ijʉva</char> amuwyɨɨra Mweenevyoosi waanɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">“Ikala mʉkono waanɨ wa kʉlʉme,<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>fʉʉrʉ nɨvavɨɨke vavɨ vaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">vave kabambari ko vɨkɨra majeo yaako.”’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sabúuri 110:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Koonɨ Daúdi yoomwaanɨrɨra ‘Mweenevyoosi’ waachwe, haaha joolɨ Masía arɨ kʉva Mwaana wa Daúdi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwiivaa Kɨpeembe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matáayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maáriki 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ vaantʉ voosi ˆvamʉteereráa, Yéesu akavasea vapooji vaachwe, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Mʉvalaange neeja vakiindya va Miiro. Voovo veenda kwiivɨkɨra nkáancho ndɨɨhɨ na veenda luumbiwa kwa nyemi masóokwii. Kei, veenda kwiikala machuumbii ya mbere <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">masinagóogii</char>, na na haantʉ ha nyemi ngovii. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Vanyáhɨraa nyuumba ja valala. Na ʉkweembi vamʉlóombaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ vilɨɨhɨlɨɨhɨ. Vaantʉ ja ava, heewa varɨ irya ikʉʉlʉ fuma kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Mpóryo ya Mʉlala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maáriki 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Mpɨɨndɨ <char style="w">Yéesu</char> ˆajáa <char style="w" lemma="Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva">Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</char>, ajáa avoona vasúngaati voovɨkɨra <char style="w">mpóryo</char> jaavo isandúkwii ro vɨkɨra mpóryo. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Aho, akamoona mʉlala ʉmwɨ mʉkɨva yoovɨkɨra fipóocho fivɨrɨ fya mpía. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Aho, Yéesu akavasea, “Kɨkomi noovawyɨɨra, ʉhʉ mʉlala mʉkɨva atwɨ́ɨre mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ kʉlookya voosi. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Sa ava vɨɨngɨ voosi, vatwɨ́ɨre mpóryo kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ sa ʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa usúngaati waavo. Maa kaa, ʉhʉ mʉlala na ʉkɨva waachwe, atwɨ́ɨre vyoosi ˆarɨ novyo vyoomʉbweeyya ave nkaasʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sikʉ ja Ʉhero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matáayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maáriki 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Vamwɨ va vapooji va Yéesu vakava voomʉlaɨra ˆvyeene Kaaya Njija yajeengwa na mawye ˆyabooha, baa na viintʉ vyɨɨngɨ vya iyoombe ikʉʉlʉ ˆvyeene vaantʉ vatoola ja mpóryo kwa Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Maa kaa, Yéesu akavasea, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Viintʉ vyoosi ivi ˆmoovyoona, sikʉ kʉʉja jiri, kusiina iwye ˆrɨrɨ chaala mweeri ya iwye rɨɨngɨ tʉkʉ. Yoosi vawa yarɨ na ɨsɨ!”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uturikiri ˆWookʉʉja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matáayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maáriki 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Vapooji vaachwe vakamuurya, “Mukiindya, masáare ayo nɨ naadi ˆyarɨ fʉmɨra? Na isháara che jiri laɨra yaséngerɨɨre fʉmɨra?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Laangi neeja, karɨ mʉkóoverwaa tʉkʉ. Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo kʉʉja varɨ kwa irina raanɨ voosea, ‘Nɨɨnɨ noo yeeye!’ Na vɨɨngɨ sea veende, ‘Mpɨɨndɨ jo herererya nɨ aha miiswii jiri!’ Karɨ mʉvatúubaa tʉkʉ! <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉrɨ teera mbuwo ja nkoondo na masáare ya ntiribʉka, karɨ moófaa tʉkʉ. Ayo yoosi nɨ mpaka yafʉmɨre ta, maa kaa, ʉra ʉherereryo wa yoosi ʉkaarɨ.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Kei akavasea, “Ɨsɨ kiinʉla ɨrɨ nkoondo na ɨsɨ yɨɨngɨ, na ʉtemi ʉmwɨ kiinʉla ʉrɨ nkoondo na ʉtemi wɨɨngɨ. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Kʉva kʉrɨ na vitiíntima vikʉʉlʉ, njala ya imalo na ndwáala jo kiihokererya haantʉ haantʉ. Kei kʉva kʉrɨ na viintʉ ˆvyookoofya na isháara ˆjiri foo fuma kurumwii.<verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Maa kaa, ayo de yafʉmɨre, vaantʉ kʉvakwaata veende na kʉvaturikirya veende. Vatwaala veende mʉkalamʉrɨrwe <char style="w" lemma="Sinagóogi">masinagóogii</char> na kʉvachuunga veende mʉnyololwii. Kei, twaalwa mweende na kwa vatemi na kwa gávana sa mʉlamʉrɨrwe. Ivi vyoosi nɨ sa irina raanɨ. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Ɨhɨ kʉvaheera ɨrɨ nkalo nyuunyu yo vabweeyya vataange kɨmaarɨ. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Maa kaa, mʉlamʉle kʉreka kwiitweetya mitimii yaanyu nɨ che mʉrɨ lʉʉsa mbere ya balása tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Sa nɨɨnɨ kʉvaheera neende masáare ya tooti ˆmeene mwɨɨndoolʉʉsa. Na masáare ayo, kusiina mʉvɨ waanyu ˆarɨ daha kuyuuyirya au kʉyasiita tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Varindʉkwa mweende baa nɨ vavyɨɨrɨ vaanyu, vaanaanyu, vandʉʉ vaanyu na vijeengi vyaanyu. Kei vamwɨ vaanyu, vaantʉ kʉvʉʉlaa veende. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Sʉʉlwa mʉrɨ nɨ vaantʉ voosi sa mwaanduma nɨɨnɨ. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Maa kaa, baa lʉjwɨ́ɨrɨ lʉmwɨ vii lwaanyu sɨ lʉrɨ rɨmɨra tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Ko yimirirya, lamurirya mʉrɨ nkaasʉ yaanyu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉsaambʉlwa kwa Yerusaléemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matáayo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maáriki 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉrɨ koona múuji wa Yerusaléemu warɨ́ɨngɨrɨɨrwe nɨ valʉkalʉka va vavɨ vaanyu, mʉtaange kʉsaambʉlwa kwaachwe kwaséngerɨɨre. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, vara ˆvarɨ <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char> vatɨjɨre njuulwii. Vara ˆvarɨ katɨ na katɨ ya múuji vafume na weerwii ya múuji. Na vara ˆvarɨ mawundii karɨ vɨɨngɨre na múujii tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Sa sikʉ ijo, kʉva jiri sikʉ ja irya, sa yara ˆyaandɨkwa yakiimane. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Nɨ mpolaɨ kwa vara ˆvarɨ kʉva varuto, na vara ˆvɨɨndookoonkya sikʉ ijo! Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, kʉva kʉrɨ na imalo ikʉʉlʉ kʉrɨ weerʉ yoosi, na nkalari ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ veera ɨrɨ mweeri ya vaantʉ va mbyaala ɨhɨ. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo kʉʉlawa varɨ na nyaasʉka, na vɨɨngɨ twaalwa varɨ na utúmwii ɨsɨ jɨɨngɨ. Na múuji wa Yerusaléemu kindaɨrɨrwa ʉrɨ nɨ vaantʉ sɨ ˆvarɨ <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char>, fʉʉrʉ mpɨɨndɨ jaavo jo kʉʉyɨmɨrɨra jisire.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kʉʉja kwa Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matáayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maáriki 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>Mwaasʉ, mweeri na nyényeeri koonekya viri isháara. Na kʉrɨ weerʉ, ɨsɨ kʉva jiri na uturikiri, mayɨya kʉva yarɨ na vidandárɨka na mapúunta makʉʉlʉ ˆyarɨ na mukíindo. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Vaantʉ kɨndooyɨrɨka veende sa woowa. Kiisea veende irya ikʉʉlʉ kʉʉja riise sa ngururu ja kurumwii sɨngɨsɨka jeende. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Aho, kʉmoona varɨ <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> yookʉʉja machwii na ngururu na nkongojima nkʉʉlʉ. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Mpɨɨndɨ aya ˆyarɨ kaanda fʉmɨra, mwɨɨme neeja na mʉve na cheerʉ sa <char style="w">ununuuli</char> waanyu waséngerɨɨre.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusímo lwa Mʉsaambu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matáayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maáriki 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Aho, akavavaɨra lusímo ʉlʉ, “Iririkani mʉsaambu na mɨtɨ yɨɨngɨ yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉrɨ koona yaándire tʉrɨka, mwatáangaa mpɨɨndɨ ja irʉtɨra jaséngerɨɨre.<verse eid="LUK 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Noo jeyyo, ˆmʉrɨ koona viintʉ ivi vyoofʉmɨra, taangi <char style="w">Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> waséngerɨɨre. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Kɨmaarɨ noovawyɨɨra, mbyaala ɨhɨ sɨ ɨrɨ looka tʉkʉ keende masáare aya yoosi sɨ yanafʉmɨra. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Kurumu na weerʉ looka jiri, maa kaa, masáare yaanɨ sɨ yarɨ looka vii kaa tʉkʉ.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mʉlaange Neeja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>Mʉlaange neeja, karɨ mɨtɨma yaanyu ɨremeerwe nɨ ʉreevi, ʉláku na uturikiri wa nkaasʉ ɨhɨ tʉkʉ. Bweeyyi jeyyo, sa sikʉ ya Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ kʉʉja ɨrɨ koonka na koonka. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Sikʉ ɨyo, kʉʉja ɨrɨ ja mʉteo kwa vaantʉ voosi va weerʉ. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Haaha mʉve miiso. Mʉndoomʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ sa avaheere ngururu jo nehera aya yoosi ˆyarɨ fʉmɨra. Aho, mʉdahe kwɨɨma mbere ya Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Kwa sikʉ joosi ijo, Yéesu akiindyáa vaantʉ Kaayii Njija. Na kyʉʉlwa ˆkɨkɨɨngɨre atamanyáa noo laala Luulwii lwa <char style="w">Mɨseitúuni</char>. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Na kɨra siikʉ vaantʉ valaaváa namʉtóondo noo mʉteerera Kaayii Njija.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Yʉ́ʉda Yoolamʉla Kʉmʉvalandʉka Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matáayo 26:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maáriki 14:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">10-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yooháani 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Haaha mpɨɨndɨ ja <char style="w">ngovi ya mɨkáate sɨ ˆɨvɨ́kɨrwaa ʉsasɨ</char> noo kʉsea <char style="w" lemma="Ngovi ya Paásika">Paásika</char> ɨjáa yaséngerɨɨre. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ijo, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> vasaakɨráa njɨra yo mʉʉlaa <char style="w">Yéesu</char>. Vabweeyya jeyyo sa vavoofáa vaantʉ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LUK 19:47-48">Lʉ́ka 19:47-48</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/><char style="w">Irimʉ</char> rɨkamwɨɨngɨra Yʉ́ʉda ˆaséwaa Isikarióoti, ʉmwɨ wa vapooji ikimi na vavɨrɨ va Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Aho, Yʉ́ʉda akatamanya na kwa vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva na vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va valʉkalʉka va <char style="w" lemma="Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva">Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</char>. Akiirʉmɨra novo ˆvyeene arɨ mʉvarindʉka sa vamʉkwaate. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Isáare ɨro rɨkaveerya mɨtɨma na vakiirʉmɨra kʉmʉrɨha mpía. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yʉ́ʉda akaruma na akaanda saakɨra njɨra yo mʉvarindʉka Yéesu mpɨɨndɨ kusiina mpuka ya vaantʉ.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwiimya Neeja Paásika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matáayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maáriki 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yooháani 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Sikʉ ya ngovi ya mɨkáate sɨ ˆɨvɨ́kɨrwaa ʉsasɨ ɨkafika. Sikʉ ɨyo noo muundi ˆɨrɨ mpeho sa Paásika yasɨɨnjwáa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 12:3-6">Ufumo 12:3-6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavatʉma vala <char style="w">Peéteri</char> na Yooháani akavasea, “Tamanyi, mʉkatwiimirye neeja chóorya cha Paásika, twiirye hamwɨ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Novo vakamuurya, “Hai woosaaka tukwiimirye neeja chóorya cha Paásika?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉrɨ kɨɨngɨra múujii, lʉmana mʉrɨ na mʉʉntʉ mʉlʉme ʉmwɨ iitíikire sʉvɨya ya maaji. Mutuubi ʉwo mʉʉntʉ mʉlʉme fʉʉrʉ nyuumba ˆarɨ kɨɨngɨra. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>ˆMʉrɨ kɨɨngɨra, mʉsei mweenenyuumba, ‘Mukiindya yookuurya, hai kɨrɨ chúumba cha vayeni kʉʉntʉ ˆndɨrɨ rɨɨra chóorya cha Paásika na vapooji vaanɨ?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Na yeeye kʉvoonekya arɨ, baanka nkʉʉlʉ ˆɨrɨ gorófii kwavɨɨkwa viintʉ vyoosi neeja. Iyimyi neeja Paásika haaho.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Aho, vakatamanya, ˆvakafike ʉko, vakashaana kɨra kɨɨntʉ ja ˆvyeene ajáa avawyɨ́ɨrɨɨre. Maa vakiimya neeja chóorya cha Paásika.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chóorya cha Mweenevyoosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matáayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maáriki 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Vakoríinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆjikafike, Yéesu akiikala méesii hamwɨ na <char style="w">vatumwi</char> vaachwe, kurya chóorya. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Aho, akavasea, “Namériirye matɨ maatʉkʉ vii, nirye chóorya cha Paásika na nyuunyu, de kuturikiriwa kwaanɨ kufike. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, sɨ ndɨrɨ kurya Paásika kei tʉkʉ, fʉʉrʉ sikʉ ˆɨrɨ kiimana <char style="w" lemma="Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ">Ʉtemii wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char>.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus at the table eating" file="CN01803B.TIF" size="col" copy="© 1996 David C. Cook" ref="22:14">Yéesu iíkyɨɨre méesii kurya chóorya</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Aho, akatoola ndʉvo, akamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, yoosea, “Tooli ndʉvo ɨhɨ voosi munywe! <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, kwaandɨra haaha sɨ ndɨrɨ kʉnywa kei <char style="w">diváai</char> tʉkʉ fʉʉrʉ Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ ˆʉrɨ kʉʉja.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Aho, akatoola mʉkáate, akamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, akʉʉbendʉlabendʉla akavaheera yoosea, “Ʉhʉ nɨ mʉvɨrɨ waanɨ ˆwootoolwa sa nyuunyu. Bweeyyi jei sa nkʉmbʉkɨra yaanɨ!” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Viivyo ˆvakahʉmʉle kurya, akatoola ndʉvo, akasea, “Ndʉvo ɨhɨ nɨ <char style="w">mʉháko</char> mufya wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ wa sakami yaanɨ ˆyookɨɨtɨka sa nyuunyu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Maa kaa, taangi, mʉʉntʉ ˆyookʉʉnvarindʉka amwaarɨ yoorya na nɨɨnɨ. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Kɨkomi <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> tamanya iise noo kʉʉlawa ja ˆvyeene Mʉlʉʉngʉ asaaka vive. Maa kaa, nɨ mpolaɨ kwa mʉʉntʉ ˆarɨ mʉvarindʉka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Aho, vakaanda kiiyurya voovo kwa voovo, “Nɨ ani kʉrɨ suusu ˆarɨ daha tʉmama isáare ɨrɨ?”<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɨ Ani noo Mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Vapooji va Yéesu vakaanda kwiiruta ndihi, nɨ ani katɨ na katɨ yaavo ˆarɨ mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Aho, Yéesu akavasea, “Vatemi va vaantʉ sɨ ˆvarɨ <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char> na vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ vaavo, vavɨɨ́mɨrɨraa vaantʉ vaavo na ngururu. Na kei, vara ˆvalaɨ́raa vatɨɨte wiimiriri mweeri yaavo, viiyánɨrɨraa nɨ vaambiriryi va vaantʉ. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Maa kaa, nyuunyu karɨ mwiifwaane novo tʉkʉ. Kɨrɨ vyoova jeyyo, mʉʉntʉ mʉkʉʉlʉ waanyu ave ja muduudi kʉlookya voosi. Kei, ʉra ˆarɨ mʉlongooli wa vaantʉ, ave ja mʉtʉmami waanyu. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Iririkani! Mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ nɨ arɨkwɨ? Nɨ ʉra ˆiíkalaa méesii kurya au nɨ ʉra ˆatʉ́mamɨraa vaantʉ méesii? Eri, sɨ ʉra ˆiíkalaa kurya tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Haaha nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ ʉmwɨ waanyu ja ʉra ˆavatʉ́mamɨraa vaantʉ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="JHN 13:1-20">Yooháani 13:1-20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Nyuunyu mwachaala na nɨɨnɨ sikʉ joosi ˆnayerwáa. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Haaha, ja ˆvyeene nɨɨnɨ naheewa Ʉtemi nɨ Taáta waanɨ, baa nɨɨnɨ nɨ kʉvaheera niise ʉtemi. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Jeyyo, kurya mweende no nywa méesii ya Ʉtemii waanɨ. Kei, kiikala mweende machuumbii ya kɨtemi na lamʉrɨra mweende nkolo ikimi na ivɨrɨ ja <char style="w" lemma="Viisiraéeli">Isiraéeli</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoolʉʉsa Peéteri Sea Arɨ sɨ Amʉmányire Tʉkʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matáayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maáriki 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yooháani 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Yéesu akasea, “<char style="w" lemma="Peéteri">Simóoni</char>, Simóoni, Irimʉ ralóombire sa rɨveere nyuunyu ja viintʉ murimi ˆeéraa ngáano. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Maa kaa, nakʉlóombɨɨre weewe Simóoni kuruma kwaako kʉdɨɨre keeheka. Na ˆʉrɨ kʉʉnhɨndʉkɨra, ʉvaheere mʉtɨma vaanaanyu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Peéteri akamʉsea, “Ee Mweenevyoosi, nɨɨnɨ nɨɨ́mɨre neeja kʉtwaalwa na mʉnyololwii hamwɨ na weewe, baa kukwya hamwɨ na weewe!” <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Peéteri, nookuwyɨɨra de nkʉkʉlʉme ɨvɨɨke uchikʉ wa isikʉ, kuunsiita ʉrɨ katatʉ woosea sɨ wʉʉmányire tʉkʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyimirirya Ʉfafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavuurya vapooji vaachwe, “ˆNkavatʉme bila mpía, bila mufuko wo kɨɨnjɨra na bila viráatʉ, mʉjáa mwasɨrɨrwa nɨ kɨɨntʉ wʉʉ?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LUK 10:4">Lʉ́ka 10:4</ref>.</char></note> Novo vakuuyirya vakasea, “Tʉkʉ, sɨ tasɨrɨrwa nɨ kɨɨntʉ chochoosi tʉkʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Aho, akavasea, “Haaha koonɨ mʉʉntʉ arɨ na mufuko wa mpía ʉʉsʉmʉle, na ʉra ˆarɨ na mufuko wo kɨɨnjɨra ʉʉsʉmʉle. Na ʉra ˆasiina nyaasʉka, avae iyoombe nkáancho yaachwe awʉle nyaasʉka. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Sa nɨ kʉvawyɨɨra niise, Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho nɨ mpaka yakiimane kʉrɨ nɨɨnɨ, ‘Avalwa hamwɨ na ˆvawúnaa miiro.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isáaya 53:12</ref>.</char></note> Kɨkomi yara ˆyaandɨkwa sa nɨɨnɨ nɨ kiimana yiise.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Vapooji vaachwe vakamʉsea, “Mʉkʉ́lʉ, laanga kwatɨɨte nyaasʉka ivɨrɨ aha.” Ne akavasea, “Yatóoshiirye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoomʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ Luulwii lwa Mɨseitúuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matáayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maáriki 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Hara, maa Yéesu akadoma na Luulwii lwa <char style="w">Mɨseitúuni</char> ja viintʉ ˆiijʉvɨra na vapooji vaachwe vajáa vamutúubire. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>ˆVakafike aho, maa akavasea vapooji vaachwe, “Mʉloombi Mʉlʉʉngʉ sa mʉdɨɨre kwɨɨngɨra mʉtehwii!”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Aho, akavareka kʉlɨ kʉlɨ ja iwʉmo ra iwye. Akachwaama akaanda kʉmʉloomba Mʉlʉʉngʉ <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>yoosea, “Taáta! Koonɨ viri kweerya mʉtɨma, nooloomba wʉʉnseyyirye ndʉvo ɨhɨ ya uturikiri. Maa kaa, karɨ vive ja ˆveene noosaaka tʉkʉ, vive ja ˆvyeene woosaaka weewe.” [<verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/><char style="w" lemma="Mirimʉ miija">Murimʉ mʉʉja</char> fuma kurumwii ʉkamʉfʉmɨra, maa ʉkamʉheera ngururu. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Yéesu akatuuba loomba mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ na ajáa atɨɨte uturikiri na alʉngʉrɨráa nɨ ʉsʉʉngʉ. Na mpɨɨndɨ ˆaloombáa, irʉtɨra raachwe rɨkava ja matóonti ya sakami yoowya na ɨsɨ.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Aho, akiinʉka hara kʉʉntʉ ˆamʉloombáa Ijʉva, akahɨndʉka na kwa vapooji vaachwe. Kʉra akavashaana valɨ́ɨre, sa vajáa vakátɨɨre sa viintʉ vajáa vaviswɨ́ɨre. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Akavuurya akavasea, “Sa che mʉnyéyyiirye? Inuki, mʉloombi Mʉlʉʉngʉ, karɨ jɨ mwɨɨngɨre mʉtehwii tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovarindʉkwa na Yookwaatwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matáayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maáriki 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yooháani 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Mpɨɨndɨ Yéesu ˆajáa akaarɨ yoolʉʉsɨka na vapooji vaachwe, mpuka ya vaantʉ ˆvalóngwɨɨrwe nɨ Yʉ́ʉda, ʉmwɨ wa vapooji vaachwe ikimi na vavɨrɨ, ɨkafika. Yʉ́ʉda akamʉseeserera Yéesu sa amʉsʉndɨre. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akamʉsea, “Aka Yʉ́ʉda! Eri, nɨ kʉmʉvarindʉka wiise Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ ko mʉnsʉndɨra wʉʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Vapooji va Yéesu ˆvakoone yara ˆyarɨ fʉmɨra, maa vakamuurya Yéesu, “Mʉkʉ́lʉ, tʉvatemeteme na nyaasʉka wʉʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Hahara, ʉmwɨ waavo akamʉtema na nyaasʉka mʉtʉmami wa <char style="w" lemma="Veeneɨsɨ">mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ</char>, kutu kwa kʉlʉme dúú.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akasea, “Reki!” Aho, akamʉsaasya kʉra kutu na ʉra mʉʉntʉ akahola.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Aho, maa Yéesu akavuurya vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va valʉkalʉka va Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva na vawosi ˆvajáa vuújire, “Nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ mʉhóki vaantʉ viintʉ muújire na nyaasʉka na nkusi wʉʉ? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Sikʉ joosi nɨjáa na nyuunyu waámii wa Kaaya Njija, maa kaa, kʉra sɨ mwaankwaatáa tʉkʉ. Haaha vyavɨ́ɨre mpɨɨndɨ jaanyu, mpɨɨndɨ mʉtemi wa kilwiirya ˆyookɨɨmɨrɨra!”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Peéteri Yoosea sɨ Amʉmányire Yéesu Tʉkʉ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matáayo 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maáriki 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yooháani 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Aho, vakamʉkwaata Yéesu, maa vakamʉtwaala fʉʉrʉ kaayii kwa mweeneɨsɨ mʉkʉʉlʉ. Peéteri ne akatuuba nyuma kwa kʉlɨ. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>ˆVakakorye mooto katɨkatɨ ya waama, maa vakiikala hamwɨ vookoota mooto. Peéteri ne akiikala hamwɨ novo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Mʉtʉmami ʉmwɨ wa kɨɨntʉ kiki akamoona Peéteri iíkyɨɨre hara mootwii. Akamʉlaanga neeja, maa akasea, “Baa mʉʉntʉ ʉhʉ nɨ hamwɨ aarɨ na Yéesu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Maa kaa, Peéteri akasiita yoosea, “Aka, mʉʉntʉ muki, sɨ namʉmányire tʉkʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ akamoona Peéteri, maa akamʉsea, “Baa weewe ʉrɨ ʉmwɨ waavo!” Maa kaa, Peéteri akasea, “We mʉʉntʉ we, nɨɨnɨ tʉkʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Ja isaa rɨmwɨ jei ˆrɨkalooke, mʉʉntʉ wɨɨngɨ akuumirirya yoosea, “Kɨkomi mʉʉntʉ ʉhʉ nɨ hamwɨ aarɨ ne sa baa yeeye woosi nɨ <char style="w" lemma="Galiláaya">Mʉgaliláaya</char>.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Aho, Peéteri akamʉsea, “We mʉʉntʉ we, sɨ nootaanga kɨra ˆwoolʉʉsa tʉkʉ!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Hahara viintʉ ˆalʉʉsáa masáare ayo, nkʉkʉlʉme ɨkavɨɨka. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Aho, Mweenevyoosi akiilorera, akamʉlaanga Peéteri. Peéteri akakʉmbʉkɨra masáare ˆmeene aarɨ awyɨ́ɨrɨɨrwe nɨ Mweenevyoosi, “Isikʉ nkʉkʉlʉme sɨ ɨnavɨɨka, sea ʉrɨ sɨ waamányire tʉkʉ katatʉ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Peéteri akafuma na weerwii, maa akɨɨta koorɨra maatʉkʉ vii.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Valʉkalʉka Voomʉhenchʉla Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matáayo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maáriki 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Vara vaantʉ ˆvamʉlaangiriryáa Yéesu vakaanda kʉmʉhenchʉla no mʉvaa. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Vakamuchuunga ntaamɨ miiswii, maa de vandoomʉhenchʉla voosea, “Hoonɨ taanga nɨ ani ˆakʉváire?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Vakatuuba <char style="w" lemma="Tʉkɨra">kʉmʉtʉkɨra</char> mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yootwaalwa na Mbere ya Balása Nkʉʉlʉ ya Vayahúudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matáayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maáriki 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yooháani 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>ˆKʉkamwaae, <char style="w">Balása Nkʉʉlʉ</char> ya vawosi, hamwɨ na vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva, na vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va vakiindya va Miiro vakalʉmana. Yéesu ne akareetwa na mbere yaavo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Aho, vakamuurya voosea, “Tʉwyɨɨre! Weewe noo <char style="w">Masía</char> wʉʉ?” Yéesu akavasea, “Baa koonɨ navawyɨ́ɨrɨɨre sɨ mʉrɨ ruma vii tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Kei baa koonɨ navuúriirye, sɨ mʉrɨ kuuyirya vii tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Maa kaa, kwaandɨra haaha Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ iíkyɨɨre mʉkono wa kʉlʉme wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ Mweenengururu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Aho, voosi vakamuurya, “Eri, weewe noo <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ</char> wʉʉ?” Yeeye akavasea, “Nyuunyu mulúusire nɨɨnɨ ndɨrɨ!”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Aho, maa vakasea, “Ʉshahíidi wɨɨngɨ ʉrɨkwɨ kei toosaaka kʉlookya ʉhʉ? Suusu veeneevyo tatéɨɨre fuma mʉlomwii waachwe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yootwaalwa na kwa Gávana Piláato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matáayo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maáriki 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yooháani 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Aho, <char style="w">Balása Nkʉʉlʉ</char> yoosi ya <char style="w">Vayahúudi</char> ikiinʉka, maa vakamʉtwaala <char style="w">Yéesu</char> na kwa <char style="w">Piláato</char>. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Vakaanda kumusitaakya voosea, “Tamʉteera ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ yookiindya vaantʉ vave vasaambʉ kʉrɨ ɨsɨ yiitʉ. Avakáanʼyaa vaantʉ vareke kʉrɨha kóodi kwa <char style="w">Kaisáari</char>, kei aséaa yeeye noo <char style="w">Masía</char>, na nɨ Mʉtemi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Jeyyo Piláato akamuurya Yéesu, “Weewe noo mʉtemi wa Vayahúudi wʉʉ?” Yéesu akasea, “Weewe ulúusire.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Aho, Piláato akavasea vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva na mpuka ya vaantʉ, “Sɨ nookoona ʉvɨ wa ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ tʉkʉ!”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Maa kaa, voovo vakuumirirya voosea, “Ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ yoosoonka vaantʉ kwa ukiindya waachwe kwa ɨsɨ yoosi ya Vayahúudi. Aandɨra ʉko <char style="w">Galiláaya</char> mpaka afíkire kʉnʉ Yerusaléemu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Mbere ya Heróode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Piláato ˆakateere ayo, maa akuurya, “Ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ nɨ Mʉgaliláaya wʉʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>ˆAkataange Yéesu nɨ mʉʉntʉ wa Galiláaya, maa akamʉtwaala na kwa <char style="w">Heróode</char>. Heróode noo ajáa mʉtemi wa Galiláaya na mpɨɨndɨ ijo nɨ Yerusaléemu ajáa.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Heróode ˆakamoone Yéesu, akavyeenda maatʉkʉ vii sa ajáa ateera masáare Yéesu ˆatʉmamáa, sa jeyyo, asaakáa kʉmoona Yéesu kwa sikʉ ˆjiri foo. Kei, ajáa atɨɨte mpɨɨma yo moona Yéesu yootʉmama isháara na myuujíisa ˆyiísimiresimire. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Aho, akamuurya Yéesu masáare ˆyarɨ foo, maa kaa, Yéesu sɨ uuyirya kɨɨntʉ chochoosi tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva na <char style="w">vakiindya va Miiro</char> vajáa viímire voomusitaakya Yéesu na ngururu.<verse eid="LUK 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Heróode na valwi nkoondo vaachwe vakaanda kʉmʉhenchʉla Yéesu no mʉbwɨɨtɨra. Vakamʉvɨkɨra ɨngo ja kɨtemi, maa vakamʉhɨndʉla na kwa Piláato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Keende sikʉ ɨyo, Heróode na Piláato vakava vijeengi. De ayo yafʉmɨre Piláato na Heróode nɨ ja kúri na nyaáu vajáa.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Mbere ya Piláato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matáayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maáriki 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:38-19:16">Yooháani 18:38–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi, Piláato akavaanɨrɨra vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va veeneɨsɨ va Ijʉva, vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va Vayahúudi na vaantʉ vɨɨngɨ. <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>Aho, akavasea, “Nyuunyu mʉmʉréetire ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ na kwaanɨ na mʉséire yoovakiindya vaantʉ vave vasaambʉ. Haaha nɨɨnɨ namuchúkurumire mbere yaanyu, maa kaa, nɨɨ́ne asiina ʉvɨ tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Baa Heróode sɨ ɨɨ́ne isáare roroosi tʉkʉ ro mʉlamʉrɨra mʉʉntʉ ʉhʉ, na noo ˆchooreka amʉhɨ́ndwɨɨre na kʉrɨ suusu. Ja ˆvyeene mookoona kusiina kɨɨntʉ chochoosi ˆcheene mʉʉntʉ ʉhʉ atʉ́mamire ˆchoobweeya ɨɨme neeja kukwya tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Haaha nɨ lairirya niise avawe <char style="w">mɨjeléedi</char>, maa de nɨmʉrekere.” [<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Piláato ajáa atɨɨte tʉʉva yo mʉchʉngʉrɨra mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆachuungwa mpɨɨndɨ ja <char style="w">ngovi ya Paásika</char>.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Aho, vaantʉ voosi vakatʉla isóso na ngururu voosea, “Mʉʉntʉ ʉwo ʉʉlawe, tʉchʉngʉrɨre Baráaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Ʉhʉ Baráaba ajáa achuungwa sa ntiribʉka ˆngʼeene ajáa abweeyya múujii na so kʉʉlaa mʉʉntʉ.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Piláato asaakáa kʉmʉrekera Yéesu, sa jeyyo, akalʉʉsɨka kei na vaantʉ. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Maa kaa, voovo vakatuuba tʉla isóso voosea, “Muningʼinʼye <char style="w" lemma="Mʉsaláaba">mʉsaláabii</char> fʉʉrʉ akwye, muningʼinʼye mʉsaláabii fʉʉrʉ akwye!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Lwa katatʉ Piláato akavuurya, “Sa che? Nɨ ʉvɨ ʉrɨkwɨ ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ ˆabwéeyyiirye? Nɨɨnɨ sɨ nɨɨ́ne ʉvɨ wowoosi wo bweeyya ʉʉlawe tʉkʉ. Sa jeyyo, lairirya niise avawe mɨjeléedi, maa de nɨmʉrekere.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Maa kaa, vaantʉ vakatuuba tʉla isóso mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, voosaaka Yéesu aningʼiniwe mʉsaláabii fʉʉrʉ akwye. Jeyyo, isóso raavo rɨkasiinda.<verse eid="LUK 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Aho, Piláato akalamʉla kʉbweeyya ja ˆvyeene vasaakáa. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Piláato akamʉchʉngʉrɨra ʉra mʉʉntʉ ˆvamʉsaakáa, ˆajáa achuungwa so reeta ntiribʉka na so kʉʉlaa. Akamʉkwaatya Yéesu mɨkonwii ya valwi nkoondo vaachwe va Kɨrúumi, sa vamʉbweeyyirye ja ˆvyeene Vayahúudi vasaakáa.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yooningʼiniwa Mʉsaláabii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matáayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maáriki 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yooháani 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Njirii, mpɨɨndɨ ˆvamʉtwaaláa Yéesu noo muningʼinʼya, vakalʉmana na mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆaséwaa Simóoni, mʉʉntʉ wa múuji wa Kɨréene.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:26 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kɨréene: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ʉhʉ nɨ múuji ˆʉjáa kʉra Afɨrɨka kaskasíini. Ʉko Vayahúudi ˆvarɨ foo viikaláa, baa Simóoni nɨ ʉmwɨ wa Vayahúudi ˆveene vʉʉjáa na Yerusaléemu na ngovii ya Paásika.</char></note> Yeeye nɨ iwundii afumáa. Valwi nkoondo vakamʉkwaata, vakamʉdoomererya avereke mʉsaláaba nyuma ya Yéesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Vaantʉ ˆvarɨ foo vamutuubáa Yéesu. Vamwɨ va vaantʉ avo, nɨ vaantʉ vaki ˆveene vamʉrɨrɨráa no myaaha. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yéesu akiilorera, akavasea, “Nyuunyu vahíínja va Yerusaléemu, kuundiriri nɨɨnɨ tʉkʉ! Iririri nyuunyu na vaana vaanyu! <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Laangi, fika jiri mpɨɨndɨ vaantʉ lʉʉsa varɨ, ‘Vatalariwa ˆvawuumba, vara sɨ ˆvavyaala na vara masʉʉsʉ yaavo sɨ ˆyoonkwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Aho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">‘Kujisea varɨ njʉʉlʉ “Tuwyiiri!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">Na viduunda “Tukunikiriri!”’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hósea 10:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Sa koonɨ vookʉʉbweeyyirya jei mʉtɨ ˆʉrɨ ɨcho, nɨ joolɨ viri kʉva kwa mʉtɨ ˆwʉʉma?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte viívi vavɨrɨ ˆvatwaalwáa sa vakʉʉlawe hamwɨ na Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>ˆVakafike haantʉ ˆhaséwaa Kɨsááya cha Mʉtwe, vakamuningʼinʼya Yéesu mʉsaláabii hamwɨ na viívi vavɨrɨ, ʉmwɨ mʉkono wa kʉlʉme na wɨɨngɨ mʉkono wa kʉmooso, kɨra mʉʉntʉ mʉsaláabii waachwe.<figure style="fig" file="WA03926b.tif" size="col" copy="United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya" ref="23:33">Yéesu aníngʼiniiwe mʉsaláabii</figure> <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yéesu akasea, “Taáta, vasee ʉvɨ waavo wasírire sa sɨ vootaanga kɨra ˆvootʉmama tʉkʉ.” Vakiigavɨra ɨngo jaachwe ko jivaɨra mbare.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Vaantʉ vakɨɨma aho, kʉnʉ voomʉlaanga. Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va Vayahúudi vakaanda mʉhenchʉla voosea, “Avalamuriryáa vɨɨngɨ, koonɨ yeeye nɨ Masía ˆasaawʉlwa nɨ Mʉlʉʉngʉ nɨ iilamurirye yeemweene!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Valwi nkoondo novo vakʉʉja, vakamʉhenchʉla, maa vakamʉretera <char style="w">diváai</char> ˆyasasʉka sa anywe. <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Vakamʉsea, “Koonɨ kɨkomi weewe noo mʉtemi wa Vayahúudi, ilamurirye weemweene!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Mweeri yaachwe masáare aya yajáa yaandɨkwa ibambarii, “<char style="sc">Ʉhʉ noo mʉtemi wa Vayahúudi</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Ʉmwɨ wa vara viívi ˆvajáa vaníngʼiniiwe ne <char style="w" lemma="Tʉkɨra">akamʉtʉkɨra</char> yoosea, “Weewe sɨ noo Masía? Ilamurirye sa ʉtʉlamurirye na suusu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Maa kaa, ʉra mwiívi wɨɨngɨ akamʉdalavya yoosea, “Eri, weewe sɨ ʉmoófaa Mʉlʉʉngʉ tʉkʉ wʉʉ? Amwɨ voosi tahɨ́ɨwe irya rɨɨro? <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Suusu, tahókɨɨre ɨrɨ irya ja ˆvyeene <char style="w">Miiro</char> yalʉʉsa sa vira ˆvyeene tabwéeyyaa. Maa kaa, ʉhʉ mʉʉntʉ sɨ abwéeyyiirye ʉvɨ wowoosi tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Aho akasea, “Ee Yéesu, nkʉmbʉkɨra mpɨɨndɨ ˆʉrɨ kɨɨngɨra <char style="w" lemma="Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ">Ʉtemii</char> waako!” <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yéesu akamʉsea, “Kɨkomi nookuwyɨɨra, isikʉ kʉva ʉrɨ hamwɨ na nɨɨnɨ ntindikii njija.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yookwya Mʉsaláabii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matáayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maáriki 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yooháani 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ijo, nɨ ja mpɨɨndɨ ja mpoloonge jijáa, mwaasʉ ʉkarima fʉʉrʉ mpɨɨndɨ ja cháámuusi, kilwiirya kɨkakʉnɨkɨrɨra ɨsɨ yoosi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Mwaasʉ ʉkareka korera. <char style="w">Ipasía ra Kaaya Njija</char> ya Ijʉva rɨkaatʉka katɨ na katɨ havɨrɨ.<verse eid="LUK 23:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yéesu akalʉʉsɨka na ngururu, yoosea, “Taáta, mɨkonwii yaako mʉtɨma waanɨ nuuvíikire.” ˆAkalʉʉse ayo, akawulala.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Mʉkʉ́ʉ́lʉ wa valwi nkoondo ˆakoone ayo ˆyafʉ́mɨɨre, akamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ yoosea, “Kɨkomi mʉʉntʉ ʉhʉ nɨ mʉwoloki aarɨ.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Na vaantʉ voosi ˆvajáa viijíingire hara kʉlaanga masáare aya ˆvakoone ayo ˆmeene yajáa yafʉ́mɨɨre, vakahɨndʉka na kaayii kwaavo kʉnʉ vookiivaavaa kɨpeembe nɨ ʉsʉʉngʉ. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Maa kaa, vara ˆvajáa vamʉmányire neeja na vara vaantʉ vaki ˆveene ajáa ʉʉjanʼya novo fuma Galiláaya, vajáa vɨɨma kʉlɨ, kʉnʉ voolaanga ayo masáare.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yootaahwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matáayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maáriki 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yooháani 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Haaha kʉjáa kwatɨɨte mʉʉntʉ ʉmwɨ ˆajáa mʉʉja na mʉwoloki ˆasewáa Yooséefu. Yeeye nɨ ʉmwɨ wa Balása Nkʉʉlʉ ya Vayahúudi ajáa. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Ʉhʉ Yooséefu, meevo nɨ múujii wa Arimatáaya ˆʉrɨ ɨsɨ ya <char style="w" lemma="Vayahúudi">Yudéea</char> kʉjáa. Yeeye awoojeráa kʉʉja kwa Ʉtemi wa Mʉlʉʉngʉ. Sikʉ ɨyo, yeeye sɨ ajáa arúmire ʉlamuli wa viivaachwe wo mʉʉlaa Yéesu tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Yooséefu akatamanya na kwa Piláato, akɨtooloomba aheewe mʉvɨrɨ wa Yéesu sa akʉʉtaahe. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Akuukiimya mʉvɨrɨ wa Yéesu, akʉʉfarɨmbɨrɨra na sáanda ya <char style="w">kɨtáani</char>, maa akɨɨta kʉʉtaaha <char style="w" lemma="Mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra">mbiríírii</char> ɨjáa sɨ ˆɨnataahwa mʉʉntʉ. Ɨhɨ mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra nɨ ja mpaanga ɨjáa na ɨjáa yabokwa mwaalaliwyii. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Sikʉ ɨyo, nɨ sikʉ yo kiimya neeja sikʉ ya <char style="w">Sabáato</char> ɨjáa na Sabáato ɨjáa yaséngerɨɨre kwaanda.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Vaantʉ vaki vara ˆvajáa vʉʉjanʼya na Yéesu fuma Galiláaya, vajáa vamutuuba Yooséefu na mbiríírii. Sa jeyyo, vakɨɨyona ɨra mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra na mʉvɨrɨ wa Yéesu haantʉ ˆʉjáa ʉláariiwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Aho, vakahɨndʉka na kaayii, vakɨɨta kiimya neeja makuta na mooda wo haka mʉvɨrɨ. Sikʉ ya Sabáato vakahʉmʉlʉka ja ˆvyeene ʉlairiri wa Ijʉva walʉʉsa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">Ufumo 20:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-15">Nkʉmbʉkɨra ya Miiro 5:12-15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Kʉfʉfʉka kwa Yéesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matáayo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maáriki 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yooháani 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Haaha sikʉ ya Jumapɨ́ɨrɨ namʉtóondo dwɨɨ, vara vaantʉ vaki vajáa vatoola makuta yara ˆvajáa viimiiryé neeja, maa vakadoma na <char style="w" lemma="Mbɨrɨ́ɨ́ra">mbiríírii</char> ya mpaanga ˆngʼeene ɨjáa yabokwa mwaalaliwyii. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>ˆVakafike kʉra, vakashaana rɨra iwye rafíngiritiiwe fuma mbiríírii. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Maa kaa, ˆvakɨɨngɨre na mbiríírii, sɨ vashaana mʉvɨrɨ wa <char style="w">Yéesu</char> Mweenevyoosi tʉkʉ. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Ntɨ ˆvakaarɨ vahwáalɨɨre, koonka vaantʉ valʉme vavɨrɨ viivɨ́kɨɨre ɨngo njerʉ ˆjilavalava mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ ja lʉlávo vakafʉmɨra, maa vakɨɨma heehi novo.<verse eid="LUK 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Avo vaantʉ vaki vakoofa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ, vakiinamya mɨtwe yaavo fʉʉrʉ ɨsɨ. Aho, vara vaantʉ vakavasea, “Sa che moomʉsaakɨra ˆarɨ mooyo kwa vaantʉ ˆvaakwya? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Asiina aha tʉkʉ, afúfukire! Kumbukiri vira ˆvyeene avawyɨɨra mpɨɨndɨ ˆajáa hamwɨ na nyuunyu kʉra <char style="w">Galiláaya</char>. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>Ajáa avasea, ‘Vyasaakwa <char style="w">Mwaana wa Mʉʉntʉ</char> avɨɨkwe mɨkonwii ya vaantʉ vavɨ, aningʼiniwe <char style="w" lemma="Mʉsaláaba">mʉsaláabii</char> fʉʉrʉ akwye, na sikʉ ya katatʉ afʉfʉke.’”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Laanga <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lʉ́ka 9:22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Aho, vakayakʉmbʉkɨra yara masáare Yéesu ˆajáa avawyɨɨra. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Avo vaantʉ vaki vakahɨndʉka fuma mbiríírii. Vakɨɨta koo vawyɨɨra isimwi ɨrɨ vara <char style="w">vatumwi</char> ikimi na ʉmwɨ baa na vapooji vɨɨngɨ voosi va Yéesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Avo vaantʉ vaki marina yaavo noo vala <char style="w">Maríia Makɨdaléena</char>, Yooáana na Maríia íyo waala Yaakúupu. Kei kʉjáa kwatɨɨte vaantʉ vaki vɨɨngɨ ˆvajáa hamwɨ novo, na ava noo vavawyɨɨra vatumwi masáare aya. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Maa kaa, sɨ varuma ayo masáare tʉkʉ, vakoona nɨ ya kɨhoho vii. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Baa neembe nɨ jeyyo, <char style="w">Peéteri</char> akiinʉka, akatamanya itɨ́ɨjo fʉʉrʉ mbiríírii. ˆAkasʉngɨrɨre akoona ɨngo ja <char style="w">kɨtáani</char> joongʼeene vii. Akahɨndʉka na kaayii kʉnʉ yookiiyurya kɨra ˆkɨfʉ́mɨɨre.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vapooji Vavɨrɨ Voodoma na Emáau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maáriki 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Haaha sikʉ ɨyo, kʉjáa kwatɨɨte vapooji vavɨrɨ va Yéesu ˆvatamanyáa na iturii rɨmwɨ ˆraséwaa Emáau. Kufuma Yerusaléemu fʉʉrʉ Emáau nɨ ja lʉyeendo lwa masaa yavɨrɨ. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Na mpɨɨndɨ ˆvajáa njirii, vakava vookiivaɨra mbuwo ja masáare ˆmeene yafʉmɨɨré. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvajáa vakaarɨ voolʉʉsɨka ayo, Yéesu mweeneevyo akavakwaata, maa akaanda yeendanʼya novo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Maa kaa, miiso yaavo yakakʉnɨkɨrɨrwa vadɨɨre kʉmʉtaanga.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yeeye akavuurya, “Nɨ mbuwo che mʉkɨtookiivaɨra mpɨɨndɨ ˆmooyeenda?” Avo vamaka vakɨɨma kʉnʉ vaviswɨ́ɨre. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Ʉmwɨ waavo ˆasewáa Kɨleóopa akamuurya, “Weewe vii noo mʉyeni sɨ ˆʉmányire masáare ˆyafʉmɨɨré aha Yerusaléemu sikʉ iji wʉʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Maa Yéesu akavuurya, “Nɨ masáare yarɨkwɨ ayo?” Novo vakamʉsea, “Masáare ya Yéesu wa Nasaréeti. Yeeye nɨ <char style="w" lemma="Valáali na mʉtwe">mʉláali na mʉtwe</char> ajáa, kei ajáa atɨɨte lʉvɨro lʉkʉʉlʉ mirimwii yaachwe na masáarii yaachwe mbere ya Mʉlʉʉngʉ na vaantʉ voosi. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va <char style="w">veeneɨsɨ</char> va Ijʉva na vakʉ́ʉ́lʉ va aha mɨɨtʉ, vamʉkwaatya mɨkonwii ya <char style="w">Piláato</char> sa aheewe irya ro kwya, maa akaningʼiniwa mʉsaláabii fʉʉrʉ akakwya. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Maa kaa, ʉhʉ noo tiilaangyáa <char style="w" lemma="Ununuuli">tununuula</char> arɨ suusu <char style="w">Viisiraéeli</char> fuma kwa vavɨ viitʉ. Kʉlookya ayo, isikʉ nɨ sikʉ ya katatʉ keende ayo ˆyafʉmɨra.<verse eid="LUK 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Kei kwatɨɨte vaantʉ vaki va mpuka yiiswi ˆvatʉhwáaliirye isikʉ. Voovo vaarɨ valáavire na mbiríírii. <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Ʉko mbiríírii, sɨ vʉʉshɨ́hɨɨne mʉvɨrɨ wa Yéesu tʉkʉ. ˆVakahɨndʉke, vatʉséire, vafʉ́mɨɨrwe nɨ <char style="w">mirimʉ miija</char> na yavaséire, ‘Yéesu nɨ mooyo arɨ.’ <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Aho, vamwɨ va vaantʉ valʉme va mpuka yiiswi vadómire itɨ́ɨjo na mbiríírii na vashɨ́hɨɨne ja ˆvyeene vawyɨ́ɨrɨɨrwe nɨ vara vaantʉ vaki. Maa kaa, voovo sɨ vamwɨɨ́ne Yéesu tʉkʉ.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Yéesu akavasea, “Aka re nyuunyu mʉrɨ vahoho! Sa che mɨtɨma yaanyu yafafa jei kuruma masáare yoosi ˆyalʉʉswa nɨ valáali na mʉtwe va Ijʉva? <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Eri, sɨ vijáa vyasaakwa <char style="w">Masía</char> aturikiriwe kwa njɨra ɨyo, maa de ɨɨngɨre nkongojimii yaachwe tʉkʉ wʉʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Akavavariyʉrɨra masáare yoosi ˆyarɨ Masáarii ˆYarɨ Mpeho ˆmeene yalʉʉswa kʉrɨ yeeye. Akalʉʉsa kwaandɨra masáarii ya <char style="w">Mʉ́sa</char> fʉʉrʉ masáarii yoosi ya valáali na mʉtwe.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>ˆVakasengerere kufika rɨra ituri kʉʉntʉ ˆvadomáa, Yéesu akabweeyya ja yoolookanirya na mbere. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Maa kaa, voovo vakamʉheemba voosea, “Laala aha mɨɨtʉ, amwɨ iwʉlo rɨɨ́ngɨɨre nuuchikʉ wafíkire?” Jeyyo Yéesu akatamanyanʼya novo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Yéesu ˆakiikale novo méesii kurya chákurya, akatoola mʉkáate, akamʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ, akʉʉbendʉlabendʉla, maa akavaheera. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Hahara, miiso yaavo yakakʉnʉkʉlwa, maa vakamʉtaanga nɨ Yéesu. Ne hahara akarɨmɨra mbere yaavo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Aho, vakiiyurya voosea, “Mɨtɨma yiiswi sɨ yaarɨ ɨkórɨɨre mpɨɨndɨ ˆaatʉvariyʉrɨra no tʉlaɨra Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho kʉra njirii tʉkʉ wʉʉ?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Mpɨɨndɨ jijira vakahɨndʉka na Yerusaléemu. Kʉra, vakavashaana vapooji vaachwe ikimi na ʉmwɨ viijíingire hamwɨ baa na vɨɨngɨ. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Novo vaseáa, “Mweenevyoosi afúfukire kɨkomi! Amʉfʉ́mɨɨre <char style="w" lemma="Peéteri">Simóoni</char>!” <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Aho, vara vapooji vavɨrɨ novo vakalʉʉsa masáare ˆyavafʉ́mɨɨre njirii, na ˆvyeene vamʉtáangire Yéesu ˆakabendʉlebendʉle mʉkáate, de akavaheera.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoovafʉmɨra Vapooji Vaachwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matáayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maáriki 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yooháani 20:19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆvajáa vakaarɨ voolʉʉsɨka ayo, Yéesu mweeneevyo akɨɨma katɨkatɨ yaavo akavasea, “Mwiikalo mʉʉja ʉve na nyuunyu!” <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Vakiivʉndʉka na vakoofa mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ sa viiseáa vɨɨ́ne murimʉ.<verse eid="LUK 24:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Maa kaa, Yéesu akavuurya, “Sa che mookoofa? Sa che mʉrɨ na kivundu mitimii yaanyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Laangi mayaanja yaanɨ na majeo yaanɨ, sa mʉtaange koonɨ kɨkomi nɨ nɨɨnɨ. Nsaasyi moone, sa murimʉ usiina mʉvɨrɨ tʉkʉ na makúfa tʉkʉ ja ˆvyeene mookʉʉnyona natɨɨte.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>ˆAkahʉmʉle kʉvawyɨɨra masáare ayo, akavalaɨra mayaanja yaachwe na majeo yaachwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Vapooji vaachwe vakavyeenda maatʉkʉ vii mpaka vakasiindwa baa kuruma yara ˆvoonáa. Aho, akavuurya, “Mwatɨɨte chóorya chochoosi aha wʉʉ?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Voovo vakamʉheera ibéendʉ ra soompa ˆyookiwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Yeeye akahokera, maa akarya mbere yaavo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Aho, akavasea, “Aya noo masáare ˆnavawyɨɨráa mpɨɨndɨ ˆnɨjáa na nyuunyu. Nɨjáa navasea, kɨra kɨɨntʉ ˆchaandɨkwa kʉrɨ nɨɨnɨ <char style="w" lemma="Miiro">Miirwii</char> ya Mʉ́sa, vitáabwii vya valáali na mʉtwe na Sabúurii nɨ mpaka kiikiimane.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Aho, akachʉngʉla mɨryʉʉngʉ yaavo sa vadahe kʉtaanga Masáare ˆYarɨ Mpeho. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Akavasea, “Ayo noo yaandɨkwa, Masía turikiriwa arɨ na sikʉ ya katatʉ fʉfʉka arɨ fuma inkwyii. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Kei kwa irina raachwe, vaantʉ va ɨsɨ joosi kwaandɨra Yerusaléemu variyʉrɨrwa varɨ <char style="w" lemma="Valandʉka">vavalandʉke</char> fuma uvii waavo, na vasewe ʉvɨ waavo wasírire. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Nyuunyu noo mashahíidi va aya masáare.<verse eid="LUK 24:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Laangi! Nɨɨnɨ mʉtʉma ndɨrɨ kʉrɨ nyuunyu <char style="w">Mʉtɨma Mʉʉja</char> Taáta waanɨ ˆajáa iichuunga kʉvaretera arɨ. Haaha, ikali aha Yerusaléemu fʉʉrʉ mpɨɨndɨ ˆmʉrɨ heewa ngururu fuma kurumwii.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yéesu Yoosʉmʉlwa na Kurumwii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maáriki 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mɨrɨmo ya Vatumwi 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Mpɨɨndɨ kiduudi, Yéesu akavasʉmʉla na weerwii ya múuji fʉʉrʉ iturii ra Besanía. Akiinurirya mɨkono yaachwe, akavatalarya. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Mpɨɨndɨ ˆavatalaryáa, akavareka, maa akasʉmʉlwa na kurumwii. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Aho, vakamwiinamɨra, maa vakahɨndʉka na Yerusaléemu kʉnʉ vavyeéndire mʉnʉmʉʉnʉ. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Sikʉ joosi vakiikala <char style="w" lemma="Kaaya Njija ya Ijʉva">Kaayii Njija ya Ijʉva</char>, kʉnʉ voomʉdʉʉmba Mʉlʉʉngʉ.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
